<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Odiyifo Yeremia Nhoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yer</para>
  <para style="mt2">Odiyifo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1"/>Nsɛm a efi Yeremia nkyɛn ni. Yeremia yɛ Hilkia babarima a na ɔyɛ Anatot asɔfo no mu baako wɔ Benyamin asase so. <verse eid="JER 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn wɔ Yosia a ɔyɛ Yuda hene Amon babarima adedi afe a ɛto so dumiɛnsa no mu. <verse eid="JER 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3"/>Ɛtoaa so wɔ Yuda hene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim bere so, kosii Yuda hene Yosia babarima Sedekia bere so a nnipa a wɔte Yerusalem kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ adedi no afe a ɛto so dubaako no ɔsram a ɛto so anum no mu.<verse eid="JER 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se,<verse eid="JER 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5"/>“Ansa na mereyɛ wo wɔ awotwaa mu no na minim wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">ansa na wɔrebɛwo wo no, miyii wo sii nkyɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">meyɛɛ wo odiyifo maa aman no.”<verse eid="JER 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6"/>Mekae se, “Aa, Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> minnim kasa; meyɛ abofra.”<verse eid="JER 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Nka se ‘meyɛ abofra.’ Ɛsɛ sɛ wokɔ obiara a mɛsoma wo no nkyɛn na woka asɛm biara a mɛhyɛ wo sɛ ka no. <verse eid="JER 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8"/>Nsuro wɔn, efisɛ meka wo ho, na magye wo,” nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> teɛɛ ne nsa de kaa mʼano na ɔka kyerɛɛ me se, “Mprempren mede me nsɛm ahyɛ wʼanom. <verse eid="JER 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10"/>Hwɛ, nnɛ, mede wo asi aman ne ahenni so sɛ, tutu na dwiriw gu, sɛe na tu gu, kyekyere na dua.”<verse eid="JER 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se, “Dɛn na wuhu yi, Yeremia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Na mibuae se, “Mihu ɔsonkoran dubaa.”<verse eid="JER 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Wahu no yiye, na merehwɛ anim sɛ mʼasɛm bɛba mu.”<verse eid="JER 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio se, “Dɛn na wuhu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Mibuae se, “Mihu kuku a ɛrehuru sɛ ano rekyea akyerɛ yɛn fi atifi fam.”<verse eid="JER 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Wobefi atifi fam de amanehunu aba wɔn a wɔte asase no so nyinaa so. <verse eid="JER 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15"/>Merebɛfrɛ atifi ahenni mu nnipa nyinaa,” nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">“Wɔn ahemfo de wɔn ahengua bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">abesisi Yerusalem kuropɔn apon ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">wɔbɛtow ahyɛ nʼafasu a atwa ahyia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">ne Yuda nkurow nyinaa so.<verse eid="JER 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16"/>Mebu me nkurɔfo atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">wɔ wɔn amumɔyɛ sɛ wɔagyaw me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">sɛ wɔhyew nnuhuam ma anyame afoforo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">na wɔkotow sɔre nea wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ.<verse eid="JER 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17"/>“Siesie wo ho! Sɔre na ka nea mɛka akyerɛ wo biara kyerɛ wɔn. Mma wɔmmmɔ wo hu, anyɛ saa a mɛma woabɔ hu wɔ wɔn anim. <verse eid="JER 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18"/>Nnɛ, mayɛ wo kuropɔn a ɛwɔ bammɔ, dadedum ne kɔbere fasu sɛ wobɛsɔre atia asase no nyinaa, Yuda ahemfo, nʼadwumayɛfo, asɔfo ne nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so. <verse eid="JER 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19"/>Wɔbɛko atia wo, nanso wɔrentumi nni wo so nkonim, efisɛ meka wo ho na megye wo,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 1:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Pa Onyankopɔn Akyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me so: <verse eid="JER 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2"/>“Kɔpae mu ka ma Yerusalem nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">“ ‘Mekae sɛnea wode wo ho maa me wo mmabun bere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">sɛnea wodɔɔ me wɔ wʼayeforo bere mu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">na wudii mʼakyi wɔ sare so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">asase a wonnuaa hwee wɔ so no.<verse eid="JER 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3"/>Na Israel yɛ kronkron ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">ne twabere mu aduankan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">wɔn a wodii nʼani no wobuu wɔn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">na amanehunu baa wɔn so,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, se ni.<verse eid="JER 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4"/>Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yakob asefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:4">mo Israel mmusuakuw nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5"/>Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Mfomso bɛn na mo agyanom huu wɔ me ho a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">ɛma wɔtwee wɔn ho kɔɔ akyirikyiri sɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Wodii ahoni a wɔn so nni mfaso akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">maa wɔn ankasa bɛyɛɛ ahuhufo.<verse eid="JER 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6"/>Wɔammisa se, ‘Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">Nea oyii yɛn fii Misraim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">na ɔde yɛn faa sare wosee so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">nweatam ne abonabon asase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">a awo na ayɛ owubon no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">Asase a obiara mfa so na obiara nte so no.’<verse eid="JER 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7"/>Mede mo beduaa asasebere so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">sɛ munni so nnuaba ne ɛso nnepa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Nanso mubeguu mʼasase ho fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">na moyɛɛ mʼagyapade akyiwade.<verse eid="JER 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8"/>Asɔfo no ammisa se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">‘Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Wɔn a wɔde mmara yɛ adwuma no anhwehwɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">ntuanofo sɔre tiaa me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Adiyifo no de Baal hyɛɛ nkɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">na wodii ahoni huhuw akyi.<verse eid="JER 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9"/>“Ɛno nti, merebɔ mo kwaadu bio,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">“Na mɛbɔ mo mma mma kwaadu.<verse eid="JER 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10"/>Muntwa nkɔ Kitim mpoano nkɔhwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">monsoma nkɔ Kedar nkɔhwehwɛ mu yiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">monhwɛ sɛ biribi a ɛte sɛɛ asi wɔ hɔ:<verse eid="JER 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11"/>Ɔman bi asesa wɔn anyame pɛn ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">Nso wɔnnyɛ anyame mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Nanso me nkurɔfo de wɔn anuonyam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">asesa ahoni huhuw.<verse eid="JER 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12"/>Mo ɔsorosoro, momma mo ho nnwiriw mo wɔ eyi ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">na mo ho nwosow wɔ akomatu mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13"/>“Me nkurɔfo ayɛ bɔne ahorow abien:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Wɔapa me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">me a meyɛ nkwa asubura no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">na wɔatutu wɔn ankasa mmura amoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">mmura a apaapae a entumi nkora nsu.<verse eid="JER 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14"/>Israel yɛ akoa anaa ɔsomfo fi awo mu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">Adɛn nti na wayɛ asade yi?<verse eid="JER 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15"/>Gyata abobɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">wɔaworo so akyerɛ no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Wɔama nʼasase ada mpan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">wɔahyehyew ne nkurow ayɛ no amamfo.<verse eid="JER 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16"/>Afei Memfis ne Tapanhes mmarima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">ayi wo ti so nwi.<verse eid="JER 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17"/>Ɛnyɛ wo na woama eyi aba wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">sɛ wopaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Nyankopɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">wɔ bere a ɔrekyerɛ wo kwan no?<verse eid="JER 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18"/>Afei adɛn nti na wokɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">kɔnom Sihor mu nsu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Na adɛn nti na wokɔ Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">kɔnom Asubɔnten no mu nsu?<verse eid="JER 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19"/>Wo amumɔyɛ bɛtwe wʼaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">wo nsanakyi bɛka wʼanim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Enti dwene ho na hu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">sɛ wopa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Nyankopɔn akyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">na woannya ne ho suro a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">ɛyɛ bɔne ne ɔyaw ma wo.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">Awurade, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20"/>“Tete mmere no, wububuu wo konnua mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">na wotetew wo nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">na wokae se, ‘Merensom wo!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">Ampa, wɔ koko biara so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">ne dua biara a adennan ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">na wotena bɔɔ aguaman.<verse eid="JER 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21"/>Miduaa wo sɛ bobe ankasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">a efi bobe a ase ye pa ara mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Na ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wodan wʼakyi kyerɛɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">bɛyɛɛ bobe a anyin asɛe wɔ wura mu yi?<verse eid="JER 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22"/>Sɛ wode soda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">ne samina bebree guare mpo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">wʼafɔdi nkekae da so wɔ mʼanim ara,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">sɛnea Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23"/>“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woaka se, ‘Me ho nguu fi ɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">minnii Baalnom akyi ɛ’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Hwɛ sɛnea woyɛɛ wo ho wɔ obon no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">dwene nea woayɛ no ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Woyɛ yomabere hoɔharefo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">a wutu mmirika kɔ ha ba ha,<verse eid="JER 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24"/>wura mu afurum a nweatam so tena akokwaw no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">ohuahua bere a ɔpɛ sɛ onini hyia no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">Sɛ nʼakɔnnɔ no ano yɛ den a hena na obesianka no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Anini biara a wɔtaa no no nhaw wɔn ho bebree;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">edu bere a ɛsɛ sɛ wohyia no a wobenya no.<verse eid="JER 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25"/>Ntu mmirika nkosi sɛ wʼanan ase bɛyɛ kwaterekwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">na wo mene mu bɛyow.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Nanso wokae se, ‘So nni mfaso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Mepɛ ananafo anyame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">na ɛsɛ sɛ midi wɔn akyi.’<verse eid="JER 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26"/>“Sɛnea wɔkyere ɔkorɔmfo a wogu nʼanim ase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">saa na wɔagu Israelfi anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">wɔn ankasa, wɔn ahemfo ne wɔn adwumayɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">wɔn asɔfo ne wɔn adiyifo.<verse eid="JER 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27"/>Wɔka kyerɛ dua se, ‘Woyɛ mʼagya,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">ne ɔbo se, ‘Wo na wowoo me.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Wɔadan wɔn akyi akyerɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">na ɛnyɛ wɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">nanso sɛ amanehunu bi ba wɔn so a, wɔka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">‘Bra begye yɛn!’<verse eid="JER 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28"/>Anyame a moyɛ maa mo ho no wɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Momma wɔmmra sɛ wobetumi agye mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">bere a mowɔ amanehunu mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Efisɛ mowɔ anyame bebree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">te sɛ nea mowɔ nkurow bebree no, Yuda.<verse eid="JER 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29"/>“Adɛn nti na mobɔ me sobo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">Mo nyinaa ayɛ dɔm atia me,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30"/>“Metwee mo nkurɔfo aso kwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">wɔamfa me nteɛso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Wʼafoa akunkum wʼadiyifo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">te sɛ gyata a nʼani abere.<verse eid="JER 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31"/>“Mo nnɛmmafo, munnwen <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">“Mayɛ sɛ, nweatam ama Israel ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">Anaasɛ asase a so aduru sum kabii ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Adɛn nti na me nkurɔfo ka se, ‘Yɛwɔ ho kwan sɛ yekyinkyin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">yɛremma wo nkyɛn bio.’<verse eid="JER 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32"/>Ɔbabun werɛ fi ne mpempranne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">ayeforo werɛ befi nʼahyehyɛde ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Nanso me nkurɔfo werɛ afi me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">nna a wontumi nkan.<verse eid="JER 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33"/>Hwɛ nyansa a mowɔ de pɛ mo adɔfo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">Mmea a wɔnsɛ hwee koraa tumi sua mo akwan.<verse eid="JER 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34"/>Mo adurade mu wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">ahiafo a wodi bem mogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">nanso moankyere wɔn sɛ wɔrebubu akɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Eyinom nyinaa akyi<verse eid="JER 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35"/>woka se, ‘Midi bem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">ne bo mfuw me.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Nanso mebu wo atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">efisɛ woka se, ‘Menyɛɛ bɔne biara ɛ.’<verse eid="JER 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36"/>Adɛn nti na wukyinkyin sɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">sesa wʼakwan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Misraim bedi wo huammɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">sɛnea Asiria yɛe no.<verse eid="JER 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37"/>Afei wubefi saa beae hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">a wo nsa gu wo ti so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo wɔn a wode wo ho too wɔn so no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">wɔremmoa wo.<verse eid="JER 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JER 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1"/>“Sɛ ɔbarima gyaa ne yere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">na ɔbea no kɔware ɔbarima foforo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no san kɔ ɔbea no nkyɛn ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">Ɛremma asase no ho ngu fi koraa ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Nanso wo ne adɔfo bebree abɔ aguaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">na mprempren de wobɛsan aba me nkyɛn ana?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2"/>“Ma wʼani so hwɛ nkoko no so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Baabi wɔ hɔ a wɔntoo wo mmonnaa da ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Wotenaa kwankyɛn twɛn adɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">wotenaa sɛ mmoahwɛfo a wodi atutena wɔ nweatam so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Woagu asase no ho fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">wode wʼaguamammɔ ne wʼamumɔyɛ na ayɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3"/>Enti wɔatwe obosu asan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">na asusowbere su antɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Nanso wʼanim ayɛ sɛ oguamanfo a ɔmfɛre hwee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">wʼani nwu hwee.<verse eid="JER 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4"/>Nnansa yi ara, woamfrɛ me se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">‘Mʼagya, me mmabunmmere mu adamfo,<verse eid="JER 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5"/>wo bo befuw biribiara ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">Wʼabufuwhyew no bɛkɔ so daa ana?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Sɛɛ na wokasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">nanso woyɛ bɔne nyinaa sɛnea wutumi.”<verse eid="JER 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel A Onni Nokware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6"/>Ɔhene Yosia adedi bere so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Woahu nea Israel a onni nokware no ayɛ? Wakɔ nkoko nyinaa so ne dua a adennan biara ase akɔsɛe aware wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JER 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7"/>Misusuwii sɛ anka wayɛ eyinom nyinaa akyi no, ɔbɛsan aba me nkyɛn nanso wamma, na ne nuabea Yuda a ɔno nso nka nokware no hui. <verse eid="JER 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8"/>Memaa Israel a onni nokware no awaregyae nhoma na mepam no esiane nʼawaresɛe abrabɔ nti. Nanso mihuu sɛ ne nuabea Yuda a onni nokware no ansuro; ɔno nso kɔbɔɔ aguaman bra. <verse eid="JER 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9"/>Esiane sɛ Israel aguamammɔ anyɛ no asɛnhia nti, ɔde fi kaa asase no na ɔne abo ne nnua bɔɔ aguaman. <verse eid="JER 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10"/>Eyinom nyinaa akyi no, ne nuabea Yuda amfi ne koma nyinaa mu ansan amma me nkyɛn, ɔyɛ de kyerɛɛ kɛkɛ,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Israel a onni nokware no teɛ sen Yuda okontomponi no. <verse eid="JER 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12"/>Kɔ, fa wʼani kyerɛ atifi fam kɔka saa nsɛm yi kyerɛ wɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">“ ‘San wʼakyi, Israel a onni nokware,’ Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Meremmuna nkyerɛ wo bio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">efisɛ meyɛ mmɔborɔhunufo,’ sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Me bo remfuw afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13"/>Gye wo afɔdi to mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">woatew <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn anim atua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">woakyekyɛ wʼadɔe mu ama ananafo anyame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">wɔ dua biara a adennan ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">na woanyɛ osetie amma me,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14"/>“Monsan mo akyi, mo akyirisanfo,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, “efisɛ meyɛ mo kunu. Meyi wo; ɔbaako befi kurow mu na baanu afi abusuakuw mu, na mede mo aba Sion. <verse eid="JER 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15"/>Afei mɛma mo nguanhwɛfo a wɔda me koma so, wɔn a wɔde nimdeɛ ne ntease bɛkyerɛ mo ɔkwan. <verse eid="JER 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16"/>Saa nna no mu, sɛ mo dɔɔso bebree wɔ asase no so a,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “nnipa renka bio se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no.’ Ɛremma wɔn adwene mu anaa wɔrenkae da; wɔn kɔn rennɔ na wɔrenyɛ foforo nso. <verse eid="JER 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17"/>Saa bere no wɔbɛfrɛ Yerusalem <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahengua, na amanaman nyinaa behyia wɔ Yerusalem abɛkamfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din. Na wɔrenni wɔn koma bɔne a ɛma wɔyɛ asoɔden no akyi bio. <verse eid="JER 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18"/>Saa nna no mu, Yuda fi bɛka Israelfi ho, na wɔabɔ mu afi atifi fam asase bi so aba asase a mede maa mo agyanom sɛ agyapade no so.<verse eid="JER 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19"/>“Mʼankasa mekae se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">‘Anka ɛbɛyɛ me anigye sɛ mɛyɛ mo sɛ mma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">na mama mo asase a eye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">agyapade a edi mu ma ɔman biara.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Misusuwii sɛ mobɛfrɛ me ‘Agya’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">na monnan mo ho mfi mʼakyi.<verse eid="JER 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20"/>Nanso te sɛ ɔbea a onni ne kunu nokware no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">saa ara na moanni me nokware, Israelfi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21"/>Wɔte osu bi wɔ nkoko no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">ɛyɛ Israelfo agyaadwotwa ne nkotosrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">efisɛ wɔakyeakyea wɔn akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">na wɔn werɛ afi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22"/>“Monsan mmra, ɔyera mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">mɛsa mo akyirisan yare no.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">“Yiw, yɛbɛba wo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">efisɛ wo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn no.<verse eid="JER 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23"/>Ampa, ahoni huuyɛ wɔ nkoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">ne mmepɔw so no yɛ nnaadaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">nokware <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">na Israel nkwagye wɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24"/>Efi yɛn mmofraase, anyame huhuw adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">yɛn agyanom nsa ano adwuma so aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:24">wɔn nguankuw ne anantwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">wɔn mmabarima ne wɔn mmabea.<verse eid="JER 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25"/>Momma yɛmfa yɛn aniwu nneda fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">na yɛn ahohora nkata yɛn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">Yɛayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">yɛn ne yɛn agyanom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">efi yɛn mmofraase besi nnɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">yɛanyɛ osetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn no.”<verse eid="JER 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1"/>“Sɛ wo, Israel, wobɛsan wʼakyi a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">san bra me nkyɛn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">“Sɛ wuyi wʼahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwade fi mʼani so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">na sɛ woamman bio,<verse eid="JER 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2"/>na sɛ wufi nokware, pɛpɛyɛ ne trenee mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">ka ntam se, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi,’ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">afei wobehyira aman no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">na ne mu na wobenya anuonyam.”<verse eid="JER 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3"/>Eyi ne asɛm a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛ Yuda mmarima ne Yerusalem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Munsiesie mo asase a womfuntum da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">na munnnua wɔ nsɔe mu.<verse eid="JER 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4"/>Muntwitwa mo ho twetia mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">muntwitwa mo koma twetia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">mo Yuda mmarima ne Yerusalemfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">anyɛ saa a mʼabufuwhyew bɛsɔre na adɛw sɛ ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">mo bɔne a moayɛ nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ɛbɛhyew a obiara rennum.”<verse eid="JER 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanehunu A Efi Atifi Fam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5"/>“Bɔ nkae wɔ Yuda na pae mu ka wɔ Yerusalem se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Hyɛn torobɛnto no wɔ asase no nyinaa so!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Teɛ mu dennen se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Mommoaboa mo ho ano!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Momma yenguan nkɔ nkuropɔn a wɔabɔ ho ban no mu!’<verse eid="JER 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6"/>Momma frankaa so na monkɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">munguan nkɔbɔ mo ho aguaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Efisɛ mede amanehunu fi atifi fam reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">ɔsɛe a ɛyɛ hu.”<verse eid="JER 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7"/>Gyata bi afi ne tu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">ɔbɔɔaman bi asi mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Wafi ne tenabea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">sɛ ɔrebɛsɛe wʼasase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Wo nkurow bebubu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">na ada mpan.<verse eid="JER 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8"/>Enti fura atweaatam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">di awerɛhow na twa adwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">nnan mfii yɛn so.<verse eid="JER 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9"/>“Saa da no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">“ɔhene no ne adwumayɛfo no bɛbɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:9">asɔfo no bo betu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">na adiyifo no ho bedwiriw wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10"/>Afei, mekae se, “Aa, Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woadaadaa nnipa yi ne Yerusalem, wokae se, ‘Mubenya asomdwoe,’ wɔ bere a afoa da yɛn mene mu.”<verse eid="JER 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11"/>Saa bere no wɔbɛka akyerɛ nnipa yi ne Yerusalem se, “Mframa a emu yɛ hyew bɛbɔ afi nkoko wosee a ɛwɔ nweatam so aba me nkurɔfo so, ɛnyɛ nea ɛpo ho anaa ehuhuw so; <verse eid="JER 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12"/>mframa a ano yɛ den boro saa no fi me nkyɛn. Afei mepae mu ka mʼatemmu a etia wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13"/>Hwɛ! ɔreba sɛ omununkum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">ne nteaseɛnam reba sɛ mfɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">nʼapɔnkɔ ho yɛ hare sen akɔre.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Yennue! Yɛawu!<verse eid="JER 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14"/>Yerusalem, yi bɔne fi wo koma mu na woanya nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Wode adwemmɔne bɛhyɛ wo mu akosi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15"/>Nne bi rebɔ amanneɛ fi Dan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">ɛrebɔ amanehunu ho dawuru fi Efraim nkoko so.<verse eid="JER 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16"/>“Monka eyi nkyerɛ aman no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">mommɔ no dawuru nkyerɛ Yerusalem se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">‘Atuafo dɔm fi akyirikyiri asase bi so reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">wɔma ɔko nteɛmu so de tia Yuda nkuropɔn.<verse eid="JER 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17"/>Wotwa ne ho hyia sɛ mmarima a wɔrewɛn afuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">efisɛ watew me so atua,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.<verse eid="JER 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18"/>“Wo ankasa abrabɔ ne nneyɛe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">na ɛde eyi aba wo so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Eyi yɛ wʼasotwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ɛyɛ nwen!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ɛwowɔ koma!”<verse eid="JER 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19"/>Ao, mʼahoyeraw, mʼahoyeraw!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">midi me mu yaw.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Me koma mu yawdi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Me koma bɔ kitirikitiri wɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">mintumi nyɛ komm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Efisɛ, mate torobɛnto no nnyigye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">mate ɔko frɛ no.<verse eid="JER 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20"/>Amanehunu di amanehunu akyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">asase no nyinaa asɛe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Wɔasɛe me ntamadan prɛko pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">ne me hintabea mpofirim.<verse eid="JER 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mehwɛ ɔko frankaa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">na mitie torobɛnto no nnyigye kosi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22"/>“Me nkurɔfo yɛ nkwaseafo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">wonnim me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Wɔyɛ mma a wonni adwene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">wɔnte hwee ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Wɔwɔ bɔneyɛ ho nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">na wonnim sɛnea wɔyɛ papa.”<verse eid="JER 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23"/>Mehwɛɛ asase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">na enni bɔbea, na ɛda mpan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">mehwɛɛ ɔsorosoro, na wɔn hann no nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24"/>Mehwɛɛ mmepɔw no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">na wɔrewosowosow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">na nkoko no nyinaa rehinhim.<verse eid="JER 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25"/>Mehwɛe, na nnipa nni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">wim anomaa biara atu kɔ.<verse eid="JER 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26"/>Mehwɛe, na nsasebere no adan nweatam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">na ne nkurow nyinaa asɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, wɔ nʼabufuwhyew ano.<verse eid="JER 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27"/>Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:27">“Wɔbɛsɛe asase no nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">mmom, merensɛe no korakora.<verse eid="JER 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28"/>Enti asase bedi awerɛhow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">na ɔsorosoro beduru sum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">efisɛ makasa na merentwe nsan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">masi gyinae na merennan no.”<verse eid="JER 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29"/>Apɔnkɔsotefo ne agyantowfo nnyigyei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">ma kurow biara sofo guan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Ebinom kɔhyɛ nkyɛkyerɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">ebinom foro kɔ abotan mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Nkurow no nyinaa so adeda mpan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">na obiara nte so.<verse eid="JER 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30"/>Dɛn na woreyɛ, wo a wɔasɛe wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Adɛn na wufura ɔkɔben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">de sikakɔkɔɔ agude asiesie wo ho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Adɛn na wode nnuru keka wʼani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Wohyehyɛ wo ho kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Wʼadɔfo bu wo animtiaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">wɔrehwehwɛ wo akum wo.<verse eid="JER 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31"/>Mete osu bi te sɛ ɔbea a ɔwɔ awoko mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">apinisi te sɛ ɔbea a ɔrewo nʼabakan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Ɔbabea Sion resu te sɛ nea osi apini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">ɔtrɛw ne nsa mu na ɔreka se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Afei de meretɔ piti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">wɔde me nkwa ama awudifo.”<verse eid="JER 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Obiara Nyɛ Ɔtreneeni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1"/>“Munni akɔneaba wɔ Yerusalem mmɔnten so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">monhwɛ mo ho nhyia nhwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">monhwehwɛ guabɔbea nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">Sɛ muhu onipa baako mpo a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">ɔyɛ pɛ na odi nokware a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">mede kuropɔn yi ho bɛkyɛ no.<verse eid="JER 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2"/>Ɛwɔ mu wɔka se, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">nanso wɔda so ka ntam hunu.”<verse eid="JER 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wʼani mpɛ nokware ahu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Wobɔɔ wɔn hwee fam, nanso wɔante yaw biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">wodwerɛw wɔn, nanso wɔpoo nteɛso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Wɔyɛɛ wɔn anim dennen sen ɔbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">na wɔansakra wɔn adwene.<verse eid="JER 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4"/>Misusuw se, “Eyinom nko ara ne ahiafo no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">wɔyɛ nkwaseafo nso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">efisɛ wonnim <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">nea wɔn Nyankopɔn hwehwɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5"/>Enti mɛkɔ ntuanofo no nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">akɔkasa akyerɛ wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">ampa ara wonim <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">nea wɔn Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Nanso wɔn nso de adwene koro abubu konnua no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">atetew nkyehama no mu.<verse eid="JER 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6"/>Ɛno nti gyata bi a ofi kwae mu bɛtow ahyɛ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">pataku bi a ofi nweatam so bɛtetew wɔn mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Ɔsebɔ bi bɛtɛw abɛn wɔn nkurow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">na obiara a obeyi ne ti no ɔbɛtetew ne mu nketenkete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">efisɛ wɔn atuatew no ano yɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">na wɔn akyirisan aboro so.<verse eid="JER 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7"/>“Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ mede mo ho kyɛ mo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Mo mma apo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">wɔde anyame a wɔnyɛ anyame aka ntam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Memaa wɔn nea wohia nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">nanso wɔbɔɔ aguaman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">na wɔbɔɔ yuu kɔɔ nguamanfo afi mu.<verse eid="JER 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8"/>Mpɔnkɔnini aniberefo a wɔhwɛ wɔn yiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">wɔn mu biara su di ne yɔnko yere akyi.<verse eid="JER 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ eyi ho?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ, mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">ɔman a ɛte sɛɛ so were ana?<verse eid="JER 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10"/>“Momfa ne bobe nturo no mu na monsɛe no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">nanso monnsɛe no koraa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Mompempan ne mman no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">efisɛ saa nnipa yi nyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea.<verse eid="JER 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11"/>Israelfi ne Yudafi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">anni me nokware koraa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12"/>Wɔadi atoro afa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">wɔkae se, “Ɔrenyɛ hwee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Ɔhaw biara remma yɛn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">yɛrenhu afoa anaa ɔkɔm da.<verse eid="JER 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13"/>Adiyifo no yɛ mframa bi kɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">na asɛm no nte wɔn mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">enti momma nea wɔka no mmra wɔn so.”<verse eid="JER 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14"/>Enti eyi ne nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Nyankopɔn se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">“Esiane sɛ, nnipa no aka saa nsɛm yi nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">mɛyɛ me nsɛm a ɛwɔ wʼanom no ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">na saa nnipa yi ayɛ nnyina a ogya no bɛhyew.<verse eid="JER 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15"/>Israelfi,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">“Mede ɔman bi a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri rebetia wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">tete man a ɛyɛ ɔmantease,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">nnipa a munnim wɔn kasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">na monnte wɔn kasa ase.<verse eid="JER 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16"/>Wɔn agyan mmɔtɔwa te sɛ ɔda a ano da hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">wɔn nyinaa yɛ dɔmmarima.<verse eid="JER 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17"/>Wɔbɛsɛe mo nnɔbae ne mo nnuan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">asɛe mo mmabarima ne mo mmabea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">wɔbɛsɛe mo nguankuw ne mo anantwikuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">asɛe mo bobe ne mo mmrɔdɔma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Wɔde afoa bɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ bammɔ a mode mo werɛ ahyɛ mu no.<verse eid="JER 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18"/>“Afei saa nna no mu mpo,” sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Merensɛe mo korakora. <verse eid="JER 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19"/>Na sɛ nnipa no bisa se, ‘Adɛn nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, ayɛ yɛn sɛɛ’ a, mobɛka akyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛnea moagyaw me hɔ akɔsom ananafo anyame wɔ mo ankasa mo asase so no, saa ara na mprempren mobɛsom ananafo wɔ asase a ɛnyɛ mo dea no so.’<verse eid="JER 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20"/>“Monka eyi nkyerɛ Yakobfi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">na mo mpae mu nka wɔ Yuda se:<verse eid="JER 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21"/>Muntie, mo nkwaseafo ne nnipa a munni adwene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">mowɔ ani nso munhu ade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">na mowɔ aso nso monte asɛm:<verse eid="JER 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ musuro me ana?” Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mo ho popo wɔ mʼanim ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Mede nwea ato ɔhye ama po,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ɔhye a ɛwɔ hɔ daa a ɛrentumi ntra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Asorɔkye bɛbɔ nanso ɛrentumi mmu mfa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ebehuru so nanso ɛrentumi ntra.<verse eid="JER 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23"/>Nanso saa nnipa yi wɔ asoɔden ne atuatew koma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">wɔatwe wɔn ho afi me ho kɔ.<verse eid="JER 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24"/>Wɔnnka nkyerɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">‘Momma yensuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">a ɔma osu tɔ wɔ ne mmere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">nea ɔma yɛn awerehyɛmu wɔ otwabere nnapɛn a wahyɛ no ho.’<verse eid="JER 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25"/>Mo amumɔyɛ abɔ eyinom agu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">mo bɔne ama ade pa abɔ mo.<verse eid="JER 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26"/>“Amumɔyɛfo bi wɔ me nkurɔfo yi mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">a wɔtɛw sɛ nnipa a wosum nnomaa afiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">na wɔte sɛ wɔn a wosum mfiri yi nnipa.<verse eid="JER 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27"/>Sɛnea nnomaa ahyɛ kɛntɛn ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">saa ara na asisi ahyɛ wɔn afi amaama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">wɔayeyɛ adefo anyinya tumi,<verse eid="JER 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28"/>na wɔadodɔ srade ama wɔn ho ayɛ hanahana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm no nni awiei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">wɔnnka ayisaa asɛm mma wonni bem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">na wɔmmɔ ahiafo tumi ho ban.<verse eid="JER 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ eyinom ho ana?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ, mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">ɔman a ɛte sɛɛ so were ana?<verse eid="JER 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30"/>“Ade a ɛyɛ hu ne ahodwiriw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">asi wɔ asase no so:<verse eid="JER 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31"/>Adiyifo no hyɛ akɔntoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">asɔfo no de wɔn dibea di tumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">na me nkurɔfo no pɛ no saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Nanso awiei no dɛn na wobɛyɛ?”<verse eid="JER 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Atamfo Atwa Yerusalem Ho Ahyia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1"/>“Benyaminfo, munguan nkɔbɔ mo ho aguaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Munguan mfi Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Monhyɛn torobɛnto no wɔ Tekoa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Munsi frankaa no wɔ Bet-Hakerem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Efisɛ amanehunu bobɔw fi atifi fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">ɔsɛe bi a ɛyɛ hu.<verse eid="JER 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2"/>Mɛsɛe Ɔbabea Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">ɔhoɔfɛfo sɔɔnɔ no.<verse eid="JER 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3"/>Nguanhwɛfo ne wɔn nguankuw bɛba abetia no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">wobesisi wɔn ntamadan atwa ne ho ahyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">wɔn mu biara bɛhwɛ ne kyɛfa so.”<verse eid="JER 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4"/>“Munsiesie mo ho ne no nkɔko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">Monsɔre, momma yɛnkɔtow nhyɛ ne so owigyinae!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Nanso hwɛ, onwini redwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">na anwummere sunsuma reware.<verse eid="JER 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5"/>Enti monsɔre, momma yɛnkɔtow nhyɛ ne so anadwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">na yɛnsɛe nʼaban ahorow!”<verse eid="JER 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Muntwitwa nnua no ngu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">na muntwa Yerusalem ho dantaban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwe kuropɔn yi aso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">nhyɛso ahyɛ no ma.<verse eid="JER 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7"/>Sɛnea abura puw ne nsu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">saa ara na opuw nʼamumɔyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Wɔte awurukasɛm ne ɔsɛe nka wɔ ne mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">ne yare ne nʼapirakuru wɔ mʼanim daa.<verse eid="JER 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8"/>Fa kɔkɔbɔ, Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">anyɛ saa metwe me ho afi wo ho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">na mama wʼasase ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">a obiara ntumi ntena so.”<verse eid="JER 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Ma wonyiyi Israel nkae no mu yiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">sɛnea woyiyi bobe mu yiye no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">fa wo nsa fa mman no so bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">sɛ obi a ɔretetew bobe aba.”<verse eid="JER 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10"/>Hena na metumi akasa akyerɛ no na mabɔ no kɔkɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Hena na obetie me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Wɔn aso asisiw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">enti wɔnte asɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm yɛ akyiwade ma wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">na wɔn ani nnye ho.<verse eid="JER 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew ahyɛ me ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">na mintumi nkora so.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Hwie gu mmofra a wɔwɔ mmɔnten so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ne mmerante a wɔahyia;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">ɛbɛka okunu ne ɔyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">mmasiriwa, wɔn a onyin ahunhuan wɔn no so.<verse eid="JER 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12"/>Wɔbɛdan wɔn afi ama afoforo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">wɔn mfuw ne wɔn yerenom bɛka ho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">sɛ meteɛ me nsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">wɔ wɔn a wɔte asase no so a,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13"/>“Efi akumaa so kosi ɔkɛse so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">wɔn nyinaa yɛ adifudepɛfo de pɛ ahonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">adiyifo ne asɔfo te saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">wɔn nyinaa yɛ asisifo.<verse eid="JER 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14"/>Wɔtoto me nkurɔfo apirakuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">te sɛnea ɛnyɛ hu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Wɔka se, ‘Asomdwoe, asomdwoe’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">wɔ mmere a asomdwoe nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15"/>Wɔn ani wu wɔ wɔn animguase nneyɛe no ho ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Dabi da, wɔn ani nnwu koraa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">wonnim fɛre mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Enti wɔbɛtotɔ wɔ atɔfo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">wɔbɛhwehwe ase, sɛ metwe wɔn aso a,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16"/>Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Munnyina nkwantanan no so na monhwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">mummisa tete akwan no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">mummisa faako a ɔkwan pa no da na monnantew so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">na mubenya home ama mo akra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Nanso mokae se, ‘yɛnnantew so.’<verse eid="JER 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17"/>Mede awɛmfo sisii mo so na mekae se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Muntie torobɛnto nnyigyei no!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:17">Nanso mokae se, ‘Yɛrentie.’<verse eid="JER 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18"/>Ɛno nti monyɛ aso, mo amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">mo a moyɛ nnansefo, monhwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">monhwɛ nea ɛbɛto wɔn.<verse eid="JER 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19"/>Tie, wo asase:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Mede amanehunu reba saa nnipa yi so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">wɔn nneyɛe so aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">efisɛ wɔantie me nsɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">na wɔapo me mmara.<verse eid="JER 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20"/>Nnuhuam a efi Seba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">anaa ahwerew pa a efi akyirikyiri asase so fa me ho bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Minnye wo hyew afɔre no nto mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">wʼafɔrebɔ ahorow no nsɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="JER 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21"/>Ɛno nti, nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Mede akwanside begu saa nkurɔfo yi anim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">Agyanom ne mmabarima nyinaa behintiw wɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">yɔnkonom ne nnamfonom bɛyera.”<verse eid="JER 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22"/>Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">“Monhwɛ, nsraadɔm bi reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">wofi atifi fam asase so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">wɔrehwanyan wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">afi nsase ano.<verse eid="JER 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23"/>Wokurakura bɛmma ne mpeaw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">wɔn tirim yɛ den, na wonni ahummɔbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Wɔn nnyigyei te sɛ po asorɔkye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">Sɛ wɔtete wɔn apɔnkɔ so a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">wɔba te sɛ mmarima a wɔrekɔ ɔko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">Wɔrebɛtow ahyɛ wo so, Ɔbabea Sion.”<verse eid="JER 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24"/>Yɛate wɔn ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">na yɛn nsa sesa yɛn ho sɛ nea awuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Awerɛhow akyekyere yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">yɛte yaw sɛ ɔbea a ɔreko awo.<verse eid="JER 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25"/>Mfi adi nkɔ wuram</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">na nnantew akwan no so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">efisɛ ɔtamfo no wɔ afoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">na baabiara ayɛ hu.<verse eid="JER 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26"/>Me nkurɔfo, mumfura atweaatam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">na mommunummunum wɔ nsõ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">momfa adwadwotwa yaayaw nni awerɛhow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">sɛnea wosu ma ɔbabarima koro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">efisɛ ɔsɛefo no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">bɛba yɛn so mpofirim.<verse eid="JER 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27"/>“Mayɛ wo obi a ɔsɔ agude hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">na me nkurɔfo dadeben,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">a wobɛhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">na woasɔ wɔn akwan ahwɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28"/>Wɔn nyinaa yɛ atuatewfo a wɔyɛ den,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">wɔnenam di nseku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Wɔyɛ kɔbere ne dade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">wɔn nyinaa yɛ wɔn ade wɔ porɔwee kwan so.<verse eid="JER 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29"/>Afa no bɔ mframa dennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">de ogya nan sumpii no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">nanso ɔnan no yɛ ɔkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">Entumi nyiyii bɔne no mfii wɔn mu ɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30"/>Wɔfrɛ wɔn dwetɛ a wɔapo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:30">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atoro Nyamesom So Nni Mfaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1"/>Eyi ne asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn: <verse eid="JER 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2"/>“Gyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no pon ano, na ka saa asɛm yi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 7:2">“ ‘Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo nnipa a mowɔ Yuda nyinaa a mofa apon yi ano kɔsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="JER 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se: Monsakra mo akwan ne mo nneyɛe, na mɛma mo atena ha. <verse eid="JER 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4"/>Mommfa mo ho nto nnaadaasɛm so na monnka se, “Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan!” <verse eid="JER 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5"/>Sɛ mosakra mo akwan ne mo nneyɛe nokware mu, na mo ne mo ho mo ho di no trenee mu, <verse eid="JER 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6"/>sɛ moanhyɛ ɔhɔho, ayisaa anaa okunafo so, na moanhwie mogya a edi bem angu wɔ ha, na moanni anyame foforo akyi ankɔ mo ara ɔsɛe mu a, <verse eid="JER 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7"/>ɛno de, mɛma mo atena ha, asase a mede maa mo agyanom afebɔɔ no so. <verse eid="JER 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8"/>Nanso monhwɛ, mode mo ho ato nnaadaa nsɛm a so nni mfaso so.<verse eid="JER 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9"/>“ ‘Mobɛbɔ korɔn na moadi awu, mobɛbɔ aguaman na moadi adansekurum, mobɛhyew nnuhuam ama Baal na moadi anyame afoforo a munnim wɔn akyi, <verse eid="JER 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10"/>na afei, moaba abegyina mʼanim wɔ ofi a me din da so na moaka se, “Yenni ɔhaw,” sɛ moyɛ akyiwade yi nyinaa a na munni ɔhaw ana? <verse eid="JER 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11"/>Na ofi a me din da so yi, abɛyɛ adwowtwafo tu ama mo ana? Nanso migu so rehwɛ! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12"/>“ ‘Na afei monkɔ Silo, faako a midii kan bɔɔ atenae de me Din too so, na monhwɛ nea meyɛɛ no esiane me nkurɔfo Israelfo amumɔyɛ nti. <verse eid="JER 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13"/>Bere a moreyɛ eyinom nyinaa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, mekasa kyerɛɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso moantie; mefrɛɛ mo, nanso moannye so. <verse eid="JER 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14"/>Ɛno nti, sɛnea meyɛɛ Silo no, mede bɛyɛ ofi a me Din da so no, asɔredan a mode mo ho to so, baabi a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom no. <verse eid="JER 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15"/>Mɛpam mo afi mʼanim sɛnea meyɛɛ mo nuanom Efraimfo no.’<verse eid="JER 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16"/>“Enti mommmɔ mpae mma saa nnipa yi, monnsrɛ na munni mma wɔn nso; monnsrɛ me, efisɛ merentie mo. <verse eid="JER 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17"/>Munnhu nea wɔreyɛ wɔ Yuda nkurow no mu ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so no ana? <verse eid="JER 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18"/>Mmofra boaboa nnyina ano, na agyanom sɔ ogya no ano, mmea fɔtɔw asikresiam de to brodo ma Ɔsoro Hemmea. Na wogu nsa ma anyame afoforo de hyɛ me abufuw. <verse eid="JER 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19"/>Na ɛyɛ me na wɔrehyɛ me abufuw ana? <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. Na ɛnyɛ wɔn mmom na wɔrehaw wɔn ho, hyɛ wɔn ho aniwu ana?<verse eid="JER 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20"/>“ ‘Ɛno nti, nea Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Wobehwie mʼabufuw ne mʼabufuwhyew agu beae yi so, agu nnipa ne mmoa, mfuw so nnua ne asase no so aba so, na ɛbɛdɛw a ɛrennum.’ <verse eid="JER 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21"/>“ ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: Monkɔ so, momfa mo ɔhyew afɔrebɔ nka mo afɔrebɔ a aka no ho, na mo ankasa monwe nam no! <verse eid="JER 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22"/>Na bere a miyii mo agyanom fii Misraim na mekasa kyerɛɛ wɔn no, manhyɛ wɔn mmara a ɛfa ɔhyew afɔrebɔ ne afɔrebɔ ho nko ara, <verse eid="JER 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23"/>mmom mede saa mmara yi kaa ho: Monyɛ osetie mma me, na mɛyɛ mo Nyankopɔn, na moayɛ me nkurɔfo. Monnantew akwan nyinaa a mɛhyɛ mo no so, na asi mo yiye. <verse eid="JER 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24"/>Nanso wɔantie na wɔanyɛ aso; mmom, wofi wɔn koma bɔne mu yɛɛ asoɔden. Wɔsan wɔn akyi na wɔankɔ wɔn anim. <verse eid="JER 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25"/>Efi bere a mo agyanom fii Misraim de besi nnɛ yi, da biara ne bere biara mesomaa me nkoa adiyifo baa mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="JER 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26"/>Nanso wɔantie me na wɔanyɛ aso. Wɔde asoɔden yɛɛ bɔne boroo wɔn agyanom de so.’ <verse eid="JER 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27"/>“Sɛ moka eyinom nyinaa kyerɛ wɔn a, wɔrentie mo; sɛ mofrɛ wɔn a wɔrennye so. <verse eid="JER 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28"/>Ɛno nti monka nkyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Eyi ne ɔman a ɔnyɛɛ osetie mmaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ne Nyankopɔn, na ɔmfaa nteɛso no. Nokware asa, na afi wɔn ano. <verse eid="JER 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29"/>Munyi mo tinwi na montow ngu, muntwa agyaadwo wɔ nkoko no so, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo, na wagyaa saa awo ntoatoaso yi a wɔwɔ nʼabufuwhyew no ase akyidi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okum Bon No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30"/>“ ‘Yudafo ayɛ bɔne wɔ mʼani so, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. Wɔde ahoni a, ɛyɛ akyiwade asisi ofi a me Din da so mu de agu ho fi. <verse eid="JER 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31"/>Wɔasisi Tofet sorɔnsorɔmmea wɔ Ben Hinom bon mu; ɛhɔ na wɔhyew wɔn mmabarima ne wɔn mmabea. Ade a manhyɛ wɔn na amma mʼadwene mu nso. <verse eid="JER 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32"/>Ɛno nti, monhwɛ yiye na nna no reba, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, a wɔremfrɛ hɔ Tofet anaa Hinom Bon bio, na mmom, wɔbɛfrɛ no Okum Bon, efisɛ wobesie awufo wɔ Tofet kosi sɛ hɔ bɛyɛ ma. <verse eid="JER 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33"/>Na afei saa nnipa yi afunu bɛyɛ aduan ama wim nnomaa ne asase so mmoa, na ɛrenka obiara wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛpam wɔn. <verse eid="JER 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34"/>Mede ahosɛpɛw ne anigye nnyigyei, ayeforo ne ayeforokunu nne a ɛwɔ Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so no bɛba awiei, efisɛ asase no bɛda mpan.’ ”<verse eid="JER 7:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1"/>“ ‘Saa bere no, sɛnea Awurade se ni, wobeyiyi Yuda ahemfo ne adwumayɛfo nnompe, asɔfo ne adiyifo nnompe ne Yerusalemfo nnompe afi wɔn nna mu. <verse eid="JER 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2"/>Wɔbɛsɛw no kɛtɛ wɔ owia ne ɔsram ne ɔsorosoro nsoromma nyinaa a wɔdɔe, na wɔsomee, na wodii akyi kɔɔ so abisa na wɔsɔree no ase. Wɔremmoa wɔn ano na wɔrensie wɔn; mmom, wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a egugu fam. <verse eid="JER 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3"/>Baabiara a metwa saa ɔman bɔne yi nkae no asu akɔ no, wɔbɛpɛ sɛ wobewu sen sɛ wɔbɛtena nkwa mu, sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.’<verse eid="JER 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne Ne Asotwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4"/>“Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“ ‘Sɛ nnipa hwe ase a, wɔnsɔre ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">Sɛ onipa dan ne ho a, ɔnsan nʼakyi ana?<verse eid="JER 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5"/>Afei adɛn nti na saa nnipa yi adan wɔn ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Adɛn nti na Yerusalem dan ne ho daa yi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Wokura nnaadaa mu pintinn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">na wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔsan wɔn akyi.<verse eid="JER 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6"/>Mawɛn mʼaso atie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">nanso wɔnnka nea ɛteɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Wɔn mu biara nnu ne ho wɔ nʼamumɔyɛ ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">na ɔka se, “Dɛn na mayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Obiara fa ne kwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">te sɛ ɔpɔnkɔ a ɔrepem akɔ akono.<verse eid="JER 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7"/>Mpo aturukuku a ɔwɔ wim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">nim ne mmere a wɔahyehyɛ ama no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">na asukɔnkɔn, asomfena ne agyenkuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">hu bere a wotu kɔtena baabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">nanso me nkurɔfo nnim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hwehwɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8"/>“ ‘Adɛn na mutumi ka se, “Yenim nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">efisɛ yɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">wɔ bere a akyerɛwfo kyerɛwdua torofo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">de atoro adannan mu?<verse eid="JER 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9"/>Anyansafo no anim begu ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">wɔn ho bedwiriw wɔn na afide ayi wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Sɛ wɔapo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">na nyansa bɛn na wɔwɔ?<verse eid="JER 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10"/>Mede wɔn yerenom bɛma mmarima afoforo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">ne wɔn mfuw nso ama afoforo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Efi akumaa so kosi ɔkɛse so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">wɔn nyinaa yɛ adifudepɛfo de pɛ ahonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">adiyifo ne asɔfo te saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">wɔn nyinaa yɛ asisifo.<verse eid="JER 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11"/>Wɔtoto me nkurɔfo apirakuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">te sɛnea ɛnyɛ hu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Wɔka se, “Asomdwoe, asomdwoe”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">wɔ mmere a asomdwoe nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12"/>Wɔn ani wu wɔ wɔn animguase nneyɛe no ho ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Dabi da, wɔn ani nnwu koraa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">wonnim fɛre mpo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Enti wɔbɛtotɔ wɔ atɔfo mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">wɔbɛhwehwe ase, sɛ metwe wɔn aso a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13"/>“ ‘Mɛfa wɔn twabere nnɔbae akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Aba biara remma bobe nnua no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Aba biara remma borɔdɔma nnua no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">ɛso nhaban begunguan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Nea mede ama wɔn no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">wobegye afi wɔn nsam.’ ”<verse eid="JER 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14"/>Adɛn nti na yɛtete ha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Mommoaboa mo ho ano!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Momma yenguan nkɔ nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ bammɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">na yenkowuwu wɔ hɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn abu yɛn kumfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">na wama yɛn nsu a awuduru wɔ mu sɛ yɛnnom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">efisɛ yɛayɛ bɔne atia no.<verse eid="JER 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15"/>Yɛhwɛɛ kwan sɛ yebenya asomdwoe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">nanso biribi pa biara amfi mu amma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">yɛhwɛɛ ayaresabere kwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">nanso ehu nko ara na ɛkaa yɛn.<verse eid="JER 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16"/>Wɔte atamfo no apɔnkɔ home</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">fii Dan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">na wɔn apɔnkɔnini su</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">ma asase no nyinaa wosow.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Wɔaba sɛ wɔrebɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">asase no ne so nneɛma nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">kuropɔn no ne wɔn a wɔtete mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17"/>“Hwɛ, mɛsoma awɔ a wɔn ano wɔ bɔre aba mo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">nhurutoa a wontumi nnwudwo wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">na wɔbɛkeka mo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18"/>Wone mʼawerɛhow mu Werɛkyekyefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">me koma abotow wɔ me mu.<verse eid="JER 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19"/>Tie me nkurɔfo sufrɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">a efi akyirikyiri asase so:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nni Sion ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Ne Hene no nni hɔ bio ana?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Adɛn nti na wɔde wɔn nsɛsode ahyɛ me abufuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">wɔn ananafo ahoni huhuw no?”<verse eid="JER 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20"/>“Otwabere no atwa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ahuhuru bere no aba awiei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">na wonnnyee yɛn nkwa.”<verse eid="JER 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21"/>Sɛ wɔadwerɛw me nkurɔfo no nti, wɔadwerɛw me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">midi awerɛhow, na ahodwiriw akyekyere me.<verse eid="JER 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22"/>Aduru bi nni Gilead ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Ɔyaresafo bi nni hɔ ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Na afei adɛn nti na ayaresa nni hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">mma me nkurɔfo apirakuru?<verse eid="JER 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1"/>Ao, sɛ me ti yɛ asuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">na mʼaniwa yɛ nusu abura a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Mɛtew nusu awia ne anadwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">ama me nkurɔfo a wɔakunkum wɔn no.<verse eid="JER 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2"/>Ao, sɛ mewɔ akwantufo asoɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">wɔ nweatam no so a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">anka megyaw me nkurɔfo hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">na mafi wɔn nkyɛn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">efisɛ wɔn nyinaa yɛ nguaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">nnipakuw a wonni nokware.<verse eid="JER 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3"/>“Wosiesie wɔn tɛkrɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">te sɛ agyan de di atoro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Ɛnyɛ nokware so na wɔnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">di yiye wɔ asase yi so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Wɔyɛ bɔne toatoa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">na wonnye me nto mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4"/>“Monhwɛ yiye wɔ mo nnamfonom ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">munnye obiara nni wɔ mo abusua mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Efisɛ wɔn mu biara yɛ ɔdaadaafo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">na adamfo biara yɛ ɔsɛefo.<verse eid="JER 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5"/>Adamfo daadaa adamfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">na wɔn mu biara nka nokware.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Wɔn tɛkrɛma akokwaw atorodi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">wɔde bɔneyɛ haw wɔn ho.<verse eid="JER 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6"/>Wote nnaadaa mfimfini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">na wɔn nnaadaa mu wɔmpɛ sɛ wogye me to mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7"/>Ɛno nti, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">“Hwɛ, mɛnan wɔn asɔ wɔn ahwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">na dɛn bio na metumi ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">esiane me nkurɔfo yi bɔne nti?<verse eid="JER 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8"/>Wɔn tɛkrɛma yɛ agyan a ano wɔ bɔre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">ɛka nnaadaasɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Obiara kasa asomdwoe mu kyerɛ ne yɔnko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">nanso ne koma mu de, osum no afiri.<verse eid="JER 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ eyi ho?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">ɔman a ɛte sɛɛ so were ana?<verse eid="JER 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10"/>Mesu na metwa adwo ama mmepɔw no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">mɛbɔ abubuw a ɛfa nweatam adidibea ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ayɛ fo na obi mfa hɔ bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">na wɔnte anantwi su wɔ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Wim nnomaa no atutu kɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">na mmoa no nso aguan kɔ.<verse eid="JER 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11"/>“Mɛyɛ Yerusalem mmubui siw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">sakraman atu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">na mɛma Yuda nkurow ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">sɛnea obiara ntumi ntena hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12"/>Onipa bɛn na onim nyansa ara sɛ ɔbɛte eyi ase? Hena na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyerɛkyerɛ no a obetumi akyerɛ ase? Adɛn nti na wɔasɛe asase no ama ada mpan sɛ nweatam a obiara ntumi mfa so?<verse eid="JER 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae se, “Esiane sɛ wɔapo me mmara a mehyɛ maa wɔn no nti, wɔanyɛ osetie amma me na wɔanni me mmara so. <verse eid="JER 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14"/>Mmom, wɔadi wɔn koma asoɔden akyi, wɔadi Baalnom akyi sɛnea wɔn agyanom kyerɛɛ wɔn no.” <verse eid="JER 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15"/>Ɛno nti, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se ni: “Hwɛ, mɛma saa nnipa yi adi aduan a ɛyɛ nwen na wɔanom nsu a wɔde awuduru afra. <verse eid="JER 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16"/>Mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete amanaman a wɔn anaa wɔn agyanom nnim so no so, na mede afoa bɛtaa wɔn kosi sɛ mɛsɛe wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17"/>Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tumfo se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Dwene ho! Frɛ mmea agyaadwotwafo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">frɛ wɔn a wɔakwadaw mu pa ara.<verse eid="JER 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18"/>Ma wɔmmra ntɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">mmesu ngu yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">kosi sɛ yɛn ani so bɛtaa nusu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">na nusu aguare yɛn.<verse eid="JER 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19"/>Wɔte agyaadwotwa nnyigyei fi Sion se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">‘Wɔasɛe yɛn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Yɛn anim agu ase yiye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Ɛsɛ sɛ yetu fi yɛn asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">efisɛ yɛn afi abubu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20"/>Afei, mo mmea, muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">monyɛ aso mma nsɛm a efi nʼanom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Monkyerɛ mo mmabea sɛnea wotwa dwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">monkyerɛ mo ho mo ho abubuwbɔ.<verse eid="JER 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21"/>Owu aforo afa yɛn mfɛnsere mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">ahyɛn yɛn aban mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">apam mmofra afi mmɔnten so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">ne mmerante afi ɔman aguabɔbea.<verse eid="JER 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22"/>Ka se, “Sɛɛ Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“ ‘Nnipa afunu bɛdeda hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">te sɛ sumina a egugu petee mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">te sɛ aburow a nnɔbaetwafo atwa agu nʼakyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">a obiara mmoaboaa ano.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23"/>Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">“Mma onyansafo mfa ne nyansa nhyehyɛ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">anaa ɔhoɔdenfo mfa nʼahoɔden nhyehyɛ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">anaa ɔdefo mfa nʼahonya nhyehyɛ ne ho.<verse eid="JER 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24"/>Mmom ma nea ɔhyehyɛ ne ho nhyehyɛ ne ho sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ɔwɔ nhumu, na onim sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">me ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔyɛ adɔe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">na obu atɛntrenee na ɔyɛ adetrenee wɔ asase so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">efisɛ eyinom na ɛsɔ mʼani,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25"/>“Nna no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “A mɛtwe wɔn a wɔatwa twetia wɔ honam fam nko ara no nyinaa aso: <verse eid="JER 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26"/>Misraimfo, Yudafo, Edomfo, Amonfo, Moabfo ne wɔn a wɔtete nweatam a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri nsase so nyinaa. Na nokware, saa aman yi nyinaa yɛ momonotofo na mpo Israelfi nyinaa yɛ koma mu momonotofo.”<verse eid="JER 9:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Ne Ahoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1"/>Muntie nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛ mo, Israelfi. <verse eid="JER 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Munnsua amanaman no akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">anaa momma wim nsɛnkyerɛnne mmɔ mo hu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">ɛwɔ mu sɛ wɔbɔ amanaman no hu.<verse eid="JER 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3"/>Na nkurɔfo no amanne nka hwee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">wotwa dua fi kwae mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">na odwumfo de ne fitii asen.<verse eid="JER 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4"/>Wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ hyehyɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">wɔde nnadewa ne asae bobɔ si hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">sɛnea ɛrenhwe fam.<verse eid="JER 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5"/>Ɛte sɛ kaakaabotoni a esi ɛfere mfikyifuw mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">wɔn ahoni no ntumi nkasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsoa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">efisɛ wontumi nnantew.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Munnsuro wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">wɔrentumi nhaw mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">na wɔrentumi nyɛ ade pa biara nso.”<verse eid="JER 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6"/>Obiara nte sɛ wo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">woyɛ ɔkɛse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">na wo din so wɔ tumi mu.<verse eid="JER 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7"/>Hena na ɛnsɛ sɛ odi wo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Amansanhene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Eyi na ɛfata wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Amanaman no so anyansafo nyinaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">ne wɔn ahenni nyinaa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">obiara ne wo nsɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8"/>Wɔn nyinaa yɛ adwenharefo ne nkwaseafo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">dua ahoni a so nni mfaso na ɛma wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9"/>Wɔde dwetɛ a wɔaboro fi Tarsis ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">ne sikakɔkɔɔ nso fi Ufas ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Ɛyɛ nea odwumfo ne sika dwumfo ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">a wɔde ntama bibiri ne beredum afura no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">ne nyinaa yɛ adwumfo anyansafo nsa ano nnwuma.<verse eid="JER 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne nokware Onyankopɔn no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">ɔno ne Onyankopɔn teasefo, daapem Hene no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Sɛ ne bo fuw a asase wosow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">na amanaman no ntumi nnyina nʼabufuwhyew ano.<verse eid="JER 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11"/>“Ka eyi kyerɛ wɔn: ‘Saa anyame a ɛnyɛ wɔn na wɔyɛɛ ɔsoro ne asase no bɛyera afi asase so ne ɔsorosoro ase.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saa nkyerɛase yi fi Arameike kasa mu.</char></note><verse eid="JER 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12"/>Nanso Onyankopɔn de ne tumi bɔɔ asase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">ɔtoo wiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">na ɔde ne nhumu trɛw ɔsorosoro mu.<verse eid="JER 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13"/>Sɛ ɔpaapae aprannaa a ɔsorosoro nsu bobɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so fi nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Ɔde anyinam ka osu ho ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">na ogyaa mframa mu fi nʼadekoradan mu.<verse eid="JER 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14"/>Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na onni nimdeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">sikadwumfo biara anim gu ase, esiane nʼahoni nti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Ne nsɛsode yɛ atoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">wonni ɔhome biara wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JER 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15"/>Wɔn so nni mfaso, wɔn ho yɛ serew;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">sɛ wɔn atemmu du so a, wɔbɛyera.<verse eid="JER 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16"/>Nea ɔyɛ Yakob Kyɛfa no nte sɛ eyinom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">efisɛ ɔno ne ade nyinaa Yɛfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">a Israel, abusua a ɛyɛ nʼagyapade nso ka ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɛe A Ɛreba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17"/>Mommoaboa mo ahode ano mfi asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">mo a motete nkurow a wɔatua wɔn ano mu.<verse eid="JER 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Saa bere yi mɛtow wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">wɔtete asase yi so agu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">sɛnea wɔbɛfa wɔn nnommum.”<verse eid="JER 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19"/>Me pira yi nti minnue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">mʼapirakuru yɛ akisikuru!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Nanso mehyɛɛ me ho den sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">“Eyi ne me yare, na ɛsɛ sɛ mimia mʼani.”<verse eid="JER 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20"/>Wɔasɛe me ntamadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">wɔatwitwa nʼahama nyinaa mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Wɔafa me mma nyinaa kɔ a merenhu wɔn bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">anka obiara a obesi me ntamadan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">anaa obesiesie me suhyɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21"/>Nguanhwɛfo no yɛ adwenharefo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">wommisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi kwan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">ɛno nti wɔnkɔ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">na wɔn nguankuw no abɔ ahwete.<verse eid="JER 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22"/>Muntie! Amanneɛ no reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">basabasayɛ kɛse a efi atifi fam asase bi so!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Ɛbɛma Yuda nkurow ada mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">na ayɛ sakraman atu.<verse eid="JER 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Mpaebɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, minim sɛ, onipa nkwa nyɛ ne de;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">na ɛnyɛ onipa na ɔkyerɛkyerɛ nʼanammɔntu.<verse eid="JER 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24"/>Teɛ me so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔ trenee mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">mfi wʼabufuw mu nyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">anyɛ saa a wobɛdwerɛw me.<verse eid="JER 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25"/>Hwie wʼabufuwhyew no gu amanaman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">a wonnye wo nto mu no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">nnipa a wɔmmɔ wo din no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Efisɛ, wɔasɛe Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">wɔasɛe no koraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">na wɔasɛe nʼasase a wɔwoo no too so no.<verse eid="JER 10:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔabu Apam No So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1"/>Asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn ni: <verse eid="JER 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2"/>“Tie apam yi mu nhyehyɛe na ka kyerɛ Yudafo ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: ‘Nnome nka onipa a onni apam yi mu nhyehyɛe so, <verse eid="JER 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4"/>nea mehyɛ maa mo agyanom bere a miyii wɔn fii Misraim, fononoo a wɔnan dade wɔ mu no.’ Mekae se, ‘Monyɛ osetie mma me na monyɛ biribiara a mehyɛ mo, na mobɛyɛ me nkurɔfo na mayɛ mo Nyankopɔn. <verse eid="JER 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5"/>Na afei mɛma ntam a mekaa mo agyanom se, mɛma wɔn asase a nufusu ne ɛwo sen wɔ so no aba mu,’ asase a mote so nnɛ yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Mibuae se, “Amen, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="JER 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Bɔ saa asɛm yi ho dawuru wɔ Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so se: ‘Muntie apam yi ho nhyehyɛe na munni so. <verse eid="JER 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7"/>Efi bere a miyii mo agyanom fii Misraim besi nnɛ yi, mebɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ bere biara se, “Monyɛ osetie mma me.” <verse eid="JER 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8"/>Nanso wɔantie na wɔamfa no asɛm; na mmom, wodii asoɔden a efi wɔn koma bɔne mu no akyi. Ɛno nti memaa nnome a efi apam a mahyɛ wɔn sɛ wonni so na wɔanni so no mu no baa wɔn so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9"/>Na afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Atuatew apam bi wɔ Yudafo ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem no ntam. <verse eid="JER 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10"/>Wɔasan kɔ wɔn agyanom a wɔampɛ sɛ wotie mʼasɛm no bɔne ho. Wɔadi anyame foforo akyi akɔsom wɔn. Yerusalem fifo ne Yuda fifo abu apam a me ne wɔn agyanom yɛe no so. <verse eid="JER 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11"/>Ɛno nti nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: ‘Mede amanehunu a wɔrentumi nguan mfi mu bɛba wɔn so. Ɛwɔ mu sɛ, wosu frɛ me de, nanso merennye wɔn so. <verse eid="JER 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12"/>Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalemfo bɛkɔ akosu afrɛ anyame a wɔhyew nnuhuam ma wɔn no, nanso sɛ amanehunu ba a wɔrentumi mmoa wɔn koraa. <verse eid="JER 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13"/>Wo Yuda, wowɔ anyame a wɔn dodow bɛyɛ sɛ wo nkurow; na afɔremuka a moasisi sɛ mobɛhyew nnuhuam wɔ so ama animguase nyame Baal no dɔɔso sɛ Yerusalem mmɔnten.’<verse eid="JER 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14"/>“Mmɔ mpae mma saa nnipa yi, nni mma wɔn na nsrɛ mma wɔn, efisɛ, sɛ wosu frɛ me wɔ wɔn amanehunu mu a merennye wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15"/>“Dɛn na me dɔfo reyɛ wɔ mʼasɔredan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">bere a ɔne bebree hyehyɛ nsɛmmɔnedi ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">Ahodwira nam betumi abɔ wo asotwe agu ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Sɛ woyɛ wʼamumɔyɛsɛm a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">na wʼani agye.”<verse eid="JER 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, frɛ wo ngodua a enyin frɔmfrɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">a ɛsow aba a ɛyɛ fɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Nanso ɔde ahum kɛse bi nteɛmu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">bɛto mu gya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">na ne mman bebubu.<verse eid="JER 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a oduaa wo no ahyɛ amanehunu ho nkɔm wɔ wo ho, efisɛ Israel fifo ne Yuda fifo ayɛ bɔne ahyɛ me abufuw sɛ wɔhyew nnuhuam ma Baal.<verse eid="JER 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Tirisopam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18"/>Esiane sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii pɔw a wabɔ kyerɛɛ me no nti, mihui, efisɛ saa bere no ɔde nea wɔreyɛ no kyerɛɛ me. <verse eid="JER 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19"/>Meyɛɛ sɛ oguamma a odwo a wɔde no rekɔ akokum no; amma mʼadwene mu sɛ wɔabɔ wɔn tirim pɔw atia me sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Momma yɛnsɛe dua no ne nʼaba no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">momma yentwa no mfi ateasefo asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">sɛnea wɔnnkae ne din bio.”<verse eid="JER 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20"/>Nanso wo, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo a wubu atɛntrenee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">na wosɔ koma ne adwene hwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">ma minhu wʼaweretɔ wɔ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">na wo nsam na mede me nsɛm nyinaa hyɛ.<verse eid="JER 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21"/>Ɛno nti nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Anatot mmarima a wɔrehwehwɛ wo akum wo na wɔka se, “Nhyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu anyɛ saa a, wubewu wɔ yɛn nsa ano,” <verse eid="JER 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22"/>Ɛno nti, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Mɛtwe wɔn aso. Wɔn mmerante bewuwu afoa ano, na ɔkɔm bekunkum wɔn mmabarima ne mmabea. <verse eid="JER 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23"/>Wɔrennya wɔn nkae biara mpo, efisɛ mede amanehunu bɛba Anatotfo so wɔ wɔn asotwe afe mu.”<verse eid="JER 11:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1"/>Woyɛ ɔtreneeni bere biara, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">sɛ mede asɛm to wʼanim a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Nso me ne wo bɛkasa afa wʼatɛntrenee ho:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Adɛn nti na amumɔyɛfo kwan si wɔn yiye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Adɛn nti na wɔn a wonni gyidi ho dwo wɔn?<verse eid="JER 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2"/>Woadua wɔn, na wɔagye ntin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">wonyinyin na wɔsow aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Wɔbɔ wo din bere biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">nanso wɔn koma mmɛn wo.<verse eid="JER 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3"/>Nanso wunim me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">wuhu me, na wosɔ mʼadwene a mewɔ wɔ wo ho no hwɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Twe wɔn kɔ sɛ nguan a wɔrekotwitwa wɔn mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">Yi wɔn si nkyɛn ma okumda!<verse eid="JER 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4"/>Asase no nkyen nkosi da bɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">na prama so sare nguan nkosi da bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Esiane sɛ wɔn a wɔte so no yɛ amumɔyɛfo nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">mmoa ne nnomaa a wɔwɔ so awuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Na nnipa no da so ka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Ɔrenhu nea ɛba yɛn so.”<verse eid="JER 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Mmuae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5"/>“Sɛ wo ne mmarima atu mmirika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ama woabrɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wo ne apɔnkɔ besi mmirikakan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Sɛ wuhintiw wɔ asase petee so a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ɛno de, dɛn na wobɛyɛ wɔ Yordan ho nkyɛkyerɛ mu?<verse eid="JER 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6"/>Wo nuabarimanom, wʼankasa abusuafo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">wɔn mpo ayi wo ama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">wɔteɛ mu dennen tia wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Mfa wo ho nto wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">sɛ mpo wɔka wo ho asɛm pa a.<verse eid="JER 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7"/>“Megyaw me fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">ato mʼagyapade asaworam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">mede nea medɔ no no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">bɛhyɛ nʼatamfo nsa.<verse eid="JER 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8"/>Mʼagyapade ayɛ me sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">gyata a ɔwɔ kwae mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Ɔbobɔ mu gu me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">ɛno nti metan no.<verse eid="JER 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9"/>So mʼagyapade nyɛɛ me sɛ anomaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">a nkekae sisi ne ho a ɔkyere mmoa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">na nnomaa foforo a wɔkyere mmoa atwa ne ho ahyia resosɔw no ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Monkɔboaboa nkekaboa nyinaa ano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">Momfa wɔn mmra na wonkum wɔn.<verse eid="JER 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10"/>Nguanhwɛfo bebree bɛsɛe me bobeturo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">na wɔatiatia me mfuw so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">wɔbɛdan me mfuw fɛɛfɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">ayɛ no asase hunu a ɛda mpan.<verse eid="JER 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11"/>Ɛbɛyɛ asase a ada mpan a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">awo wosee na ɛda hɔ kwa wɔ mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">asase no nyinaa bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">efisɛ obiara nni hɔ a ɔhwɛ so.<verse eid="JER 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12"/>Nkoko wosee a ɛwɔ nweatam no nyinaa so no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">na asɛefo bɛba abegu bebree,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afoa bekunkum wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">afi asase ano de akosi ano nohɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">obiara remfa ne ho nni.<verse eid="JER 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13"/>Wobedua atoko, nso wobetwa nsɔe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">wɔbɛbrɛ wɔn ho nanso wɔrennya hwee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Wɔn ani bewu wɔ wɔn nnɔbaetwa ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew nti.”<verse eid="JER 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Na me yɔnkonom amumɔyɛfo a wɔfa agyapade a, mede maa me nkurɔfo Israelfo no de, metu wɔn afi wɔn nsase so na metu Yudafi afi wɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15"/>Na sɛ mitu wɔn wie a, mehu wɔn mmɔbɔ bio, na mede wɔn mu biara bɛba nʼagyapade, ne nʼasase so. <verse eid="JER 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16"/>Na sɛ wosua me nkurɔfo akwan yiye na wɔbɔ me din ka ntam se, ‘Nokware sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi’ a, ɛwɔ mu sɛ mmere bi wɔkyerɛɛ me nkurɔfo ma wɔde Baal kaa ntam de, nanso wɔn ase betim wɔ me nkurɔfo mu. <verse eid="JER 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17"/>Nanso sɛ ɔman bi antie a, metu nʼase, na masɛe no korakora,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 12:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nwera Abɔso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me: “Kɔ na kɔtɔ nwera abɔso bɔ wʼasen, nanso mma no nka nsu.” <verse eid="JER 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2"/>Enti metɔɔ abɔso sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛe no, na mede bɔɔ mʼasen.<verse eid="JER 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn ne mprenu so se, <verse eid="JER 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4"/>“Fa abɔso a wotɔe a ɛbɔ wʼasen no kɔ Eufrate ho mprempren ara na fa kosie ɔbotan tokuru bi mu.” <verse eid="JER 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5"/>Enti mede kosiee Eufrate ho, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me no.<verse eid="JER 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6"/>Nna bebree akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Afei kɔ Eufrate ho na kɔfa abɔso a meka kyerɛɛ wo se fa kosie hɔ no.” <verse eid="JER 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7"/>Enti mekɔɔ Eufrate ho kotuu abɔso no wɔ beae a mede siei no, nanso na asuw atetew a so nni mfaso biara.<verse eid="JER 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, ‘Saa ara na mɛsɛe Yuda ahantan ne Yerusalem ahantankyɛnee no. <verse eid="JER 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10"/>Saa amumɔyɛfo yi a wɔmpɛ sɛ wotie mʼasɛm na wodi wɔn komaden akyi na wodi anyame afoforo akyi som wɔn, sɔre wɔn no, bɛyɛ sɛ saa abɔso yi, na wɔn so remma mfaso biara! <verse eid="JER 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11"/>Sɛnea abɔso kyekyere onipa asen no, saa ara na mede Israelfi ne Yudafi nyinaa bataa me ho sɛ wɔnyɛ me nkurɔfo a wɔbɛma me din so, aka mʼayeyi na wɔahyɛ me anuonyam, nanso wɔantie me,’ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="JER 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsa Kotoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12"/>“Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se ni, Wɔmfa nsa nhyɛ nsa kotoku biara ma.’ Na sɛ wɔka kyerɛ wo se, ‘Yenim sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsa hyɛ nsa kotoku biara ma a,’ <verse eid="JER 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13"/>afei ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Mede nsabow bɛhyɛ wɔn a wɔtete asase yi so nyinaa ma, a ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahengua so, asɔfo, adiyifo ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem nyinaa ka ho bi. <verse eid="JER 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14"/>Mɛtotow wɔn abobɔ wɔn ho wɔn ho, agyanom ne mmabarima nyinaa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. Meremma ahummɔbɔ anaa ayamye anaa ayamhyehye nsiw ɔsɛe a merebɛsɛe wɔn no ho kwan.’ ”<verse eid="JER 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnommumfa Ho Ahunahuna</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15"/>Muntie na monyɛ aso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">na monnyɛ ahantan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akasa.<verse eid="JER 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16"/>Monhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, anuonyam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">ansa na wama sum aduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ansa na mo anan ahintihintiw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">wɔ nkoko a ɛso reduru sum no so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">Mo ani da hann so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">nanso ɔbɛdan no sum kusuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">na wɔasesa ayɛ no sum kabii.<verse eid="JER 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17"/>Nanso sɛ moantie a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">mesu wɔ kokoa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">esiane mo ahantan nti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">mʼani bɛtaataa nsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">na nusu aguare me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">efisɛ wɔbɛfa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nguankuw no akɔ nnommum mu.<verse eid="JER 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18"/>Monka nkyerɛ ɔhene ne ɔhemmea se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">“Mumfi mo ahengua so nsi fam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">na mo anuonyam ahenkyɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">befi mo ti so.”<verse eid="JER 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19"/>Wɔbɛtoto Negeb nkuropɔn apon mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">na obiara nni hɔ a obebuebue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Wɔbɛsoa Yudafo akɔ nnommum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">wobetwa wɔn asu koraa.<verse eid="JER 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20"/>Mo mpagyaw mo ani nhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">wɔn a wofi atifi fam reba no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Nguankuw a wɔde hyɛɛ mo nsa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">nguan a mode wɔn hoahoaa mo ho no wɔ he?<verse eid="JER 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de wɔn a wɔyɛ mo nnamfonom yɛ mo so atitiriw a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">dɛn na mobɛka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Na ɛrenyɛ mo yaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">te sɛnea ɔbea ɔreko awo ana?<verse eid="JER 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22"/>Na sɛ wubebisa wo ho se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">“Adɛn nti na eyi aba me so a?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Na efi wʼamumɔyɛ bebrebe no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">nti na wɔatetew wo fam atade mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">ayɛ wo nipadua basaa no.<verse eid="JER 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23"/>Etiopiani betumi asesa nʼahosu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">Na ɔsebɔ nso betumi asesa ne ho nsisimu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Saa ara na worentumi nyɛ papa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">wo a bɔneyɛ akokwaw wo no.<verse eid="JER 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24"/>“Mɛbɔ mo ahwete sɛ ntɛtɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">nweatam so mframa rebɔ no.<verse eid="JER 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25"/>Eyi ne nea mubenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">mo kyɛfa a mahyɛ ama mo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“efisɛ mo werɛ afi me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">na mode mo ho ato anyame huhuw so.<verse eid="JER 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26"/>Mɛtwe mo fam ntade abua mo anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">na wɔahu mo ahohora.<verse eid="JER 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27"/>Mo aguamammɔ ne mo akɔnnɔ bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">mo aguamammɔ a momfɛre ho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Mahu mo nneyɛe bɔne no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">wɔ nkoko ne sare so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Due, Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Wobɛyɛ fi akosi da bɛn?”<verse eid="JER 13:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsuyow, Ɔkɔm, Afoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1"/>Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔde maa Yeremia a ɛfa nsuyow ho:<verse eid="JER 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2"/>“Yuda resu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">ne nkuropɔn hu amane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">wɔbɔ asase no ho abubuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">na osu foro fi Yerusalem kɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3"/>Mmapɔmma soma wɔn asomfo ma wɔkɔhwehwɛ nsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">wɔkɔhwɛ ahina mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">nanso wonnya nsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Wɔde wɔn asuhina san ba a hwee nni mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">wɔde awerɛhow ne abawpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">katakata wɔn ti so.<verse eid="JER 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4"/>Asase no apaapae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">efisɛ osu ntɔ wɔ asase no so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">akuafo no koma atutu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">na wɔkata wɔn ti so.<verse eid="JER 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5"/>Mpo ɔforotebere a ɔwɔ sare so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">gyaw ne ba a wawo no foforo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">efisɛ sare biara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6"/>Sare so mfurum gyinagyina nkoko wosee no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">home sɛ sakraman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">wɔkrankran wɔn ani hwehwɛ didibea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">nanso wonhu bi.”<verse eid="JER 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ yɛn amumɔyɛ di adanse tia yɛn de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo din nti yɛ ho biribi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Yɛn atuatew dɔɔso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">na yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo.<verse eid="JER 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8"/>Wo a woyɛ Israel Anidaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">nʼAgyenkwa wɔ amanehunu mmere mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">adɛn nti na woayɛ sɛ ɔhɔho wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">sɛ ɔkwantuni a ɔsoɛ anadwo?<verse eid="JER 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9"/>Adɛn nti na woayɛ sɛ obi a ade afu ne mu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">sɛ ɔkofo a onni ahoɔden a ɔde boa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Wowɔ yɛn ntam, <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">na wo din da yɛn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">nnyaw yɛn mu!<verse eid="JER 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10"/>Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa saa nnipa yi ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Wɔn ani gye akyinkyinakyinkyin ho yiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">wɔmma wɔn anan nhome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Ɛno nti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnye wɔn nto mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">afei ɔbɛkae wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">na watwe wɔn aso wɔ wɔn bɔne ho.”<verse eid="JER 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Mmɔ yiyeyɛ ho mpae mma saa nnipa yi. <verse eid="JER 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12"/>Mmom ɛwɔ mu sɛ wodi mmuada de, nso merentie wɔn sufrɛ; ɛwɔ mu sɛ wɔbɔ ɔhyew afɔre ne aduan afɔre de, nso merennye. Mmom, mede afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛsɛe wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13"/>Nanso mekae se, “Ao, Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, adiyifo no ka kyerɛ wɔn daa se, ‘Morenhu afoa, na ɔkɔm remma. Nokware mɛma mo asomdwoe a ɛbɛtena hɔ daa wɔ ha.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Adiyifo no hyɛ akɔntoro wɔ me din mu. Mensomaa wɔn, minnyii wɔn na menkasa nkyerɛɛ wɔn ɛ. Wɔrehyɛ nkɔm fa atoro anisoadehu, asumansɛm, abosonsom ne wɔn ankasa nnaadaa adwene ho. <verse eid="JER 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15"/>Ɛno nti, nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa adiyifo a wɔde me din hyɛ nkɔm no ho ni: mensomaa wɔn nanso wɔka se, ‘Afoa biara anaa ɔkɔm biara remma asase yi so.’ Saa adiyifo no ara bɛtotɔ wɔ afoa ano ne ɔkɔm mu. <verse eid="JER 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16"/>Na nnipa a wɔhyɛ nkɔm kyerɛ wɔn no, wɔbɛtotow wɔn agu Yerusalem mmɔnten so esiane ɔkɔm ne afoa nti. Wɔrenya obiara nsie wɔn: wɔn yerenom, wɔn mmabarima anaa wɔn mmabea. Mɛma amanehunu a ɛfata wɔn aba wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17"/>“Ka saa asɛm yi kyerɛ wɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">“ ‘ma nisu nguare me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">anadwo ne awia, a to ntwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">efisɛ Ɔbabea Babun no, me nkurɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">anya apirakuru a ɛyɛ hu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">na ɛyɛ ahodwiriw mmoroso.<verse eid="JER 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18"/>Sɛ mekɔ ɔman no mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mihu nnipa a wɔatotɔ wɔ afoa ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">sɛ mekɔ kuropɔn no mu a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mihu ɔkɔm nsunsuanso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Odiyifo ne ɔsɔfo nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">kɔ asase a wonnim so so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19"/>Woapo Yuda koraa ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Wubu Sion animtiaa ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Adɛn nti na wode ɔhaw aba yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">na yennya ayaresa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Yɛn ani daa asomdwoe so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">nanso ade papa biara mmaa ɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">yɛn ani daa ayaresa bere so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">nanso ehu na ɛbae.<verse eid="JER 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yegye yɛn amumɔyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ne yɛn agyanom afɔdi to mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">nokware, yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo.<verse eid="JER 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21"/>Na wo din nti mmu yɛn animtiaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">nhura wʼanuonyam ahengua no ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Kae wo ne yɛn apam no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">na mmu so.<verse eid="JER 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22"/>Na amanaman ahoni ahuhuw no mu bi ma osu tɔ ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Wim ankasa na ɛtɔ obosu ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Dabi da, ɛyɛ wo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Enti wo so na yɛn ani da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">na wo na woyɛ eyinom nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Sɛ mpo, Mose ne Samuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mose ne Samuel. Wogyee din efisɛ wogyinaa mu maa Israel nnebɔneyɛfo no wɔ Awurade anim. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">2 Mose 32.11-14</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:30-34">30-34</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:13-23">4 Mose 14.13-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:18-20">5 Mose 9.18-20</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 9:25-29">25-29</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:5-9">1 Sam 7.5-9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:19-25">12.19-25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:6-8">Nnw 99.6-8</ref></char>).</char></note> begyinaa mʼanim a anka me koma rentɔ nkɔ saa nnipa yi so. Ma womfi mʼani so! Ma wɔnkɔ! <verse eid="JER 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2"/>Na sɛ wobisa wo se, ‘Ɛhe na yɛnkɔ’ a, ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“ ‘Wɔn a wɔahyɛ owu ama wɔn no, bɛkɔ owu mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ afoa ama wɔn no bɛtotɔ wɔ afoa ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ ɔkɔm ama wɔn no, ɔkɔm bɛde wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ nnommumfa ama wɔn no bɛkɔ nnommum mu.’<verse eid="JER 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3"/>“Mede adesɛefo ahorow anan bɛba wɔn so,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “afoa a ebekunkum wɔn, akraman a wɔbɛtwe wɔn ase akɔ, wim nnomaa ne asase so mmoa a wɔbɛtetew wɔn nam asɛe wɔn. <verse eid="JER 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4"/>Mɛma wɔayɛ akyiwade ama asase so ahenni nyinaa, esiane nea Yudahene Hesekia babarima Manase yɛɛ wɔ Yerusalem nti.<verse eid="JER 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5"/>“Hena na obehu wo mmɔbɔ, Yerusalem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Hena na obegyam wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Hena na obegyina abisa sɛnea wo ho te?<verse eid="JER 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6"/>Woapo me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">“Wugu akyirisan so ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Ɛno nti mɛteɛ me nsa wɔ wo so na masɛe wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">Me yam renhyehye me mma wo bio.<verse eid="JER 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7"/>Mede nhuhuwso apampaa behuhuw wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">wɔ asase no kuropɔn apon ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Mede owu ne ɔsɛe bɛba me nkurɔfo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">efisɛ wɔnsakraa wɔn akwan ɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8"/>Mɛma wɔn akunafo adɔɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">asen mpoano nwea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Mede ɔsɛefo bɛba owigyinae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">abɛhaw wɔn mmerante nanom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">mpofirim mede</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ɔyaw ne ehu bɛba wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9"/>Ɔbeatan a wawo ason bɛtɔ beraw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">na wagyaa mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Ne wia bɛtɔ wɔ bere a ade nsaa ɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">wobegu nʼanim ase abrɛ no ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Mede nkae no bɛma afoa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">wɔ wɔn atamfo anim,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10"/>Ao, me na a wowoo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">onipa a asase no sofo nyinaa ne me ham, di aperepere!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Memfɛm obi biribi na memmɔɔ bosea mfii obi hɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">nanso obiara dome me.<verse eid="JER 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">“Nokware megye wo ama botae pa bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">ampa ara mɛma wʼatamfo apa wo kyɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">wɔ amanehunu ne ahohia mmere mu.<verse eid="JER 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12"/>“Onipa betumi abu dade mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:12">dade a efi atifi fam, anaa kɔbere?<verse eid="JER 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13"/>“Mo ahode ne mo nnwetɛbona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">mede bɛma sɛ wɔmfom a wɔrentua ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">esiane mo nnebɔne nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">wɔ mo man no mu nti.<verse eid="JER 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14"/>Mede mo bɛyɛ nkoa ama mo atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">wɔ ɔman a munnim so so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">mʼabufuw bɛma ogya adɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">na ɛbɛhyew mo.”<verse eid="JER 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15"/>Wote ase, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">kae me na hwɛ me so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">Tɔ wɔn a wɔtaa me no so were.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Wowɔ abodwokyɛre, mma me nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">hwɛ sɛnea wo nti wɔbɔ me ahohora.<verse eid="JER 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16"/>Wo nsɛm bae no, midii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">ɛyɛɛ mʼahosɛpɛw ne me koma apɛde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">na wo din da me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">Ao, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17"/>Mantena wɔn a wogye wɔn ani fekuw mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">ne wɔn annye wɔn ani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">metew me ho tenae, efisɛ wo nsa daa me so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">na wʼabufuw hyɛɛ me ma.<verse eid="JER 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18"/>Adɛn nti na me yaw to ntwa da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">na mʼapirakuru ayɛ akisikuru a ano yɛ den?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Wopɛ sɛ woyɛ sɛ nnaadaa asuwa ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">sɛ asuti a ɛyow ana?<verse eid="JER 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19"/>Enti sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">“Sɛ wosakra wʼadwene a megye wo ato mu bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">na woasom me;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">sɛ nsɛm a edi mu fi wʼanom, na ɛnyɛ nsɛm huhuw a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">wobɛyɛ me kasamafo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Ma saa nnipa yi nnan mmra wo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">na wo de, ɛnsɛ sɛ wodan kɔ wɔn nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20"/>Mede wo bɛyɛ ɔfasu ama saa nnipa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">bammɔ fasu a wɔde kɔbere ato;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">wɔne wo bedi asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">nanso wɔrenni wo so nkonim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">efisɛ me ne wo wɔ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">sɛ meyi wo na magye wo nkwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.<verse eid="JER 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21"/>“Megye wo nkwa afi amumɔyɛfo nsam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">na mayi wo afi atirimɔdenfo nsam.”<verse eid="JER 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Amanehunu Da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se: <verse eid="JER 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2"/>“Ɛnsɛ sɛ woware na wowo mmabarima anaa mmabea wɔ ha.” <verse eid="JER 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa mmabarima ne mmabea a wɔwo wɔn asase yi so; mmea a wɔyɛ wɔn nanom ne mmarima a wɔyɛ wɔn agyanom no ho: <verse eid="JER 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4"/>“Owuyare bekunkum wɔn. Wɔrensu wɔn na wɔrensie wɔn, mmom wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a egugu fam. Wɔbɛtotɔ afoa ano na ɔkɔm bekunkum wɔn na wɔn afunu bɛyɛ aduan ama wim nnomaa ne asase so mmoa.”<verse eid="JER 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5"/>“Nhyɛn ofi a ayiyɛ aponto wo mu; nkosu wɔn abia, na mma wɔn hyɛden, efisɛ mayi me nhyira, me dɔ ne mʼahummɔbɔ afi saa nnipa yi so,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6"/>Atitiriw ne mpapahwekwa bewuwu wɔ asase yi so. Wɔrensie wɔn na wɔrensu wɔn na obiara remmɔ ne ho kam, na ɔrenyi ne ti wɔ wɔn nti. <verse eid="JER 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7"/>Obiara remma wɔn a wodi awufo no ho awerɛhow no aduan mfa nkyekye wɔn werɛ, owufo no agya anaa ne na mpo, obiara remma wɔn nsa mfa nkyekye wɔn werɛ.<verse eid="JER 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8"/>“Na nhyɛn ofi a aponto kɔ so wɔ mu nkɔtena ase, nnidi na nnom. <verse eid="JER 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo, Israel Nyankopɔn no se: Wo nkwanna mu a wʼani tua no, mede ahosɛpɛw ne anigye nnyigyei, ayeforokunu ne ayeforo ahosɛpɛw nne a ɛwɔ ha no bɛba awiei.<verse eid="JER 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10"/>“Sɛ woka eyinom nyinaa kyerɛ saa nnipa yi na wobisa wo se, ‘Adɛn nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abɔ atoyerɛnkyɛm a ɛyɛ hu sɛɛ atia yɛn? Dɛn mfomso na yɛayɛ? Bɔne bɛn na yɛayɛ atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn’ a, <verse eid="JER 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11"/>ɛno de ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Efisɛ mo agyanom gyaw me hɔ kodii anyame foforo akyi, kɔsom wɔn sɔree wɔn, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ni. Wogyaw me na wɔanni me mmara so. <verse eid="JER 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12"/>Na mo de, moayɛ amumɔyɛsɛm asen mo agyanom. Monhwɛ sɛnea mo mu biara di ne koma bɔne asoɔden akyi wɔ bere a anka ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ osetie ma me. <verse eid="JER 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13"/>Ɛno nti, metu mo afi saa asase yi so de mo akɔ asase a, mo anaasɛ mo agyanom nnim so, na mobɛsom anyame foforo wɔ hɔ awia ne anadwo, na merenhu mo mmɔbɔ.’<verse eid="JER 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14"/>“Nanso nna no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “a nnipa renka bio se, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, nea oyii Israelfo fii Misraim,’ <verse eid="JER 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15"/>mmom, wɔbɛka se, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi nea oyii Israelfo fii atifi fam asase ne aman a otuu wɔn kɔɔ so nyinaa.’ Efisɛ mɛsan de wɔn aba asase a mede maa wɔn tete agyanom no no so.<verse eid="JER 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16"/>“Na mprempren, mɛsoma apopofo bebree a wɔbɛkyere wɔn.” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. “Ɛno akyi, mɛsoma akɔfa abɔmmɔfo bebree a wɔbɛtaataa wɔn wɔ mmepɔw ne nkoko nyinaa so ne abotan atokuru mu. <verse eid="JER 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17"/>Mʼani tua wɔn akwan nyinaa; enhintaw me, na wɔn bɔne nso nhintaw wɔ mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18"/>Metua wɔn amumɔyɛ ne wɔn bɔne so ka mprenu, efisɛ wɔde aniwude nsɛsode a enni nkwa ne wɔn ahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwade abɛhyɛ mʼagyapade so ma de agu mʼasase ho fi.”<verse eid="JER 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mʼahoɔden ne mʼabandennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">mʼahohia mu guankɔbea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">wo nkyɛn na amanaman no bɛba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">wobefi nsase ano aka se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Yɛn agyanom annya biribiara sɛ anyame huhuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">ahoni a wɔn so nni mfaso na wɔammoa wɔn.<verse eid="JER 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20"/>Nnipa yɛ wɔn ankasa anyame ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Yiw, nanso wɔnyɛ nokware anyame!”<verse eid="JER 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21"/>“Ɛno nti mɛkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">saa bere yi nea mɛkyerɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">me tumi ne mʼahoɔden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Afei wobehu sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">me din ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JER 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1"/>“Wɔde dade kyerɛwdua akrukyerɛw Yuda bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">dade kyerɛwdua a ano te sɛ kyerɛwbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">wɔ wɔn koma apon so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">ne wɔn afɔremuka mmɛn so.<verse eid="JER 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2"/>Mpo, wɔn mma kae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">wɔn afɔremuka ne Asera nnua</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">a ɛwɔ nnua a adennan no nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">ne nkoko atenten no so.<verse eid="JER 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3"/>Me mmepɔw a ɛwɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">mo ahonyade ne mo nnwetɛbona nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">mede bɛma sɛ asade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ɛne mo sorɔnsorɔmmea nso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">esiane mo man no so bɔne nti.<verse eid="JER 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4"/>Mo ankasa mfomso nti mobɛhwere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">agyapade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">agyapade—Kanaan asase.</char></note> a mede maa mo no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Mede mo bɛyɛ nkoa ama mo atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">wɔ asase a munnim so so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">efisɛ moahwanyan mʼabufuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">na ɛbɛtena hɔ daa.”<verse eid="JER 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Nnome nka nea ɔde ne ho to onipa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">nea ɔde ne ho to ɔhonam so pɛ nʼahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">na ne koma dan fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho.<verse eid="JER 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6"/>Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ wura a ɛwɔ nsase tamaa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">sɛ yiyedi ba a ɔrenhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">ɔbɛtena nweatam a awo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">ne nkyene asase a obi nte so so.<verse eid="JER 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7"/>“Nhyira nka onipa a ɔde ne ho to <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">na nʼanidaso wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="JER 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8"/>Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ dua a wɔadua no asu ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">na ne ntin teɛ kɔ asu no mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Sɛ ahuhuru ba a onsuro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">ne nhaban yɛ frɔmfrɔm mmere nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Onni ɔhaw biara wɔ afe a osu ntɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">na ɛkɔ so sow aba daa.”<verse eid="JER 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9"/>Koma yɛ nnaadaa sen ade nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">na ano nni aduru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">Hena na ɔbɛte nʼase?<verse eid="JER 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10"/>“Me <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mepɛɛpɛɛ koma mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">na mehwehwɛ adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">gyina so de tua onipa ka sɛnea nʼabrabɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">ne sɛnea ɛfata ne nneyɛe.”<verse eid="JER 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11"/>Sɛnea asɛmɛntɛ a osow nkesua a ɛnyɛ ɔno na ɔtowee no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">saa ara na onipa a onya sika a ɔmfa ɔkwan pa so no te.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Sɛ obu ne nkwa nna mu abien a wobegyaw no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">na awiei no, ne kwasea bɛda adi.<verse eid="JER 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12"/>Anuonyam ahengua a wɔama so fi mfiase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">ne yɛn kronkronbea.<verse eid="JER 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woyɛ Israel anidaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">wɔn a wɔpa wʼakyi nyinaa ani bewu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Wɔn a wɔtwe wɔn ho fi wo ho no, wobesie wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">efisɛ wɔagyaw <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">a ɔyɛ nkwa asuti no.<verse eid="JER 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14"/>Sa me yare <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na me ho bɛtɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">gye me na menya nkwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">na wo ne ɔbaako a mekamfo wo.<verse eid="JER 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15"/>Wobisa me daa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">“Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm no wɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Ma ɛmmra mu mprempren!”<verse eid="JER 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16"/>Minnguan mfii mʼadwuma sɛ wo guanhwɛfo ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">wunim sɛ menhwehwɛɛ abasamtu da.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">Nea efi mʼanom yɛ pefee wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="JER 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17"/>Nhunahuna me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">wo ne me guankɔbea wɔ amanehunu da.<verse eid="JER 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18"/>Ma wɔn a wɔtaa me anim ngu ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">na yi me fi ahohora mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Ma wɔmmɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">nanso mma me koma ntu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Ma amanehunu da no mmra wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">fa ɔhawprenu sɛe wɔn.<verse eid="JER 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Monyɛ Homeda No Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me, “Kɔ na kogyina nnipa no pon a Yuda ahemfo di hɔ ahyɛmfiri no; kogyina Yerusalem apon a aka no nso ano. <verse eid="JER 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yuda ahemfo ne Yudafo nyinaa ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem a wɔfa saa apon yi mu. <verse eid="JER 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Monhwɛ yiye na moansoa nnesoa Homeda anaa moamfa amfa Yerusalem apon mu. <verse eid="JER 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22"/>Monnsoa adesoa mfi mo afi mu na monnyɛ adwuma biara Homeda, na mmom monyɛ Homeda no kronkron, sɛnea mehyɛɛ mo agyanom no. <verse eid="JER 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23"/>Nanso wɔantie na wɔammu; wɔyɛɛ asoɔden, wɔantie na wɔampɛ nteɛso. <verse eid="JER 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24"/>Nanso sɛ mohwɛ yiye na moyɛ osetie ma me a, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, na moamfa nnesoa amfa saa kuropɔn yi apon mu Homeda, na sɛ moyɛ Homeda no kronkron a monnyɛ adwuma biara a, <verse eid="JER 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25"/>ɛno de ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahengua so ne wɔn adwumayɛfo bɛfa saa apon yi mu. Wɔn nyinaa bɛba a wɔtete nteaseɛnam mu ne apɔnkɔ so, a Yuda mmarima ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem ka ho, na nnipa bɛtena kuropɔn yi mu daa nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26"/>Nnipa befi Yuda nkurow ne nkuraa a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no aba, wobefi Benyamin asase ne atɔe fam nkoko so, wobefi mmepɔw, mantam ne Negeb aba a wɔde ɔhyew afɔrebɔde ne afɔrebɔ, aduan afɔrebɔde, nnuhuam ne aseda afɔrebɔde reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi. <verse eid="JER 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27"/>Nanso sɛ moanyɛ osetie amma me, anyɛ Homeda no kronkron, na sɛ mosoa adesoa biara fa Yerusalem apon mu Homeda a, ɛno de mɛsɔ ogya a ɛrennum da wɔ Yerusalem apon mu na abɛhyew nʼaban ahorow no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔnwemfo No Fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1"/>Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛbaa Yeremia nkyɛn. <verse eid="JER 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2"/>“Kɔ ɔnwemfo no fi, na hɔ na mede mʼasɛm no bɛma wo.” <verse eid="JER 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3"/>Ɛno nti, mekɔɔ ɔnwemfo no fi na mihuu no sɛ, ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ ne ntwahode so. <verse eid="JER 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4"/>Nanso kuku a na ɔde dɔte no reyɛ ho adwuma no sɛe wɔ ne nsam; ɛno nti ɔnwemfo no yɛɛ kuku foforo, sɛnea eye pa ara ma no.<verse eid="JER 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se: <verse eid="JER 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6"/>“Israelfi, merentumi nyɛ mo sɛnea ɔnwemfo yi yɛ ana?” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. “Sɛnea dɔte te wɔ ɔnwemfo nsam no, saa ara na mote wɔ me nsam, Israelfi. <verse eid="JER 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7"/>Sɛ bere biara meka se ɛsɛ sɛ wotutu ɔman bi anaa ahenni bi ase, dwerɛw wɔn, sɛe wɔn a, <verse eid="JER 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8"/>na sɛ ɔman a mebɔɔ no kɔkɔ no sakra fi ne bɔne ho a, mɛsakra mʼadwene na meremfa amanehunu a misusuwii sɛ mede bɛba wɔn so mma bio. <verse eid="JER 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9"/>Na sɛ mmere foforo bi meka se, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkyekye ɔman anaa ahenni bi gye no si hɔ, <verse eid="JER 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10"/>na sɛ ɔyɛ bɔne wɔ mʼani so na wanyɛ osetie amma me a, ɛno de mesan adwene papa a mepɛɛ sɛ meyɛ no no ho.<verse eid="JER 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11"/>“Na afei ka kyerɛ Yudafo ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem no se, ‘Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Hwɛ! mede amanehunu reba mo so, na mereyɛ nhyehyɛe a etia mo. Ɛno nti mo mu biara nnan mfi nʼakwammɔne so na munsiesie mo akwan ne mo nneyɛe.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12"/>Nanso wobebua se, ‘So nni mfaso. Yɛbɛkɔ so adi yɛn ara yɛn nhyehyɛe so; yɛn mu biara bɛyɛ asoɔden a efi ne koma bɔne mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13"/>Ɛno nti nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Mummisa wɔ amanaman no mu se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">hena na wate biribi sɛɛ pɛn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Ɔbabun Israel ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">ade bi a ɛyɛ hu yiye.<verse eid="JER 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14"/>So sukyerɛmma a ɛwɔ Lebanon no<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lebanon—Ɛyɛ mmepɔw atenten a ɛwɔ atifi fam no mu baako a ne sorokɔ boro anammɔn mpem du.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">yera fi nʼabotan a esian no so ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">So nʼatifi nsu wiridudu a efi akyirikyiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">no gyae sen ana?<verse eid="JER 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15"/>Nanso me nkurɔfo werɛ afi me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">Wɔhyew nnuhuam ma ahoni huhuw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">a ɛma wohintihintiw wɔ wɔn akwan so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ne tete atempɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Wɔma wɔfa kwatikwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ne akwan a wɔmmɔe so.<verse eid="JER 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16"/>Wɔn asase bɛda mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">na ayɛ ade a wobebu no animtiaa daa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">wɔn a wotwa mu hɔ no ho bedwiriw wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">na wobehinhim wɔn ti.<verse eid="JER 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17"/>Sɛnea apuei mframa te no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete wɔ wɔn atamfo anim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">mɛdan mʼakyi akyerɛ wɔn na ɛnyɛ mʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">wɔ wɔn amanehunu da no.”<verse eid="JER 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18"/>Wɔkae se, “Mommra ma yɛmfa adwene ntia Yeremia; sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a asɔfo no nkyerɛkyerɛ a ɛfa mmara no ho, anyansafo no afotu anaa asɛm a efi adiyifo hɔ no renyera. Mommra na yentu yɛn ano ngu ne so a yɛrentie nea ɔbɛka biara.”<verse eid="JER 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19"/>Yɛ aso ma me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">tie nea wɔn a wɔpam me ti so no reka!<verse eid="JER 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde bɔne tua papa so ka ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Nanso wɔatu amoa ama me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Kae sɛ migyinaa wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">na mekasa maa wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">sɛnea wubeyi wʼabufuwhyew afi wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21"/>Ɛno nti, ma ɔkɔm nne wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">yi wɔn ma afoa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Ma wɔn yerenom nyɛ abonin ne akunafo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">ma wonkunkum wɔn mmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">na wɔmfa afoa nkunkum wɔn mmerante wɔ ɔko mu.<verse eid="JER 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22"/>Ma wɔnte osu wɔ wɔn afi mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">bere a atamfo atu wɔn so sa mpofirim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">efisɛ wɔatu amoa ama me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">na wɔasunsum mʼanan mfiri.<verse eid="JER 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23"/>Nanso wunim <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">pɔw a wɔabɔ nyinaa se wobekum me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Mfa wɔn nsɛmmɔne nkyɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">na nyi wʼani mfi wɔn bɔne so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Ma wonni nkogu wɔ wʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">na wo ne wɔn nni wɔ wʼabufuw mu.<verse eid="JER 18:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: “Kɔ na kɔtɔ dɔtekuruwa fi ɔnwemfo nkyɛn. Fa nnipa no mpanyimfo no mu bi ne asɔfo no mu bi ka wo ho <verse eid="JER 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2"/>na fi adi kɔ Ben Hinom Bon a ɛbɛn Pɔthɛd Pon ano no. Ɛhɔ na pae mu ka nsɛm a meka kyerɛ wo no, <verse eid="JER 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3"/>se, ‘Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yuda ahemfo ne Yerusalemfo. Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Israel Nyankopɔn se. Muntie, mede amanehunu reba ha, na obiara a ɔbɛte no aso mu bɛyɛ no yonn. <verse eid="JER 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4"/>Efisɛ wɔagyaw me na wɔde ha ama ananafo anyame; wɔahyew afɔrebɔde wɔ so ama anyame a wɔn anaa wɔn agyanom, anaa Yuda ahemfo nhuu wɔn da, na wɔde mogya a edi bem ahyɛ ha ma. <verse eid="JER 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5"/>Wɔasisi Baal sorɔnsorɔmmea sɛ wɔde ogya bɛhyew wɔn mmabarima sɛ afɔrebɔde ama Baal, ade a manhyɛ anaa mammɔ so, anaa amma mʼadwene mu. <verse eid="JER 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6"/>Ɛno nti, monhwɛ yiye na nna bi reba, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, a nnipa remfrɛ ha se Tofet anaa Ben Hinom Bon bio, na mmom, Okum Bon.<verse eid="JER 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7"/>“ ‘Mɛsɛe Yuda ne Yerusalem nhyehyɛe wɔ ha. Mɛma wɔatotɔ wɔ afoa ano wɔ wɔn atamfo a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn nkwa no anim, na mede wɔn afunu bɛma wim nnomaa ne asase so mmoa sɛ wɔn aduan. <verse eid="JER 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8"/>Mɛsɛe saa kuropɔn yi na mayɛ no ahodwiriwde; wɔn a wotwa mu wɔ hɔ no nyinaa ho bedwiriw wɔn, na nʼapirakuru no nti wobedi ne ho fɛw. <verse eid="JER 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9"/>Mɛma wɔawe wɔn mmabarima ne wɔn mmabea nam, na wobefi ahohia a atamfo a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn nkwa no anotua de bɛba wɔn so no mu awe wɔn ho wɔn ho nam.’<verse eid="JER 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10"/>“Afei bɔ kuruwa no wɔ wɔn a wɔka wo ho no anim ma wɔnhwɛ, <verse eid="JER 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11"/>na ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Mɛbɔ saa ɔman yi ne kuropɔn yi sɛnea wɔabɔ ɔnwemfo kuruwa yi a wɔrentumi nsiesie bio. Wobesie awufo wɔ Tofet kosi sɛ, ɛhɔ bɛyɛ ma. <verse eid="JER 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12"/>Sɛɛ ara na mɛyɛ saa beae yi ne wɔn a wɔtete so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. Mɛyɛ kuropɔn yi sɛ Tofet. <verse eid="JER 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13"/>Afi a ɛwɔ Yerusalem ne Yuda ahemfo ahemfi ho begu fi te sɛ Tofet ha. Afi a wɔhyew nnuhuam wɔ adan atifi maa ɔsoro asafo nyinaa na woguu nsa maa anyame foforo no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14"/>Afei Yeremia san fii Tofet, faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa no se ɔnkɔhyɛ nkɔm wɔ hɔ no bae, na Obegyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan abangua mu na ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa se, <verse eid="JER 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se, ‘Muntie! Mede amanehunu a meka guu kuropɔn yi ne ho nkuraase no nyinaa so no bɛba wɔn so, efisɛ wɔyɛɛ asoɔden, na wɔantie me nsɛm.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ne Pashur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1"/>Bere a Imer a ɔyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu adwumayɛfo so panyin babarima ɔsɔfo Pashur tee sɛ Yeremia rehyɛ nkɔm fa saa nneɛma yi ho no, <verse eid="JER 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2"/>ɔma wɔboroo Yeremia, na wɔbɔɔ no dua mu wɔ Benyamin Atifi Pon a ɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu hɔ no. <verse eid="JER 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3"/>Ade kyee a Pashur san no no, Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> din a ɔde ama wo no nyɛ Pashur na mmom Magormisabib. <verse eid="JER 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Mɛma wo ho ayɛ hu ama wʼankasa ne wo nnamfonom nyinaa, wʼankasa de wʼani behu sɛ wɔtotɔ wɔ wɔn atamfo mfoa ano. Mede Yuda nyinaa bɛma Babiloniahene na wasoa wɔn akɔ Babilonia anaasɛ ɔde afoa bekunkum wɔn. <verse eid="JER 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5"/>Mede kuropɔn yi ahode, nʼadwumayɛ so aba, ne nneɛma a ɛsom bo ne Yuda ahemfo nnwetɛbona nyinaa bɛma wɔn atamfo. Wɔbɛfa no sɛ asade akɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6"/>Na wo Pashur, ne wo fifo nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommum mu wɔ Babilonia. Ɛhɔ na wo ne wo nnamfonom a wohyɛɛ wɔn akɔntoro no nyinaa bewuwu na wɔasie mo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wodaadaa me na ɛbaa mu saa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">wudii me so na wutintim me so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Wodii me ho fɛw da mu nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">na obiara serew me.<verse eid="JER 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8"/>Bere biara a mɛkasa no, meteɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">pae mu ka akakabensɛm ne ɔsɛe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm de ahohora ne nsopa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">abrɛ me da mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9"/>Sɛ meka se, “Meremmɔ ne din</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">anaa merenkasa wɔ ne din mu” a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">nʼasɛm te sɛ ogya wɔ me koma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ogya a wɔde ahyɛ me nnompe mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">mabrɛ ne ne kita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">nokware, merentumi.<verse eid="JER 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10"/>Mete asomsɛm bebree sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">“Ehu wɔ baabiara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">Montoa no! Momma yɛnkɔtoa no!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Me nnamfonom nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">retwɛn sɛ mɛwatiri, na wɔka se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Ebia wɔbɛdaadaa no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">na yɛatumi no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">atɔ ne so were.”<verse eid="JER 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka me ho sɛ dɔmbarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">enti mʼataafo bɛwatiri na wɔrentumi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Wobedi nkogu na wobegu wɔn anim ase pasaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">wɔn werɛ remfi wɔn nsopa no da.<verse eid="JER 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>! Wo a wosɔ ɔtreneeni hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">na wopɛɛpɛɛ koma ne adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">ma minhu wʼaweretɔ wɔ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">efisɛ mede mʼasɛm dan wo.<verse eid="JER 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13"/>Monto dwom mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">Munyi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Ogye ohiani nkwa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">amumɔyɛfo nsam.<verse eid="JER 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14"/>Nnome nka da a wɔwoo me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">Nhyira mpare da a me na woo me.<verse eid="JER 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15"/>Nnome nka onipa a ɔbɛbɔɔ mʼagya amanneɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">nea ɔmaa nʼani gyei, na ɔkae se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">“Wɔawo ɔbabarima ama wo!”<verse eid="JER 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16"/>Ma saa onipa no nyɛ sɛ nkurow a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tu gui a wannya ahummɔbɔ no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Ma ɔnte osu anɔpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">ne akobɛn nnyigyei owigyinae.<verse eid="JER 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17"/>Sɛ wankum me wɔ awotwaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">amma me na anyɛ ɔda amma me no nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">nʼawotwaa yɛɛ kɛse afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18"/>Adɛn koraa na mifii awotwaa mu pue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">behuu ɔhaw ne awerɛhow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">na mede aniwu rebewie me nkwa nna yi?<verse eid="JER 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Po Sedekia Abisade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1"/>Asɛm fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn bere a ɔhene Sedekia somaa Malkia babarima Pashur ne Maaseia babarima ɔsɔfo Sefania kɔɔ ne nkyɛn no. Wɔkae se, <verse eid="JER 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2"/>“Bisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ma yɛn efisɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne yɛn rebedi ako. Ebia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ anwonwade ama yɛn, sɛnea ɔyɛɛ mmere bi a atwa mu no na ama wafi yɛn so akɔ.”<verse eid="JER 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3"/>Na Yeremia buaa wɔn se, “Monka nkyerɛ Sedekia se, <verse eid="JER 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4"/>‘Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se ni: Merebɛdan mo nsam akode atia mo, nea mode reko atia Babiloniahene ne Babiloniafo a wɔwɔ ɔfasu no akyi na wɔatua mo kuropɔn no ano. Mɛboa wɔn ano wɔ kuropɔn yi mu. <verse eid="JER 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5"/>Me ara mede nsa a mateɛ ne abasa a ɛyɛ den bɛko atia mo wɔ abufuw, anibere ne abufuwhyew mu. <verse eid="JER 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6"/>Mɛbobɔ wɔn a wɔtete kuropɔn yi mu ahwehwe fam; nnipa ne mmoa nyinaa, na ɔyaredɔm a ɛyɛ hu bekunkum wɔn. <verse eid="JER 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7"/>Ɛno akyi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ni, mede Yudahene Sedekia, nʼadwumayɛfo ne nnipa a wɔwɔ kuropɔn yi mu a ɔyaredɔm, afoa ne ɔkɔm ankunkum wɔn no bɛma Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne wɔn atamfo a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn nkwa no. Ɔde afoa bekunkum wɔn; ɔrenhu wɔn mmɔbɔ na ɔrennya ayamhyehye mma wɔn.’<verse eid="JER 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8"/>“Bio, ka kyerɛ nnipa no se, ‘Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Hwɛ mede nkwa kwan ne owu kwan resi mo anim. <verse eid="JER 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9"/>Obiara a ɔte saa kuropɔn yi mu bewu wɔ afoa anaa ɔkɔm anaa ɔyaredɔm ano. Nanso obiara a obepue na ɔde ne ho akɔma Babiloniafo a wɔabetua mo kuropɔn yi no, bɛfa ne ho adi. <verse eid="JER 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10"/>Mawe ahinam sɛ mɛyɛ kuropɔn yi bɔne na ɛnyɛ papa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. Wɔde bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔde ogya bɛhyew no.’<verse eid="JER 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11"/>“Nea ɛka ho ne sɛ, ka kyerɛ Yuda adehye se, ‘Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm; <verse eid="JER 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12"/>Dawidfi, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">“ ‘Mummu atɛntrenee anɔpa biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">munnye nea wɔabɔ no korɔn no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">mfi ne nhyɛsofo nsam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">anyɛ saa a, mʼabufuwhyew bɛsɔre na ahyew sɛ ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">esiane bɔne a moayɛ nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">ɛbɛhyew a obiara rennum no.<verse eid="JER 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13"/>Mene mo anya, Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Mo a mote obon yi atifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">abotan asasetaw so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">mo a moka se, “Hena na obetumi ako atia yɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Hena na obetumi ahyɛn yɛn hintabea?”<verse eid="JER 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14"/>Mɛtwe mo aso sɛnea ɛfata mo nneyɛe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Mɛto mo kwae mu gya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">a ɛbɛhyew biribiara a atwa mo ho ahyia no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Atemmu A Etia Ahemfo Amumɔyɛfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Sian kɔ Yudahene ahemfi na kɔpae mu ka saa asɛm yi: <verse eid="JER 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2"/>‘Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Yudahene, wo a wote Dawid ahengua so, wo, wʼakannifo ne wo nkurɔfo a wɔfa apon yi mu. <verse eid="JER 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Monyɛ nea ɛteɛ na ɛnam kwan mu. Munnye nea wɔabɔ no korɔn mfi ne hyɛsofo nsam. Monnyɛ ɔhɔho, ayisaa ne okunafo bɔne na monnyɛ wɔn basabasa nso, na munnhwie mogya a edi bem ngu wɔ ha. <verse eid="JER 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4"/>Sɛ moyɛ ahwɛyie na mudi saa ahyɛde yi so a, ɛno de ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahengua so ne wɔn adwumayɛfo ne wɔn nkurɔfo bɛfa saa ahemfi apon yi mu, a wɔtete nteaseɛnam mu ne apɔnkɔ so. <verse eid="JER 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5"/>Enti sɛ moanni saa nhyehyɛe yi so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “Meka me ho ntam sɛ, saa ahemfi yi bɛdan ofituw.” ’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene ahemfi ho ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Ɛwɔ mu wote sɛ Gilead ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">te sɛ Lebanon mmepɔw atifi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">nokware, mɛyɛ wo sɛ nweatam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">sɛ nkurow a obiara nte mu.<verse eid="JER 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7"/>Mɛsoma asɛefo abɛtoa mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">obiara ne nʼakode,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">wobetwitwa mo sida mpuran fɛfɛ no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">na wɔatow agu ogya no mu.<verse eid="JER 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8"/>“Nnipa a wofifi aman bebree so betwa mu wɔ kuropɔn yi so, na wobebisabisa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, ‘Adɛn nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ saa kuropɔn kɛse yi sɛɛ?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9"/>Na mmuae no bɛyɛ sɛ, ‘Efisɛ wɔagyaw <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Nyankopɔn apam no akɔsɔre anyame afoforo asom wɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10"/>Munnsu ɔhene a wafi mu, na munni ne ho awerɛhow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">mmom, munsu dennen mma nea ɔkɔ nnommum mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">efisɛ ɔrensan nʼakyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">na ɔrenhu asase a wɔwoo no wɔ so no bio.<verse eid="JER 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka faa Yosia babarima Salum a odii nʼagya ade sɛ Yudahene na wafi ha no ho: “Ɔrensan mma bio. <verse eid="JER 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12"/>Obewu wɔ faako a wɔafa no nnommum kɔ hɔ; na ɔrenhu saa asase yi bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13"/>“Nnome nka nea ɔmfa ɔkwan trenee so nsi nʼahemfi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">ɔde asisi si nʼabansoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">ɔma ne manfo yɛ adwuma kwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">ontua wɔn apaade so ka.<verse eid="JER 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14"/>Ɔka se, ‘Mesi ahemfi kɛse ama me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">nea ɛwɔ abansoro adan a mu soso.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Enti ɔyɛ mfɛnsere akɛse wɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">ɔde sida dura mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">na ɔde ahosu kɔkɔɔ hyehyɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15"/>“Wowɔ sida bebree a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">na ɛma woyɛ ɔhene ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Na wʼagya nni aduan ne nsa ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">Ɔyɛɛ nea ɛfa ne kwan mu na ɛteɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">enti esii no yiye.<verse eid="JER 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16"/>Odii mmɔborɔfo ne ahiafo nsɛm maa wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">enti biribiara yɛɛ yiye maa no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Na ɛnyɛ eyi na ɛkyerɛ sɛ obi nim me ana?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17"/>“Mo ani ne mo koma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">wɔ mfaso bɔne nko ara so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">sɛ muhwie mogya a edi bem gu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">na moyɛ nhyɛso ne asisi nso.”<verse eid="JER 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18"/>Ɛno nti, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Wɔrensu no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘A, me nuabarima! A, me nuabea!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Wɔrensu no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘A, me wura! A, nʼahoɔfɛ!’<verse eid="JER 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19"/>Wobesie no sɛ afurum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">wɔbɛtwe nʼase na wɔatow no akyene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">Yerusalem apon akyi.”<verse eid="JER 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20"/>“Monkɔ Lebanon nkosu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">momma wɔnte mo nne wɔ Basan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">munsu mfi Abarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">efisɛ wɔadwerɛw mo dɔm nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21"/>Mebɔɔ wo kɔkɔ, bere a na ɛyɛ wo sɛ wʼasom adwo wo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">nanso wokae se, ‘Merentie!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Eyi ne ɔkwan a wonam so fi wo mmerantebere mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">woanyɛ osetie amma me.<verse eid="JER 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22"/>Mframa bɛbɔ wo nguanhwɛfo nyinaa akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">na wʼapamfo nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommum mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Afei wʼani bewu na wʼanim agu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">esiane wʼamumɔyɛ nyinaa nti.<verse eid="JER 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23"/>Mo a mote Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">na modeda sida adan mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">sɛnea mubesi apini wɔ ɔyaw mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">ɔyaw ɛte sɛ ɔbea a ɔreko awo de.<verse eid="JER 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24"/>“Nokware, sɛ mete ase yi,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “Mpo sɛ wo Yehoiakin, Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima yɛ me nsa nifa so nsɔwano kaa a, anka mɛworɔw wo. <verse eid="JER 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25"/>Mede wo bɛma wɔn a wɔrehwehwɛ wo kra, wɔn a wusuro wɔn no; Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne Babiloniafo. <verse eid="JER 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26"/>Mɛpam wo ne ɛna a ɔwoo wo no akogu ɔman foforo so, baabi a ɛnyɛ hɔ na wɔwoo mo mu biara, hɔ na mo baanu bewuwu. <verse eid="JER 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27"/>Morensan mma asase a mo kɔn dɔ sɛ mobɛsan aba so no so bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28"/>Saa ɔbarima Yehoiakin yi yɛ asɛnka a abɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">ade a obiara mpɛ ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Adɛn nti na wɔbɛpam ɔne ne mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">akogu asase a wonnim so no so?<verse eid="JER 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29"/>Ao, asase, asase, asase!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm!<verse eid="JER 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Monkyerɛw ɔbarima yi ho asɛm nto hɔ te sɛ obi a onni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">ɔbarima a ɔrennya nkɔso ne nkwa nna nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">na nʼasefo mu biara rennya nkɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">na wɔn mu biara rentena Dawid ahengua so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">na wɔrenni Yuda so hene bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Trenee Dubaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1"/>“Nnome nka nguanhwɛfo a wɔsɛe na wɔhwete me nguankuw no!” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2"/>Ɛno nti sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛ ahwɛfo a wɔhwɛ me nkurɔfo so ni: “Esiane sɛ moabɔ me nguankuw ahwete, na moapam wɔn na moanhwɛ wɔn so yiye no nti, mede asotwe bɛbrɛ mo, mo bɔne a moayɛ no nti,” nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="JER 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3"/>“Mʼankasa mɛboaboa me nguan nkae no afi aman a mapam wɔn akɔ hɔ nyinaa no so na mede wɔn bɛsan aba wɔn adidibea bio, baabi wɔbɛwowo na wɔn ase atrɛw. <verse eid="JER 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4"/>Na meyi nguanhwɛfo a wɔbɛhwɛ wɔn so, na wɔrensuro na wɔremmɔ hu bio na wɔn mu baako mpo renyera.” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5"/>“Nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">“sɛ mɛma trenee dubaa bi so ama Dawid</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">ɔhene bi a obedi ade nyansa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">na wayɛ nea ɛteɛ ne nea eye wɔ asase yi so.<verse eid="JER 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6"/>Ne mmere so, wobegye Yuda nkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">na Israel bɛtena ase wɔ asomdwoe mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Eyi ne din a wɔde bɛfrɛ no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Yɛn Trenee.<verse eid="JER 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7"/>Na afei nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “a nnipa renka bio se, ‘Nokware sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, nea oyii Israelfo fii Misraim,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8"/>na mmom, wɔbɛka se, ‘Nokware sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, nea oyii Israel asefo fii atifi asase so ne aman nyinaa a ɔpam wɔn kɔɔ hɔ no so no.’ Na afei wɔbɛtena wɔn ankasa asase so.”<verse eid="JER 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atoro Adiyifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9"/>Nea ɛfa adiyifo no ho no:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Me koma abubu wɔ me mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">me nnompe nyinaa wosow.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Mete sɛ ɔsabowfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">mete sɛ obi a nsa abow no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">esiane <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">ne ne nsɛm kronkron no nti.<verse eid="JER 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10"/>Aguamammɔfo ahyɛ asase no so ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">nnome no nti asase no awo wosee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">adidibea a ɛwɔ nweatam no so ahyew.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Adiyifo no nam ɔkwan bɔne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">de wɔn tumi yɛ nea ɛnteɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11"/>“Odiyifo ne ɔsɔfo nyinaa nsuro Nyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">mʼasɔredan mu mpo mihu wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12"/>“Ɛno nti, wɔn kwan so bɛyɛ torotorootoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">wɔbɛpam wɔn akɔ sum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">na hɔ na wɔbɛhwehwe ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">wɔ afe a wɔbɛtwe wɔn aso mu no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13"/>“Samaria adiyifo mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">mihuu saa atantanne yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Wɔde Baal hyɛɛ nkɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">nam so maa me nkurɔfo Israelfo fom kwan.<verse eid="JER 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14"/>Na Yerusalem adiyifo mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">mahu ade a ɛyɛ hu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔsɛe aware na wodi atoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔhyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne no mpamuden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">enti obiara ntwe ne ho mfi nʼamumɔyɛsɛm ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔn nyinaa te sɛ Sodom ma me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">na Yerusalemfo te sɛ Gomora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15"/>Ɛno nti sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, se fa adiyifo no ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Mɛma wɔadi aduan a ɛyɛ nwen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">na wɔanom nsu a awuduru wɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">efisɛ Yerusalem adiyifo nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">bɔneyɛ ahyɛ asase yi so ma.”<verse eid="JER 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Munntie nkɔm a adiyifo no hyɛ kyerɛ mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">wɔma mo nya anidaso a enni nnyinaso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Wɔbɔ wɔn tirim ka anisoadehu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">a emfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anom.<verse eid="JER 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17"/>Wɔkɔ so ka kyerɛ wɔn a wobu me animtiaa no se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Mubenya asomdwoe.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">Na wɔn a wodi wɔn komaden akyi no nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">wɔka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Ɔhaw biara remma mo so.’<verse eid="JER 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18"/>Na wɔn mu hena na wasɔre wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> agyinatufo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">sɛ ɔbɛhwɛ anaa obetie nʼasɛm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">Hena na wayɛ aso ate nʼasɛm?<verse eid="JER 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19"/>Hwɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">betu abufuwhyew mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">mfɛtɛ bedi kyinhyia wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">amumɔyɛfo mpampam.<verse eid="JER 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw rensan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">kosi sɛ obewie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">ne koma mu nhyehyɛe nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Nna a ɛreba no mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">mobɛte ase yiye.<verse eid="JER 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21"/>Mansoma saa adiyifo yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">nanso wɔde wɔn asɛm akyinkyin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">mamma wɔn nkra biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">nanso wɔahyɛ nkɔm.<verse eid="JER 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22"/>Sɛ wɔkaa mʼagyinatufo ho a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">anka wɔbɛpae mu aka mʼasɛm akyerɛ me nkurɔfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">na ama wɔatwe wɔn ho afi wɔn akwammɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">ne wɔn nneyɛe bɔne ho.<verse eid="JER 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23"/>“Meyɛ Onyankopɔn a mebɛn nko ara anaa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">“na menyɛ Onyankopɔn a mewɔ akyirikyiri nso?<verse eid="JER 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24"/>Obi betumi de ne ho asie baabi a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">merentumi nhu no ana?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">“Menyɛɛ ɔsoro ne asase so ma ana?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25"/>“Mate nea adiyifo a wɔde me din hyɛ atoro nkɔm no keka. Wɔkeka se, ‘Mesoo dae! Mesoo dae!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26"/>Eyi bɛkɔ so akosi da bɛn wɔ atoro adiyifo yi koma mu? Wɔn a wɔbɔ wɔn tirim hyɛ nnaadaa nkɔm? <verse eid="JER 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27"/>Wodwen sɛ dae a wɔkeka kyerɛkyerɛ wɔn ho no bɛma me nkurɔfo werɛ afi me din, sɛnea Baal som nti wɔn agyanom werɛ fii me din no. <verse eid="JER 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28"/>Ma odiyifo a waso dae no nka nʼadaeso, na ma nea ɔwɔ mʼasɛm no nka no nokware mu. Na dɛn na ntɛtɛ ne awi wɔ yɛ?” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29"/>“Na mʼasɛm nte sɛ ogya,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “ɛnte sɛ asae a ɛpaapae ɔbotan mu nketenkete ana?<verse eid="JER 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30"/>“Ɛno nti,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “mikyi adiyifo a wɔfa nsɛm a efi wɔn yɔnkonom nkyɛn, na wɔpae mu ka no sɛnea efi me nkyɛn no. <verse eid="JER 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31"/>Yiw,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ni, “mikyi saa adiyifo a wɔde wɔn ankasa tɛkrɛmawo ka se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32"/>Nokware, mikyi wɔn a wɔhyɛ adaeso ho atoro nkɔm,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. “Wɔka kyerɛ wɔn na wɔde atoro nsɛm daadaa me nkurɔfo ma wɔfom kwan, nso mensomaa wɔn na minnyii wɔn. Wɔn so nni mfaso mma saa nnipa yi koraa,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atoro Adiyisɛm Ne Atoro Adiyifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33"/>“Sɛ saa nnipa yi, anaa odiyifo anaa ɔsɔfo bisa mo se, ‘Dɛn ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm no a?’ Monka nkyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Adiyisɛm bɛn? Mɛpo mo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34"/>Sɛ odiyifo bi, ɔsɔfo bi anaa obi foforo si so dua se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm ni’ a, mɛtwe saa ɔbarima no ne ne fifo aso. <verse eid="JER 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35"/>Eyi ne nea mo mu biara kɔ so ka kyerɛ ne yɔnko anaa ne busuani: ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmuae ne dɛn?’ Anaa ‘Dɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36"/>Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mobɔ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm’ so bio; efisɛ obiara asɛm bɛyɛ nʼadiyisɛm, ne saa nti modannan nsɛm a efi Onyankopɔn, Ɔteasefo, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn nkyɛn no mu. <verse eid="JER 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37"/>Eyi ne nea mokɔ so ka kyerɛ odiyifo: ‘Mmuae bɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo?’ Anaa ‘Asɛm bɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38"/>Ɛwɔ mu, musi so dua se, ‘Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm’ nanso sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka: Mokae se, ‘Eyi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm,’ wɔ bere a maka akyerɛ mo se monnka saa nsɛm yi bio. <verse eid="JER 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39"/>Afei, nokware, me werɛ befi mo, na mapam mo ne kuropɔn a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom afi mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40"/>Na mede daa animguase, ne daa ahohora a werɛ remfi da bɛba mo so.”<verse eid="JER 23:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Borɔdɔma Nkɛntɛn Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1"/>Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar faa Yudahene Yehoiakyin a ɔyɛ Yehoiakim babarima, nʼadwumayɛfo, nʼadwumfo ne nʼatomfo a wɔwɔ Yuda fii Yerusalem kɔɔ nnommum mu wɔ Babilonia no akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me borɔdɔma nkɛntɛn abien a wɔde asisi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no anim. <verse eid="JER 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2"/>Kɛntɛn baako mu borɔdɔma no yɛ papa te sɛ nea ɛbere ntɛm; borɔdɔma a ɛwɔ kɛntɛn a ɛka ho no mu no nye sɛ wodi mpo.<verse eid="JER 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa me se, “Dɛn na wuhu, Yeremia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Mibuae se, “Borɔdɔma, nea eye pa ara, ne nea enye mma sɛ wodi mpo.”<verse eid="JER 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: ‘Borɔdɔma papa no gyina hɔ ma atukɔfo a wofi Yuda, wɔn a mitwaa wɔn asu kɔɔ Babilonia asase so no. <verse eid="JER 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6"/>Mɛma mʼani aku wɔn ho, ama wɔn yiyedi, na mɛsan de wɔn aba ha bio. Mesiesie wɔn na merensɛe wɔn. Medua wɔn, na merentu wɔn ase. <verse eid="JER 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7"/>Mɛma wɔn koma a wɔde behu me sɛ, me ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfo, na mɛyɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn, efisɛ wɔde wɔn koma nyinaa bɛsan aba me nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8"/>“ ‘Nanso te sɛ borɔdɔma a enye no, nea enye sɛnea wodi mpo no,’ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, ‘saa ara na mɛyɛ Yudahene Sedekia, nʼadwumayɛfo ne Yerusalem nkae no, sɛ wɔte asase yi so anaa wɔte Misraim. <verse eid="JER 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9"/>Mɛma wɔn ayɛ akyide ne mfomsode ama ahenni a ɛwɔ asase so nyinaa, wɔbɛyɛ ahohora na wɔabɔ wɔn din bɔne, wɔbɛyɛ akyiwade ne mmusu baabiara a mɛpam wɔn akɔ. <verse eid="JER 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10"/>Mɛsoma afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm akɔ wɔn so kosi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe wɔn koraa afi asase a mede maa wɔn ne wɔn agyanom no so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Mfe Aduɔson Nkoasom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1"/>Asɛm a ɛfa Yudafo nyinaa ho baa Yeremia nkyɛn wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedi afe a ɛto so anan a ɛyɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar adedi afe a edi kan no mu. <verse eid="JER 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2"/>Enti odiyifo Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Yudafo ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem nyinaa se, <verse eid="JER 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3"/>Mfe aduonu abiɛsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mfe aduonu abiɛsa, Yosia dii hene mfe dunkron na Yehoiakim nso dii hene mfe anan.</char></note> ni, efi Yudahene Amon babarima Yosia adedi afe a ɛto so dumiɛnsa besi nnɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm aba me so na makasa akyerɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso muntiei ɛ.<verse eid="JER 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4"/>Mpo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma nʼasomfo a wɔyɛ nʼadiyifo aba mo nkyɛn mpɛn bebree, na muntiee wɔn, na monyɛɛ aso mmaa wɔn ɛ. <verse eid="JER 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5"/>Wɔkae se, “Mo mu biara mfi nʼakwan bɔne ne ne nneyɛe bɔne ho, na mubetumi atena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa mo ne mo agyanom no so afebɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6"/>Munni anyame foforo akyi nkɔsom wɔn, nsɔre wɔn; mommfa nea mode mo nsa ayɛ no nhyɛ me abufuw. Afei merenhaw mo.”<verse eid="JER 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7"/>“Nanso moantie me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “na mode nea mode mo nsa ayɛ ahyɛ me abufuw, na mode ɔhaw aba mo so.”<verse eid="JER 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8"/>Afei nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Esiane sɛ moantie me nsɛm no nti, <verse eid="JER 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9"/>mɛfrɛ atifi fam nnipa nyinaa ne mʼakoa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “na mede wɔn abɛko atia saa asase yi ne sofo, ne amanaman a wɔatwa ho ahyia nyinaa. Mɛsɛe wɔn pasaa na mayɛ wɔn ahodwiriwde ne fɛwdi, ne amamfo afebɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10"/>Meyi ahosan ne anigye nnyigyei, ayeforokunu ne ayeforo nne, awiyammo nnyigyei ne kanea hann afi wɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11"/>Ɔman mu no nyinaa bɛdan asase wosee, na saa amanaman yi bɛsom Babiloniahene mfirihyia aduɔson.<verse eid="JER 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12"/>“Na mfirihyia aduɔson awiei no, mɛtwe Babiloniahene ne ne man, Babiloniafo asase aso wɔ wɔn amumɔyɛ ho, mɛdan no amamfo afebɔɔ,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="JER 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13"/>“Mɛma asotwe a mahyɛ atia asase no nyinaa aba wɔn so, nea wɔakyerɛw wɔ nhoma yi mu na Yeremia ahyɛ ho nkɔm atia aman no nyinaa no. <verse eid="JER 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14"/>Wɔn ankasa de, amanaman bebree<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aman aman bebree—Saa aman no yɛ Persia, Media ne ne nkurɔfo.</char></note> ne ahempɔn de wɔn bɛyɛ nkoa; na metua wɔn nneyɛe ne wɔn nsa ano adwuma so ka.”<verse eid="JER 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Abufuwhyew Kuruwa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛɛ me: “Gye saa kuruwa yi a mʼabufuwhyew nsa ahyɛ no ma yi, na ma amanaman a mɛsoma wo wɔn nkyɛn no nyinaa nnom. <verse eid="JER 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16"/>Sɛ wɔnom a, wɔbɛtɔ ntintan na wɔabobɔ dam esiane afoa a mɛsoma akɔ wɔn so no nti.”<verse eid="JER 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17"/>Ɛno nti, migyee kuruwa no fii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsam, na memaa amanaman a ɔsomaa me wɔn nkyɛn no nomee:<verse eid="JER 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18"/>Yerusalem ne Yuda nkurow, nʼahemfo ne ne nnwumayɛfo sɛ wɔnyɛ ɔsɛe, aninyanne, animɔharefo ne nnome, sɛnea wɔte nnɛ da yi.<verse eid="JER 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19"/>Misraimhene Farao, nʼasomfo, nʼadwumayɛfo ne ne manfo nyinaa, <verse eid="JER 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20"/>ananafo a wɔwɔ hɔ nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">Us ahemfo;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">Filistifo ahemfo (a ɛyɛ Askelon, Gasa, Ekron ne nnipa a wɔagyaw wɔn wɔ Asdod);<verse eid="JER 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21"/>Edom, Moab ne Amon;<verse eid="JER 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22"/>Tiro ne Sidon ahemfo nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:22">ne ahemfo a wɔwɔ mpoano aman a wɔwɔ po agya no;<verse eid="JER 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23"/>Dedan, Tema, Bus ne nnipa a wɔtete akyirikyiri no;<verse eid="JER 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24"/>Arabia ahemfo ne ananafo ahemfo nyinaa a wɔtete nweatam so no.<verse eid="JER 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25"/>Simri, Elam ne Media ahemfo nyinaa;<verse eid="JER 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26"/>ne ahemfo a wɔwɔ atifi fam nyinaa, wɔn a wɔbɛn ne wɔn a wɔwɔ akyirikyiri, ne wɔn mu biara, asase so ahenni ahorow.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:26">Na wɔn nyinaa akyi no Sesakhene nso bɛnom bi.<verse eid="JER 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27"/>“Afei ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: Monnom, mommobow na momfefe, na mohwehwe ase a monnsɔre bio, esiane afoa a mɛsoma aba mo so no nti.’ <verse eid="JER 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28"/>Na sɛ wɔampɛ sɛ wogye wo nsam kuruwa no nom a, ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Ɛsɛ sɛ monom! <verse eid="JER 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29"/>Monhwɛ, merebefi ase de amanehunu aba kuropɔn a me Din da so no so, na mobɛfa mo ho adi a wɔrentwe mo aso ana? Wɔbɛtwe mo aso, efisɛ merefrɛ afoa aba wɔn a wɔtete asase no so nyinaa so, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.’<verse eid="JER 25:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30"/>“Afei hyɛ nsɛm yi nyinaa ho nkɔm tia wɔn, na ka kyerɛ wɔn se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">“ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> befi ɔsoro abobɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">ɔbɛma ne nne so afi ne tenabea kronkron hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">na wabobɔ mu dennen atia nʼasase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Ɔbɛteɛ mu te sɛ wɔn a wotiatia bobe aba so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">ɔbɛteɛ mu agu wɔn a wɔtete asase no so no so.<verse eid="JER 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31"/>Huuyɛ begyigye akɔ nsase ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ kwaadu, atia amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">obebu adesamma nyinaa atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">na ɔde amumɔyɛfo ama afoa,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Monhwɛ! Amanehunu retrɛtrɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">fi ɔman so kɔ ɔman foforo so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">ahum kɛse bi rema ne ho so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">afi nsase ano.”<verse eid="JER 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33"/>Saa bere no, wɔn a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akunkum wɔn no bɛdeda baabiara, fi asase ano kosi ano nohɔ. Wɔrensu wɔn na wɔremmoaboa wɔn ano na wɔrensie wɔn, na wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a egugu fam.<verse eid="JER 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34"/>Munsu na muntwa adwo, mo nguanhwɛfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">mommunummunum wɔ mfutuma mu, mo nguankuw ntuanofo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Mo kum bere no adu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">mobɛhwehwe ase sɛ adwennini a wɔadodɔ.<verse eid="JER 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35"/>Nguanhwɛfo no rennya baabiara nguan nkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">na nguankuw no ntuanofo no rennya kwan nguan.<verse eid="JER 25:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36"/>Muntie nguanhwɛfo no su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">ne nguankuw no ntuanofo agyaadwotwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> resɛe wɔn mmoa adidibea.<verse eid="JER 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37"/>Sare nsase a asomdwoe wɔ so no bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">esiane <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew no nti.<verse eid="JER 25:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38"/>Obefi ne tu mu sɛ gyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">na wɔn asase bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">esiane nnomumfafo no afoa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew no nti.<verse eid="JER 25:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Owu Hunahuna Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1"/>Yehoiakim a ɔyɛ Yudahene Yosia babarima adedi mfiase mfe no, saa asɛm yi fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn bae: <verse eid="JER 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Gyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi mu adiwo hɔ, na ka kyerɛ nnipa a wofi Yuda nkurow mu bɛsom wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi mu nyinaa. Ka nea mehyɛ wo no nyinaa kyerɛ wɔn; nyi asɛm biara mfi mu. <verse eid="JER 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3"/>Ebia wobetie, na wɔn mu biara asan afi nʼakwammɔne so. Sɛ ɛba saa a, mɛtwɛn, na meremfa amanehunu a wɔn bɔne nti mepɛɛ sɛ mede ba wɔn so no mma bio. <verse eid="JER 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Sɛ moantie me, na moanni me mmara a mahyɛ mo no so, <verse eid="JER 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5"/>na sɛ moantie nsɛm a mʼasomfo adiyifo a mesoma wɔn mo nkyɛn bere biara no ka kyerɛ mo no a, (mpo munntiee wɔn), <verse eid="JER 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6"/>ɛno de, mɛyɛ ofi yi sɛ Silo, na kuropɔn yi ayɛ nnome wɔ asase so aman nyinaa mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7"/>Asɔfo, adiyifo ne nnipa no nyinaa tee sɛ Yeremia reka saa nsɛm yi, wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi hɔ. <verse eid="JER 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8"/>Na Yeremia wiee nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no se ɔnka nkyerɛ nnipa no nyinaa no ka no, asɔfo no, adiyifo ne nnipa no nyinaa tow hyɛɛ ne so kae se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wuwu! <verse eid="JER 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9"/>Adɛn na wohyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu se, ofi yi bɛyɛ sɛ Silo na kuropɔn yi bɛda mpan a obiara ntena mu ana?” Na nnipa no nyinaa betwaa Yeremia ho hyiaa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi hɔ.<verse eid="JER 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10"/>Bere a Yuda adwumayɛfo tee saa nsɛm yi no, wofii ahemfi hɔ foro kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi kɔtenaa ofi no Pon Foforo no ano. <verse eid="JER 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11"/>Na asɔfo no ne adiyifo no ka kyerɛɛ adwumayɛfo no ne nnipa no nyinaa se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wobu saa ɔbarima yi kumfɔ, efisɛ wahyɛ nkɔm atia kuropɔn yi. Moate wɔ mo asom!”<verse eid="JER 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12"/>Na Yeremia kasa yii ne ho ano wɔ adwumayɛfo ne nnipa no nyinaa anim se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa me se, memmɛhyɛ nkɔm ntia ofi yi ne kuropɔn yi sɛnea moate no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13"/>Na afei monteɛteɛ mo akwan ne mo nneyɛe, na monyɛ osetie mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtwɛn, na ɔremfa amanehunu a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔde ba mo so no mma bio. <verse eid="JER 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14"/>Me de, mewɔ mo nsam; mubetumi ayɛ me sɛnea eye na ɛteɛ wɔ mo ani so. <verse eid="JER 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15"/>Nanso monkae se, sɛ mukum me a, moahwie mogya a edi bem agu, na so afɔdi bɛba mo so, kuropɔn yi so ne wɔn a wɔtete mu no so; na nokware <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me sɛ memmɛka nsɛm yi nyinaa ngu mo asom.”<verse eid="JER 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16"/>Na adwumayɛfo no ne nnipa no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ asɔfo no ne adiyifo no se, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ wobu saa ɔbarima yi kumfɔ! Wakasa akyerɛ yɛn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn din mu.”<verse eid="JER 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17"/>Na asase no so mpanyimfo no mu bi sɔree, na wɔka kyerɛɛ bagua no nyinaa se, <verse eid="JER 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18"/>“Mika a ofi Moreset hyɛɛ nkɔm wɔ Yudahene Hesekia bere so ka kyerɛɛ Yudafo nyinaa se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“ ‘Wobefuntum Sion te sɛ afuw.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Na Yerusalem bɛyɛ mmubui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">na asɔredan no koko bɛyɛ sɛ nkɔ a nkyɛkyerɛ afuw wɔ so.’ <verse eid="JER 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19"/>Na Yudahene Hesekia anaa Yudani bi kum no ana? Hesekia ansuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ansrɛ ne hɔ adom? Na ɛno amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> antwɛn sɛ obeyi amanehunu a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔde ba wɔn so no amfi wɔn so ana? Yɛreyɛ de amanehunu kɛse aba yɛn ankasa so!”<verse eid="JER 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20"/>(Semaia babarima Uria a, ofi Kiriat-Yearim no nso yɛ ɔbarima foforo a ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu; ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm koro yi ara tiaa saa kuropɔn yi ne saa asase yi, sɛnea Yeremia yɛe no. <verse eid="JER 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21"/>Bere a ɔhene Yehoiakim ne ne mpanyimfo ne nʼadwumayɛfo nyinaa tee ne nsɛm no, ɔhene no pɛɛ sɛ okum no, nanso Uria tee no, ɔde ehu guan kɔɔ Misraim. <verse eid="JER 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22"/>Ɔhene Yehoiakim somaa Akbor babarima Elnatan ne mmarima bi kɔɔ Misraim. <verse eid="JER 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23"/>Wɔde Uria fii Misraim bae, na wɔde no kɔmaa ɔhene Yehoiakim. Ɔma wɔde afoa kum no na wɔtow ne funu kyenee kwasafo asiei.)<verse eid="JER 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24"/>Afei nso, na Safan babarima Ahikam gyina Yeremia akyi, enti wɔamfa no amma dɔm no sɛ wonkum no.<verse eid="JER 26:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Bɛsom Nebukadnessar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1"/>Yudahene Yosia babarima Sedekia adedi mfiase no, asɛm yi fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me: “Fa mmeamdua ne nkyehama yɛ konnua sɛn wo kɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3"/>Fa nkra ma abɔfo a wɔaba Yudahene Sedekia nkyɛn wɔ Yerusalem na wɔmfa nkɔma ahemfo a wɔwɔ Edom, Moab, Amon, Tiro ne Sidon. <verse eid="JER 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4"/>Fa nkra kɔma wɔn wuranom se: Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se, ‘Ka eyi kyerɛ wo wuranom se: <verse eid="JER 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5"/>Mede me tumi kɛse ne me basa a mateɛ mu yɛɛ asase ne so nnipa ne mmoa a wɔwɔ so, na mede ma obiara a mepɛ. <verse eid="JER 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6"/>Afei mede mo aman nyinaa bɛhyɛ mʼakoa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na mede wuram mmoa mpo bɛhyɛ nʼase. <verse eid="JER 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7"/>Amanaman nyinaa bɛsom no ne ne babarima ne ne nenabarima kosi sɛ ne bere betwa mu; na afei aman bebree ne ahemfo akɛseakɛse bedi ne so.<verse eid="JER 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8"/>“ ‘Nanso sɛ ɔman bi anaa ahenni bi rensom Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar anaa wɔremfa wɔn kɔn nhyɛ ne konnua ase a, mede afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛtwe saa ɔman no aso, kosi sɛ mede ne nsa bɛsɛe no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9"/>Ɛno nti munntie mo adiyifo, mo nkɔmhyɛfo, mo adae asekyerɛfo, mo samanfrɛfo anaa mo ntafowayifo a wɔka kyerɛ mo se, “Morensom Babiloniahene.” <verse eid="JER 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10"/>Wɔhyɛ mo atoro nkɔm a ɛbɛma wɔayi mo afi mo asase so akɔ akyirikyiri nko ara; mɛpam mo ama mo ase ayera. <verse eid="JER 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11"/>Nanso sɛ ɔman biara de ne kɔn bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene konnua no ase na wasom no a, mɛma saa ɔman no aka ɔno ara asase so na wadɔw so atena so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12"/>Mede saa nkra koro no ara kɔmaa Yudahene Sedekia se, “Momfa mo kɔn nhyɛ Babiloniahene konnua ase na monsom ɔno ne ne nkurɔfo na mubenya nkwa. <verse eid="JER 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13"/>Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ wo ne wo nkurɔfo wuwu wɔ afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ahunahuna ɔman biara a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔsom Babiloniahene no? <verse eid="JER 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14"/>Munntie adiyifo no a wɔka kyerɛ mo se, ‘Morensom Babiloniahene,’ efisɛ wɔhyɛ mo atoro nkɔm. <verse eid="JER 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15"/>‘Mensomaa wɔn’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. ‘Wɔhyɛ atoro nkɔm wɔ me din mu. Enti mɛpam mo na moayera, mo ne adiyifo a wɔhyɛ mo nkɔm no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ asɔfo no ne saa nkurɔfo yi nyinaa se, “Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Munntie adiyifo no a wɔhyɛ mo nkɔm se, ‘Ɛrenkyɛ koraa wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi nneɛma no befi Babilonia aba.’ Wɔhyɛ atoro nkɔm kyerɛ mo. <verse eid="JER 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17"/>Munntie wɔn. Monsom Babiloniahene na mubenya nkwa. Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ saa kuropɔn yi sɛe? <verse eid="JER 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18"/>Sɛ wɔyɛ adiyifo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm wɔ wɔn mu a, ma wɔn nkotow nsrɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na nneɛma a wɔde siesie dan mu a aka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi ne Yudahene ahemfi ne Yerusalem no, wɔamfa ankɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19"/>Na sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa kɔbere mfrafrae afadum, po, nnyinaso a wotumi pia ne nneɛma a wɔde siesie dan mu no a aka wɔ kuropɔn yi mu no ho. <verse eid="JER 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20"/>Nea Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar amfa ankɔ bere a ɔbɛfaa Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima Yehoiakyin ne Yuda ne Yerusalem mmapɔmma fii Yerusalem kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia no. <verse eid="JER 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21"/>Yiw, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka fa nneɛma a aka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi, Yudahene ahemfi ne Yerusalem no ho no ni: <verse eid="JER 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22"/>‘Wɔbɛfa akɔ Babilonia, na hɔ na ɛbɛka kosi da a mɛba abɛfa,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. ‘Afei mede nneɛma no bɛsan aba bio abesisi wɔn sibea wɔ ha.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifo Torofo Hanania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1"/>Ɔsram a ɛto so anum wɔ afe koro a ɛyɛ Yudahene Sedekia adedi mfiase, afe a ɛto so anan no mu, odiyifo Hanania a ɔyɛ Asur a ofi Gibeon babarima no ka kyerɛɛ me wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi bere a na asɔfo ne nnipa no nyinaa ahyia no se, <verse eid="JER 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: ‘Mebubu Babiloniahene konnua no. <verse eid="JER 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3"/>Mfe abien mu no, mede <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi mu nneɛma a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar bɛfa fii ha kɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa bɛsan aba. <verse eid="JER 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4"/>Na mɛsan de Yehoiakyin a ɔyɛ Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima ne Yuda nnommum a wɔkɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa aba’ sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, ‘na mebubu Babiloniahene konnua no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5"/>Na odiyifo Yeremia buaa odiyifo Hanania wɔ asɔfo ne nnipa a na wogyinagyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi no nyinaa anim. <verse eid="JER 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6"/>Ɔkae se, “Amen! Ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nyɛ no saa! Ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mma wo nkɔm a woahyɛ sɛ wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi nneɛma no nyinaa ne nnommum no befi Babilonia asan aba ha yi no mmra mu. <verse eid="JER 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7"/>Nanso tie asɛm a ɛsɛ sɛ meka ma wote na nnipa no nyinaa nso te: <verse eid="JER 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8"/>Efi tete no, adiyifo a wodii mʼanim ne wʼanim no hyehyɛɛ ɔko, amanehunu ne ɔyaredɔm ho nkɔm tiaa aman bebree ne ahenni akɛse. <verse eid="JER 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9"/>Nanso odiyifo a ɔhyɛ asomdwoe ho nkɔm no, sɛ ne nkɔmhyɛ no ba mu a wobegye no ato mu sɛ obi a ampa ara <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma no.”<verse eid="JER 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10"/>Na odiyifo Hanania yii konnua no fii odiyifo Yeremia kɔn mu, bubuu mu, <verse eid="JER 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11"/>na ɔkaa wɔ nnipa no nyinaa anim se, “Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Saa ara na mebubu Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar konnua no afi amanaman nyinaa kɔn mu wɔ mfe abien mu.’ ” Odiyifo Yeremia tee eyi no ofii hɔ kɔe.<verse eid="JER 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12"/>Odiyifo Hanania bubuu konnua no fii odiyifo Yeremia kɔn mu akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se: <verse eid="JER 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13"/>“Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ Hanania se, ‘Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Woabubu dua konnua mu, nanso mede dade konnua besi anan mu. <verse eid="JER 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14"/>Na sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se ni: Mede dade konnua bɛto amanaman nyinaa kɔn mu, ama wɔn asom Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, na wɔbɛsom no. Na mpo mɛma no adi wuram mmoa so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15"/>Na odiyifo Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ odiyifo Hanania se, “Tie, Hanania! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsomaa wo, nanso, woama ɔman yi agye atoro ato mu. <verse eid="JER 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16"/>Ɛno nti, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: ‘Merebeyi wo afi asase so. Afe yi mu ara wubewu, efisɛ woaka atuatew nsɛm atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17"/>Ɔsram a ɛto so ason wɔ afe no ara mu no, odiyifo Hanania wui.<verse eid="JER 28:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Krataa A Wɔde Kɔmaa Nnommum No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1"/>Eyi ne krataa mu nsɛm a odiyifo Yeremia kyerɛw fii Yerusalem kɔmaa nnommum no mu mpanyimfo nkae, asɔfo, adiyifo ne nnipa a wɔaka nyinaa a Nebukadnessar afa wɔn afi Yerusalem akɔ Babilonia no. <verse eid="JER 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2"/>(Eyi yɛ bere a ɔhene Yehoiakyin ne ɔhemmea no, asennii adwumayɛfo, Yuda ne Yerusalem ntuanofo, adwumfo ahorow nyinaa afi Yerusalem akɔ nnommum mu no akyi.) <verse eid="JER 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3"/>Ɔde krataa no hyɛɛ Safan babarima Elasa ne Hilkia babarima Gemaria nsa, wɔn na Yudahene Sedekia somaa wɔn kɔɔ Ɔhene Nebukadnessar nkyɛn wɔ Babilonia no. Krataa no mu nsɛm ni:<verse eid="JER 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛ wɔn a mema wɔfaa wɔn nnommum fi Yerusalem kɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa ni: <verse eid="JER 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5"/>“Munsisi afi, na momfa mmɔ atenase; monyɛ nturo na munni mu aba. <verse eid="JER 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6"/>Monwareware, na monwowo mmabarima ne mmabea. Monhwehwɛ yerenom mma mo mmabarima na momfa mo mmabea nso mma aware, na wɔn nso nwowo mmabarima ne mmabea. Monnɔ wɔ hɔ na mo so antew. <verse eid="JER 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7"/>Afei, monhwehwɛ kuropɔn a mema wotuu mo kɔtenaa so no asomdwoe ne yiyedi. Mommɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpae mma no, efisɛ ne yiyedi mu na mo nso mubedi yiye.” <verse eid="JER 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8"/>Yiw, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: “Mommma adiyifo ne nkɔmhyɛfo a wɔwɔ mo mu no nnaadaa mo. Munntie wɔn adae a mohyɛ wɔn nkuran ma wɔsoso no. <verse eid="JER 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9"/>Wɔhyɛ atoro nkɔm wɔ me din mu. Mensomaa wɔn,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Sɛ mosom Babilonia mfe aduɔson a, mɛba abɛhwɛ mo na mɛma mʼadom mu bɔhyɛ sɛ mede mo bɛba ha bio no aba mu. <verse eid="JER 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11"/>Minim nhyehyɛe a mewɔ ma mo,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “Nhyehyɛe a ɛde mo besi yiye na ɛrenhaw mo, nhyehyɛe a ɛbɛma mo anidaso ne awiei pa. <verse eid="JER 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12"/>Afei mobɛfrɛ me na moaba abɛbɔ me mpae, na metie mo. <verse eid="JER 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13"/>Mobɛhwehwɛ me na mubehu me, sɛ mode mo koma nyinaa hwehwɛ me a. <verse eid="JER 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14"/>Mubehu me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “na meyi mo afi nkoasom mu de mo asan aba. Mɛboaboa mo ano afi amanaman ne mu ne faako a mepam mo kɔɔ no nyinaa,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “na mede mo bɛsan aba faako a mituu mo fi kɔɔ nnommum mu no bio.”<verse eid="JER 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15"/>Mobɛka se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama yɛn adiyifo wɔ Babilonia,” <verse eid="JER 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16"/>nanso, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa ɔhene a ɔte Dawid ahengua so ne nnipa a wɔaka wɔ kuropɔn no mu nyinaa, mo manfo a wɔne mo ankɔ nnommum mu no. <verse eid="JER 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17"/>Yiw, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Mɛma afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm aba wɔn so, na wɔayɛ sɛ borɔdɔma a asɛe enti wontumi nni. <verse eid="JER 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18"/>Mede afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm betiw wɔn, na mɛyɛ wɔn atantanne ama ahenni a ɛwɔ asase no so nyinaa, ne nnome ne ahodwiriwde, fɛwdi ne animtiaabude wɔ amanaman a mepam wɔn kɔɔ so no mu. <verse eid="JER 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19"/>Efisɛ, wɔantie me nsɛm,” sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “nsɛm a mede somaa mʼasomfo adiyifo mpɛn bebree baa mo nkyɛn. Na mo nnommum nso antie,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20"/>Afei muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo nnommum a mama mo afi Yerusalem akɔ Babilonia no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn ka fa Kolaia babarima Ahab ne Maaseia babarima Sedekia a wɔde me din rehyɛ mo atoro nkɔm no ho ni: “Mede wɔn bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na wakum wɔn wɔ mo anim. <verse eid="JER 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22"/>Esiane wɔn nti, Yuda nnommum a wɔwɔ Babilonia nyinaa de saa nnome yi bɛdome sɛ: ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nyɛ wo sɛ, Sedekia ne Ahab a Babiloniahene hyew wɔn wɔ ogya mu no.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23"/>Na wɔayɛ akyiwade a ɛboro so wɔ Israel: wɔne wɔn yɔnkonom yerenom adeda de asɛe aware, na wɔde me din adi atoro a menka nkyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ. Minim na midi ho adanse,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Semaia Nkra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24"/>Ka kyerɛ Nehelamni Semaia se, <verse eid="JER 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25"/>“Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se ni: Wokyerɛw krataa wɔ wo din mu kɔmaa nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa, ɔsɔfo Maaseia babarima Sefania, ne asɔfo a aka no nyinaa. Woka kyerɛɛ Sefania se, <verse eid="JER 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26"/>‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ wo sɔfo asi Yehoiada anan mu se hwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi no so; Ɛsɛ sɛ wode nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn ne dade konnua gu obiara a wabɔ dam na ɔyɛ ne ho sɛ odiyifo no. <verse eid="JER 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27"/>Afei adɛn nti na wonka Yeremia a ofi Anatot a ɔyɛ ne ho sɛ odiyifo wɔ mo mu no anim? <verse eid="JER 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28"/>Ɔde saa nkra yi abrɛ yɛn wɔ Babilonia: Ɛbɛkyɛ. Ɛno nti munsisi afi mfa nyɛ atenae; monyɛ nturo na munni mu aba.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29"/>Ɔsɔfo Sefania kenkan krataa no kyerɛɛ odiyifo Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31"/>“Fa saa nkra yi kɔma nnommum no nyinaa se, ‘Eyi ne nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Nehelamni Semaia ho: Esiane sɛ wahyɛ mo nkɔm a mpo mansoma no, na wama moagye atoro adi nti, <verse eid="JER 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32"/>nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Nokware, mɛtwe Nehelamni Semaia ne nʼasefo aso. Ɔrennya obiara a ɔbɛka wɔ saa nkurɔfo yi mu, na ɔrenhu nneɛma pa a mɛyɛ ama me nkurɔfo, efisɛ waka atuatew nsɛm atia me,’ ” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 29:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Wogye Israel Si Hɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1"/>Asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ ni: <verse eid="JER 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: ‘Kyerɛw nsɛm a maka akyerɛ wo nyinaa gu nhoma mu. <verse eid="JER 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3"/>Nna bi reba,’ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, ‘a mede me nkurɔfo Israelfo ne Yudafo befi nnommum mu asan aba na mede wɔn aba asase a mede maa wɔn agyanom sɛ wɔmfa ntena so no so,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.”<verse eid="JER 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4"/>Eyi ne nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka faa Israel ne Yuda ho: <verse eid="JER 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5"/>“Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“ ‘Akomatu nteɛteɛmu na mete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">mete basabasayɛ, na ɛnyɛ asomdwoe.<verse eid="JER 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6"/>Mummisa na munhu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">Ɔbarima betumi awo mma ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Afei, adɛn nti na mihu ɔbarima hoɔdenfo biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">sɛ ne nsa gu ne yafunu so te sɛ ɔbea a ɔwɔ awoko mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">na anim biara ayɛ bosaa saa?<verse eid="JER 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7"/>Sɛnea da no bɛyɛ hu afa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Da biara renyɛ sɛ ɛno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Ɛbɛyɛ amanehunu bere ama Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">nanso wobeyi no afi mu.<verse eid="JER 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8"/>“ ‘Saa da no,’ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">‘Mebubu konnua no afi wɔn kɔn mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">na matetew wɔn nkyehama no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">ananafo remfa wɔn nyɛ nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9"/>Na mmom wɔbɛsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Nyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">ne Dawid, wɔn hene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">a mɛpagyaw no ama wɔn.<verse eid="JER 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10"/>“ ‘Enti nsuro, Yakob, me somfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">mma wʼaba mu mmu, Israel,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">‘Nokware, megye wo afi akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ne wʼasefo afi wɔn nnommum asase so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yakob bɛsan anya asomdwoe ne bammɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">na obiara renhunahuna no bio.<verse eid="JER 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11"/>Me ne wo wɔ hɔ na megye wo nkwa,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">‘Ɛwɔ mu, mesɛe amanaman no nyinaa pasaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">emu na mebɔ mo ahwete kɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">nanso merensɛe mo korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Mɛteɛteɛ mo, nanso mɛyɛ no wɔ trenee kwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">meremma mo mfa mo ho nni koraa a merentwe mo aso.’<verse eid="JER 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“ ‘Wʼapirakuru ayɛ akisikuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">na wontumi nsa.<verse eid="JER 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13"/>Obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛka bi ama wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">wo kuru no rennya aduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">na worennya ayaresa.<verse eid="JER 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14"/>Wʼapamfo nyinaa werɛ afi wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">wo ho biribiara mfa wɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Mabɔ wo sɛnea wo tamfo bɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">na matwe wʼaso sɛnea otirimɔdenfo bɛtwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">efisɛ wʼafɔdi so dodo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">na wʼamumɔyɛ nso dɔɔso.<verse eid="JER 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15"/>Adɛn nti na wusu dennen wɔ wʼapirakuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">wo yawdi a ano nni aduru no ho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Wʼafɔdi kɛse ne wʼamumɔyɛ bebrebe nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">na mede saa nneɛma yi ayɛ wo.<verse eid="JER 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16"/>“ ‘Nanso wɔbɛsɛe wɔn a wɔsɛe mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">mo atamfo nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommum mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Wɔn a wɔfow mo no wɔbɛfow wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">wɔn a wɔtow hyɛɛ mo so no, mɛtow ahyɛ wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17"/>Nanso mɛma wo ahoɔden bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">na masa wʼapirakuru,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘efisɛ wɔfrɛ wo nea wɔapam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">Sion a wo ho nhia obiara.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“ ‘Mɛsan de Yakob ntamadan mu ahonyade aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">na manya ayamhyehye ama nʼatenae ahorow no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">wɔbɛkyekye kuropɔn no bio wɔ ne mmubui so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">na ahemfi no besi nea ɛsɛ sɛ esi.<verse eid="JER 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19"/>Wɔn mu na aseda nnwom befi aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ne ahosɛpɛw nnyigyei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Mɛma wɔadɔɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">na wɔn dodow no so rentew;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">mɛhyɛ wɔn anuonyam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">na wɔremmu wɔn abomfiaa.<verse eid="JER 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20"/>Wɔn mma bedi yiye sɛ kan no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">mɛma wɔn asafo atim wɔ mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn so nyinaa mɛtwe wɔn aso.<verse eid="JER 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21"/>Wɔn kannifo bɛyɛ wɔn ankasa nipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">na wɔn sodifo befi wɔn mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Mɛka no abata me ho na wabɛn me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">na hena na ɔde ne ho bɛma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">sɛ ɔbɛbɛn me?’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22"/>“ ‘Enti mobɛyɛ me nkurɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">na mayɛ mo Nyankopɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23"/>Hwɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">betu abufuwhyew mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">mfɛtɛ bedi kyinhyia wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">amumɔyɛfo mpampam.<verse eid="JER 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw rennwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">kosi sɛ obewie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">ne koma mu nhyehyɛe nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Nna a ɛreba no mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">mobɛte eyi ase.<verse eid="JER 30:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1"/>“Saa bere no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “Mɛyɛ Israel mmusuakuw no nyinaa Nyankopɔn, na wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfo.”<verse eid="JER 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">“Nnipa a wotumi gyinaa wɔ afoa ano no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">benya adom wɔ nweatam so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">mede ahomegye bɛbrɛ Israel.”<verse eid="JER 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> daa ne ho adi kyerɛɛ yɛn kan no na ɔkae se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Mede ɔdɔ a ɛnsa da adɔ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">mede adɔe atwe mo.<verse eid="JER 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4"/>Mede mo besi hɔ bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">na wɔbɛsan de wo, Ɔbabun Israel, asi hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Wobɛfa wʼakasae bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">na woafi adi ne anigyefo akɔsaw.<verse eid="JER 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5"/>Bio, mobɛyɛ bobe nturo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">wɔ Samaria nkoko so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">akuafo no bedua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">na wɔadi so aba.<verse eid="JER 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6"/>Da bi bɛba a, awɛmfo bɛteɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">wɔ Efraim nkoko so se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Mommra, momma yɛnforo nkɔ Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">nkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn nkyɛn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Momfa ahosɛpɛw nto nnwom mma Yakob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Monteɛ mu mma amanaman mu kannifo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Momma wɔnte mo ayeyi na monka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, gye wo nkurɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Israel nkae no.’<verse eid="JER 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8"/>Hwɛ, mede wɔn befi atifi fam asase so aba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">na maboa wɔn ano afi nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">Wɔn mu bi bɛyɛ anifuraefo, mpakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">apemfo ne mmea a wɔwɔ awoko mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">dɔm kɛse bɛsan aba.<verse eid="JER 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9"/>Wɔde osu na ɛbɛba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">wɔbɛbɔ mpae bere a mede wɔn resan aba no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Mede wɔn bɛfa nsuwa ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">ɔkwan tamaa a wɔrenhintiw wɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">efisɛ mɛyɛ Israel agya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">na Efraim yɛ me babarima piesie.<verse eid="JER 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10"/>“Muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">mommɔ no dawuru wɔ mpoano nsase a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri so se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">‘Nea ɔbɔɔ Israel petee no bɛboaboa wɔn ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">na wahwɛ ne nguankuw so sɛ oguanhwɛfo.’<verse eid="JER 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> begyina mu ama Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">na wagye wɔn afi wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">wɔwɔ ahoɔden sen wɔn no nsam.<verse eid="JER 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12"/>Wɔbɛba na wɔde ahurusi ateɛ mu wɔ Sion sorɔnsorɔmmea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">wɔbɛsɛpɛw wɔn ho wɔ akyɛde bebrebe a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">atoko, nsa foforo ne ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">nguantenmma ne anantwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Wɔbɛyɛ sɛ turo a wɔagugu so nsu yiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">na wɔrenni awerɛhow bio.<verse eid="JER 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13"/>Afei mmabaa bɛsaw na wɔn ani agye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">mmerante ne nkwakoraa nso ka ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Mɛma wɔn awerɛhow adan anigye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">mɛma wɔn ahotɔ ne ahosɛpɛw de asi awerɛhow anan mu.<verse eid="JER 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14"/>Mɛma asɔfo no nea ehia wɔn ama abu so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">na mama mʼakyɛde bebrebe amee me nkurɔfo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.<verse eid="JER 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">“Wɔte nne bi wɔ Rama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">awerɛhow ne agyaadwotwa bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">Rahel resu ne mma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">na ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔkyekye ne werɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">efisɛ ne mma nni hɔ bio.”<verse eid="JER 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Hyɛ wo ho so na woansu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">mia wʼani na woante nusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">efisɛ wobetua wʼadwumayɛ so ka,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">“Wɔbɛsan afi atamfo no asase so aba.<verse eid="JER 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17"/>Enti anidaso wɔ hɔ ma wo daakye.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">Wo mma bɛsan aba wɔn ankasa asase so.<verse eid="JER 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18"/>“Ampa ara mate sɛ Efraim resu se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">‘Woteɛteɛɛ me so sɛ nantwi ba a nʼani yɛ den,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">na manya ahohyɛso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Gye me bio, na mɛsan aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">efisɛ wo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19"/>Meman akyi no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">minyaa adwensakra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">na akyiri a minyaa ntease no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">mebɔɔ me koko so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Mʼanim guu ase na mefɛree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">efisɛ me mmabun mu animguase da so so me.’<verse eid="JER 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20"/>Efraim nyɛ me babarima dɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ɔba a ɔsɔ mʼani ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Ɛwɔ mu, metaa kasa tia no de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">nanso meda so kae no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Enti me koma pere hwehwɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">mewɔ ayamhyehye ma no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.<verse eid="JER 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21"/>“Momfa agyiraehyɛde nsisi akwan ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">munsisi akwankyerɛ afadum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Monhyɛ ɔtempɔn no nsow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">ɔkwan a monam so ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">San wʼakyi, Ɔbabun Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">san bra wo nkurow so.<verse eid="JER 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22"/>Wubekyinkyin akosi da bɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">Ɔbabea Israel sesafo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ ade foforo wɔ asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">ɔbea bɛbɔ ɔbarima ho ban.”<verse eid="JER 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se: “Sɛ mesan de wɔn fi nnommum mu ba a, nnipa a wɔwɔ Yuda asase ne nkurow so bɛsan aka saa nsɛm yi se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo, wo yiyeyɛ kuropɔn ne bepɔw kronkron.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24"/>Nnipa bɛbɔ mu atena ase wɔ Yuda ne ne nkurow nyinaa so, akuafo ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn nguankuw nenam. <verse eid="JER 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25"/>Mɛma nea wabrɛ no anya ahoɔden foforo, na nea watɔ piti no nso mɛma no amee.”<verse eid="JER 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26"/>Minyanee, na mehwɛɛ me ho hyiae. Medaa hatee.<verse eid="JER 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27"/>“Nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “A mede nnipa mma ne mmoa mma bedua Israel ne Yuda fi. <verse eid="JER 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28"/>Sɛnea mehwɛ ma wotutui, wodwiriwii, wobubui, wɔsɛee na wɔde amanehunu bae no, saa ara na mɛhwɛ ama wɔasi na wɔadua,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="JER 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29"/>Saa nna no mu, nnipa renka bio se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">“ ‘Agyanom adi bobe nwennaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">na mma se afem.’<verse eid="JER 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30"/>Mmom, obiara bewu wɔ ɔno ara bɔne ho; nea obedi bobe nwennaa no ɔno na ne se bɛfem.<verse eid="JER 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31"/>“Bere no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">“a me ne Israelfi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">ne Yudafi bɛyɛ apam foforo.<verse eid="JER 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32"/>Ɛrenyɛ sɛ apam a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">me ne wɔn agyanom yɛe no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">bere a misoo wɔn nsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">dii wɔn anim fii Misraim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">esiane sɛ wobuu mʼapam so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">wɔ bere a na meyɛ okunu ma wɔn no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33"/>“Eyi ne apam a me ne Israelfi bɛyɛ saa bere no akyi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">“Mede me mmara bɛhyɛ wɔn adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">na makyerɛw wɔ wɔn koma so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">Mɛyɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">na wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfo.<verse eid="JER 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34"/>Na obiara renkyerɛkyerɛ ne yɔnko bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">anaa ne nua se, ‘Hu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">Efisɛ, wɔn nyinaa behu me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">efi wɔn mu akumaa so, kosi ɔkɛse so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">“Na mede wɔn amumɔyɛ bɛkyɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">na merenkae wɔn bɔne bio.”<verse eid="JER 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">nea ɔma owia hyerɛn adekyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">na ɔhyɛ ɔsram ne nsoromma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">sɛ wɔnhyerɛn anadwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">nea ɔkanyan ɛpo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">ma nʼasorɔkye bobɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36"/>“Saa ahyɛde yi twa mu mʼani so a,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">“ɛno ansa na Israel begyae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">ɔmanyɛ wɔ mʼanim.”<verse eid="JER 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">“Sɛ wobetumi asusuw wim ntrɛwmu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">na wɔatumi ahwehwɛ asase ase fapem mu a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">ɛno de, mɛpo Israel asefo nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">esiane nea wɔayɛ nyinaa nti,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38"/>“Nna no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, “a wɔbɛkyekye kuropɔn yi bio ama me, fi Hananel abantenten kosi Twɔtwɔw so Pon. <verse eid="JER 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39"/>Wɔbɛtwe susuhama no mu, afi hɔ de akosi Gareb koko so, na akɔntɔn akɔ Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40"/>Obon a wɔtow afunu ne nsõ gu mu no nyinaa ne asase a ɛkɔ Kidron bon mu wɔ apuei fam, kosi apɔnkɔ pon no twɔtwɔw so bɛyɛ kronkron ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔrentutu na wɔrensɛe kuropɔn no da.”<verse eid="JER 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Tɔ Asase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1"/>Eyi ne asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ wɔ Yudahene Sedekia adedi afe a ɛto so du a na ɛyɛ Nebukadnessar adedi afe a ɛto so dunwɔtwe no mu. <verse eid="JER 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2"/>Na Babiloniahene nsraadɔm aka Yerusalem ahyɛ a na odiyifo Yeremia nso da dua mu wɔ awɛmfo adiwo a ɛwɔ Yuda ahemfi.<verse eid="JER 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3"/>Na Yudahene Sedekia de no ato afiase wɔ hɔ reka se, “Adɛn nti na wohyɛ nkɔm a ɛte sɛɛ? Woka se, ‘Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Mede saa kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na wafa no nnommum. <verse eid="JER 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4"/>Yudahene Sedekia rennya kwan nguan mfi Babiloniafo nsam, na ampa ara hyɛ na wɔde no bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔne no akasa anim ne anim na ɔde nʼani ahu no. <verse eid="JER 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5"/>Ɔde Sedekia bɛkɔ Babilonia, na hɔ na ɔbɛtena akosi sɛ me ne no bedi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. Sɛ woko tia Babiloniafo no a worenni nkonim.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6"/>Yeremia kae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7"/>Wo wɔfa Salum babarima Hanamel rebɛba wo nkyɛn, abɛka se, ‘Tɔ mʼasase a ɛwɔ Anatot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anatot—Yeremia kurom.</char></note> no, efisɛ woyɛ me busuani titiriw na wowɔ ho kwan, na ɛyɛ wʼasɛde nso sɛ wotɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8"/>“Na sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no, me wɔfa ba Hanamel baa me nkyɛn wɔ awɛmfo adiwo hɔ bɛkae se, ‘Tɔ mʼasase a ɛwɔ Anatot wɔ Benyamin mantam mu no. Esiane sɛ wowɔ ho kwan sɛ wugye na wofa no nti, tɔ na fa.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">“Mihuu sɛ eyi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm.” <verse eid="JER 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9"/>Enti metɔɔ asase a na ɛwɔ Anatot no fii me wɔfa ba Hanamel nkyɛn na mituaa dwetɛ gram ɔha ne aduɔkron anan (194) maa no. <verse eid="JER 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10"/>Mede me nsa hyɛɛ adetɔ nhoma no ase, sɔw ano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sɔw ano—Ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔde nsa bɛhyɛ ase sɛ ɛyɛ nokware nko, na mmom, sɛnea wɔbɛhyɛ nhyehyɛe no mu nsɛm no mu den na amma obiara antumi ansakra mu.</char></note> wɔ nnansefo anim, na mede nsania karii dwetɛ mpɔw no. <verse eid="JER 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11"/>Na mefaa adetɔ nhoma no, nea wɔasɔw ano a ɛho nhyehyɛe wɔ mu no, ne nea wɔnsɔw ano no nso, <verse eid="JER 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12"/>na mede saa adetɔ nhoma no maa Neria babarima Baruk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baruk—Ase ne “Awurade ahyira no.” Na ɔyɛ Yeremia kyerɛwfo nokwafo.</char></note> a, ɔyɛ Maaseia nena no wɔ me wɔfa ba Hanamel, nnansefo a wɔde wɔn nsa hyɛɛ adetɔ nhoma no ase ne Yudafo a na wɔwɔ awɛmfo adiwo hɔ no nyinaa anim.<verse eid="JER 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13"/>“Meka kyerɛɛ Baruk wɔ wɔn nyinaa anim se, <verse eid="JER 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14"/>‘Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se ni: Fa saa adetɔ so nhoma yi, nea wɔasɔw ano ne nea wɔnsɔw ano, na fa gu dɔte asuhina mu, sɛnea ɛbɛkyɛ yiye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fa to asuhina mu sɛnea ɛbɛkyɛ yiye—Krataa a wohuu no asuhina mu wɔ Ɛlefantin ne Kumram (nkurow a ɛdeda Nkyene Po atɔe fam) no dii mfe 2,000 ne akyi a ɛho anka.</char></note> <verse eid="JER 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se ni: Wɔbɛtotɔ afi, mfuw ne bobe nturo wɔ asase yi so bio.’ <verse eid="JER 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16"/>“Mede adetɔ nhoma no maa Neria babarima Baruk akyiri no, mebɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpae se,<verse eid="JER 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17"/>“Ao, Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo na wonam wo tumi ne wo basa a woateɛ mu so abɔ ɔsoro ne asase. Biribiara nyɛ den mma wo. <verse eid="JER 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18"/>Wuyi ɔdɔ adi kyerɛ mpempem, nanso wutua agyanom amumɔyɛ so ka gu wɔn mma a wodi wɔn akyi srɛ so. Onyankopɔn Tweduampɔn a woso na wowɔ tumi, wo din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, <verse eid="JER 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19"/>wo botae so, na wo nneyɛe yɛ kɛse. Wʼaniwa hu nnipa akwan nyinaa; na wutua obiara ka sɛnea nʼabrabɔ ne ne nneyɛe te. <verse eid="JER 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20"/>Woyɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne ne anwonwade wɔ Misraim na atoa so de abesi nnɛ wɔ Israel ne adesamma nyinaa mu, na wode agye din a ɛwɔ wo de besi nnɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21"/>Wode nsɛnkyerɛnne ne anwonwade, nsa a ɛyɛ den ne abasa a wɔateɛ mu ne nneɛma ɛyɛ hu yii wo man Israel fii Misraim. <verse eid="JER 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22"/>Wode asase a wokaa ho ntam sɛ wode bɛma wɔn agyanom no maa wɔn, asase a nufusu ne ɛwo sen wɔ so. <verse eid="JER 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23"/>Wɔba bedii, na wɔtenaa so, nanso wɔantie wo, na wɔanni wo mmara so; wɔanyɛ nea wohyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no. Enti wode saa amanehunu yi nyinaa baa wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24"/>“Hwɛ sɛnea wɔasisi ntuano mpampim de rebegye kuropɔn no. Esiane afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm nti, wɔde kuropɔn no bɛhyɛ Babiloniafo a wɔretow ahyɛ ne so no nsa. Nea wokae no aba mu sɛnea wuhu no mprempren no. <verse eid="JER 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25"/>Na ɛwɔ mu sɛ wɔde kuropɔn no bɛhyɛ Babiloniafo nsa de, nanso wo, Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ka kyerɛ me se, ‘Fa dwetɛ tɔ asase na ma nnansefo mmra ho nhyehyɛe no mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27"/>“Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adesamma nyinaa Nyankopɔn. Na biribi yɛ den dodo ma me ana? <verse eid="JER 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28"/>Enti nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Mede kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniafo ne Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na wɔafa. <verse eid="JER 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29"/>Babiloniafo a wɔretow ahyɛ saa kuropɔn yi so no bɛba, na wɔato mu gya; wɔbɛhyew no dwerɛbee, ɛno ne afi a nnipa hyew nnuhuam wɔ atifi maa Baal na wohwiee afɔrebɔ nsa maa anyame foforo de hyɛɛ me abufuw no.<verse eid="JER 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30"/>“Israelfo ne Yudafo nyɛɛ biribiara sɛ bɔne wɔ mʼani so, efi wɔn mmabun bere mu; ampa ara Israelfo nyɛɛ biribiara sɛ wɔde nneɛma a wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ bɛhyɛ me abufuw, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31"/>Efi da a wɔkyekyeree saa kuropɔn yi de besi nnɛ, wahyɛ me abufuw ne abufuwtraso a ɛsɛ sɛ miyi no fi mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32"/>Israelfo ne Yudafo de bɔne a wɔayɛ nyinaa ahyɛ me abufuw, wɔn, wɔn ahemfo ne adwumayɛfo, wɔn asɔfo ne adiyifo, mmarima a wɔwɔ Yuda ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 32:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33"/>Wɔdan wɔn akyi kyerɛɛ me; ɛwɔ mu, mekyerɛkyerɛ wɔn bere biara de, nanso wɔantie na wɔamfa nteɛso. <verse eid="JER 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34"/>Wɔasisi ahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwade wɔ ofi a me Din da so no mu, de guu ho fi. <verse eid="JER 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35"/>Wosisii sorɔnsorɔmmea maa Baal wɔ Ben Hinom bon mu, de wɔn mmabarima ne mmabea bɔɔ afɔre maa Molek, wɔ bere a menhyɛɛ wɔn na ɛmmaa mʼadwene mu da sɛ wɔnyɛ saa akyiwade yi mma Yuda nyɛ bɔne.<verse eid="JER 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36"/>“Woreka wɔ kuropɔn yi ho se, ‘Wɔnam afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm so de bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa’; nanso sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: <verse eid="JER 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37"/>Ampa ara mɛboaboa wɔn ano afi nsase a mifi mʼabufuwhyew mu pam wɔn koguu hɔ; mɛsan de wɔn aba ha na mama wɔatena ase ahotɔ mu. <verse eid="JER 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38"/>Wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfo, na mayɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn. <verse eid="JER 32:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39"/>Na mɛma wɔn koma koro na wɔayɛ wɔn ade abɔ mu, sɛnea bere biara wobesuro me, wɔn ankasa ne wɔn nkyirimma yiyedi nti. <verse eid="JER 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40"/>Na me ne wɔn bɛyɛ daapem apam: Merennyae wɔn yiyeyɛ da, na mede ɔpɛ bɛhyɛ wɔn koma mu, ama wɔasuro me, sɛnea wɔrentwe wɔn ho mfi me ho da. <verse eid="JER 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41"/>Mʼani begye sɛ mɛyɛ wɔn yiye, na ampa ara mede me koma ne me kra nyinaa bedua wɔn wɔ asase yi so.<verse eid="JER 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Sɛnea mede amanehunu kɛse yi nyinaa aba nkurɔfo yi so no, saa ara na mede yiyedi a mahyɛ wɔn ho bɔ no bɛma wɔn. <verse eid="JER 32:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43"/>Wɔbɛtotɔ nsase bio wɔ ha, nea moka wɔ ho se, ‘Wɔde ahyɛ Babiloniafo nsa, ɛno nti ada mpan, na nnipa anaa mmoa nni so no.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44"/>Wɔde dwetɛ bɛtotɔ nsase, na wɔbɛyɛ adetɔ nhoma wɔ so. Wɔbɛsɔw ano wɔ nnansefo anim wɔ Benyamin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benyamin mantam. Wɔbɔ Benyamin din ha kan efisɛ na hɔ yɛ ɔmantam a Yeremia kurow a ofi mu wɔ.</char></note> mantam, nkuraa a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia, nkurow a ɛwɔ Yuda, bepɔw so man, atɔe fam mmepɔw ase ne Negeb, efisɛ mɛsan de wɔn ahonyade ama wɔn, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.”<verse eid="JER 32:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogye Ho Bɔhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1"/>Bere a Yeremia da so da dua mu wɔ awɛmfo adiwo hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn ne mprenu so se: <verse eid="JER 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, nea ɔbɔɔ asase, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔyɛe na ɔma egyinae, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din: <verse eid="JER 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3"/>‘Frɛ me na megye wo so, na maka wo nsɛm akɛse ne nneɛma a ahintaw a wunnim.’ <verse eid="JER 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4"/>Na nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka de fa afi a ɛwɔ saa kuropɔn yi mu ne Yuda ahemfi ahorow a wɔabubu no ho, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wubenya nea wɔde besiw ntuano afasu ne afoa no ano, <verse eid="JER 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5"/>wɔ wɔne Babiloniafo ɔko no mu. ‘Nnipa a mede mʼabufuw ne mʼabufuwhyew bekunkum wɔn no afunu bɛyɛ hɔ ma. Meyi mʼani afi saa kuropɔn yi so esiane nʼamumɔyɛ nyinaa nti.<verse eid="JER 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6"/>“ ‘Nanso mede ahoɔden ne ayaresa bɛbrɛ no; mɛsa me nkurɔfo yare na mama wɔanya asomdwoe ne bammɔ a ɛdɔɔso. <verse eid="JER 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7"/>Mɛsan de Yuda ne Israel afi nnommum mu aba na masan agye wɔn asi hɔ sɛ nea na wɔte dedaw no. <verse eid="JER 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8"/>Mɛhohoro wɔn bɔne a wɔayɛ atia me no nyinaa, na mede wɔn atuatew ho bɔne nso akyɛ wɔn. <verse eid="JER 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9"/>Na saa kuropɔn yi bɛma me din ahyeta, ɛbɛma me anigye, ayeyi ne anuonyam wɔ asase so aman a wɔte nnepa a meyɛ ma no nyinaa mu; wobesuro na wɔn ho apopo wɔ yiyedi ne asomdwoe bebrebe a mede ma no nti.’<verse eid="JER 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Woka fa saa beae yi ho se, “Ada mpan a nnipa anaasɛ mmoa nni so.” Nanso Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalem mmɔnten a ada mpan na nnipa anaa mmoa nni no, hɔ na wɔbɛsan ate bio, <verse eid="JER 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11"/>ahurusi ne anigye nnyigyei, ayeforo ne ayeforokunu nne ne wɔn a wɔde aseda afɔrebɔ reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi nne se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">“ ‘ “Momfa aseda mma Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">na ne dɔ wɔ hɔ daa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Na mɛsan de asase no so nnepa a wɔwɔ hɔ dedaw no aba bio,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.<verse eid="JER 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Ɛha yi a ada mpan a nnipa ne mmoa nni no; ne nkurow nyinaa so no, wobenya nguanhwɛfo adidibea ne nea wɔn nguankuw bɛhome. <verse eid="JER 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13"/>Nkurow a ɛwɔ ɔman a ɛda bepɔw so no atɔe fam mmepɔw ase mu, Negeb, Benyamin mantam mu, nkuraa a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia ne Yuda nkurow mu, nguankuw betwa mu bio wɔ nea ɔkan wɔn no nsa ase.’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na waka.<verse eid="JER 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14"/>“ ‘Nna no reba,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, a mɛma adom bɔ a mehyɛɛ Israel ne Yudafi no aba mu.<verse eid="JER 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15"/>“ ‘Nna no mu ne saa bere no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">mɛma trenee Dubaa afefɛw afi Dawid ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">ɔbɛyɛ nea ɛteɛ ne nea eye wɔ asase no so.<verse eid="JER 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16"/>Saa nna no mu, wobegye Yuda nkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">na Yerusalem bɛtena asomdwoe mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Eyi ne din a wɔde bɛfrɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Yɛn Trenee.’<verse eid="JER 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Ɔbarima a ɔbɛtena Israel ahengua so no remmɔ Dawid da, <verse eid="JER 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18"/>saa ara nso na asɔfo a wɔyɛ Lewifo no, ɔbarima a obegyina mʼanim daa abɔ ɔhyew afɔre ne aduan afɔre na ɔde afɔre ahorow abrɛ me, remmɔ wɔn da.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se: <verse eid="JER 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Sɛ wubetumi abu me ne adekyee ne adesae apam so, na adekyee ne adesae amma wɔn bere a wɔahyehyɛ no a, <verse eid="JER 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21"/>ɛno de, na me ne mʼakoa Dawid apam ne Lewifo a wɔyɛ asɔfo a wɔsom wɔ mʼanim no apam no nso, wubetumi abu so, na Dawid rennya nʼaseni a ɔbɛtena ahengua so adi hene bio. <verse eid="JER 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22"/>Mɛma mʼakoa Dawid asefo ne Lewifo a wɔsom wɔ mʼanim no ase adɔ te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma a wontumi nkan ne mpoano nwea a wontumi nsusuw.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24"/>“Wontee sɛ nnipa yi reka se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo ahenni abien a oyii no’ ana? Enti wobu me man animtiaa na wɔmmfa wɔn sɛ wɔyɛ ɔman bio. <verse eid="JER 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: ‘Sɛ mantintim me ne adekyee ne adesae apam ne ɔsoro ne asase mmara no a, <verse eid="JER 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26"/>ɛno de anka mɛpo Yakob ne mʼakoa Dawid asefo, na merenyi ne mmabarima mu baako sɛ onni Abraham, Isak ne Yakob asefo so. Na mede wɔn ahonyade bɛsan ama wɔn, na manya ayamhyehye ama wɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Sedekia Kɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1"/>Bere a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼakofo ne nʼahenni nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔwɔ ahemman a odi so no mu reko tia Yerusalem ne nkurow a atwa ne ho ahyia no, saa asɛm yi fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ se, <verse eid="JER 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2"/>“Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se ni: Kɔ Yudahene Sedekia nkyɛn na kɔka kyerɛ no se, ‘Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Mede kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔbɛhyew no dwerɛbee. <verse eid="JER 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3"/>Worenguan mfi ne nsam na nokware, wɔbɛkyere wo de wo akɔma no. Wode wʼani behu Babiloniahene na ɔne wo bɛkasa anim ne anim. Na wobɛkɔ Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4"/>“ ‘Nanso tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔhyɛ, Yudahene Sedekia. Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa wo ho: Worennwu wɔ afoa ano; <verse eid="JER 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5"/>na wubewu asomdwoe mu. Sɛnea nnipa bɔɔ ayiyɛ gyatannaa de hyɛɛ wʼagyanom anuonyam, ahemfo dedaw a wodii wʼanim no, saa ara na wɔbɛbɔ gyatannaa ahyɛ wo anuonyam na wɔadi awerɛhow se, “Ao, owura!” Mʼankasa na mehyɛ saa bɔ yi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6"/>Na odiyifo Yeremia kaa eyinom nyinaa kyerɛɛ Yudahene Sedekia wɔ Yerusalem, <verse eid="JER 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7"/>bere a Babiloniahene asraafo reko atia Yerusalem ne Yuda nkuropɔn, Lakis ne Aseka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lakis ne Aseka—Salomo babarima Rehoboam bɔɔ saa nkurow yi ho ban nanso akyiri no, Asiria hempɔn Senaherib tuaa ano wɔ Lakis hene Hesekia bere so. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 32:9">2 Be 32.9</ref></char>)</char></note> a na wogu so reko wɔ hɔ. Eyinom ne nkuropɔn a na aka wɔ Yuda a wɔwɔ bammɔ.<verse eid="JER 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkoa Ahofadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8"/>Asɛm no fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn wɔ bere a ɔhene Sedekia ne Yerusalemfo ayɛ apam sɛ wɔbɛma nkoa ahofadi no akyi. <verse eid="JER 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara gyaa ne nkoa ne mfenaa Hebrifo; na obiara nni ho kwan sɛ ɔde ne yɔnko Yudani yɛ akoa. <verse eid="JER 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10"/>Enti adwumayɛfo no nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔyɛɛ saa apam yi penee so sɛ wobegyaa wɔn nkoa ne mfenaa, na wɔremfa wɔn nyɛ nkoa bio. Wɔpenee so, na wogyaa wɔn. <verse eid="JER 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11"/>Nanso akyiri no, wɔsesaa wɔn adwene na wɔsan faa nnipa a wogyaa wɔn no de wɔn yɛɛ nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13"/>“Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se ni: Me ne mo agyanom yɛɛ apam bere a miyii wɔn fii Misraim, nkoasom asase so no. Mekae se, <verse eid="JER 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14"/>‘Mfe ason biara no, ɛsɛ sɛ mo mu biara gyaa ne yɔnko Hebrini a watɔn ne ho ama no. Sɛ wasom mfe asia a gyaa no na ɔmfa ne ho nni.’ Nanso mo agyanom antie na wɔamfa mʼasɛm. <verse eid="JER 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15"/>Ɛnkyɛe koraa, nanso munuu mo ho na moyɛɛ nea eye wɔ mʼani so: Mo mu biara paee ahofadi maa ne manmma. Mpo moyɛɛ apam wɔ mʼanim, wɔ ofi a me Din da so no mu. <verse eid="JER 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16"/>Nanso mprempren, moadan mo ho na moahura me din ho; mo mu biara asan akɔfa nkoa ne mfenaa a mugyaa wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔ baabiara a wɔpɛ no. Moahyɛ wɔn ama wɔayɛ mo nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17"/>“Afei nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Muntiee me na mompaee ahofadi mmaa mo ankasa nkurɔfo. Enti afei mepae ‘ahofadi’ ma mo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. ‘Ahofadi’ a ebegyaa mo ama afoa, ɔyaredɔm ne ɔkɔm. Mɛma moayɛ akyiwade ama asase so ahenni ahorow nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18"/>Nnipa a wɔabu mʼapam so, na wɔanni nhyehyɛe a ɛwɔ apam a wɔayɛ wɔ mʼanim no so no, mɛyɛ wɔn sɛ nantwi ba a wɔpae ne mu abien na wɔnantew nʼafaafa no ntam no. <verse eid="JER 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19"/>Yuda ne Yerusalem ntuanofo, asennii adwumayɛfo, asɔfo ne asase no so nnipa no nyinaa a monantew faa nantwi ba no afaafa no ntam no, <verse eid="JER 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20"/>mede wɔn bɛma wɔn atamfo a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn nkwa no. Wɔn afunu bɛyɛ aduan ama wim nnomaa ne asase so mmoa.<verse eid="JER 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21"/>“Mede Yudahene Sedekia ne nʼadwumayɛfo bɛhyɛ wɔn atamfo a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn nkwa, Babiloniahene asraafo a wɔatwe wɔn ho no nsa. <verse eid="JER 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22"/>Merebɛhyɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ni, na mɛsan de wɔn aba kuropɔn yi mu. Wɔbɛko atia no, wɔbɛfa, na wɔahyew no dwerɛbee. Na mɛma Yuda nkurow ada mpan a obiara rentumi ntena hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Rekabfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1"/>Eyi ne asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ wɔ bere a na Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim di ade no: <verse eid="JER 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2"/>“Kɔ Rekabfo abusua no nkyɛn, na to nsa frɛ wɔn na wɔmmra <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi no pia baako mu, na ma wɔn nsa nnom.”<verse eid="JER 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3"/>Enti mekɔpɛɛ Habasinia babarima Yeremia babarima Yaasania ne ne nuabarimanom ne ne mmabarima nyinaa, Rekabfo abusuadɔm no. <verse eid="JER 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4"/>Mede wɔn baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi, na mede wɔn kɔɔ Onyame nipa Yigdalia babarima Hanan mmabarima dan mu. Ɛno na edi adwumayɛfo dan a esi ɔpon ano hwɛfo Salum babarima Maaseia dan atifi no so. <verse eid="JER 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5"/>Afei mede nkuruwa ne nkora a nsa wɔ mu besisii Rekabfo abusuamma no anim na meka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Monnom nsa kakra.”<verse eid="JER 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6"/>Nanso wobuae se, “Yɛnnnom nsa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɛnnnom nsa—Rekabfo daa daa ntam a wɔaka. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:2-3">4 Mose 6.2-3</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:4-7">Ate 13.4-7</ref></char>)</char></note> efisɛ yɛn nena Rekab babarima Yehonadab maa yɛn ɔhyɛ nsɛm yi se, ‘Ɛnsɛ sɛ mo anaa mo asefo nom nsa. <verse eid="JER 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7"/>Na afei ɛnsɛ sɛ musisi afi, mudua anaa moyɛ bobe nturo, ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ eyinom mu biara, na mmom montena ntamadan mu bere biara. Ɛno na mo nkwanna bɛware, wɔ asase a moyɛ atutenafo wɔ so no so.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8"/>Yɛatie biribiara a yɛn nena Rekab babarima Yonadad hyɛɛ yɛn no. Na yɛn, yɛn yerenom, mmabarima ne mmabea nnom nsa da <verse eid="JER 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9"/>na yensisii afi ntenaa mu anaa yennyaa bobe nturo anaa mfuw anaa nnɔbae. <verse eid="JER 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10"/>Yɛatenatena ntamadan mu, na yɛadi biribiara a yɛn nena Yehonadab hyɛɛ yɛn no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11"/>Nanso bere a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar tuu asase yi so sa no, yɛkae se, ‘Mommra, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ Yerusalem na yeguan fi Babiloniafo ne Aramfo asraafo anim.’ Ɛno nti yɛaka Yerusalem.”<verse eid="JER 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ mmarima a wɔwɔ Yuda ne Yerusalem se, ‘Morensua biribi na morentie mʼasɛm ana?’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14"/>‘Rekab ba Yehonadab hyɛɛ ne mmabarima sɛ wɔnnom nsa, na wɔadi saa ɔhyɛ yi so. De besi nnɛ wɔnnom nsa, efisɛ wodi wɔn agyanom ahyɛde so. Na makasa akyerɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso muntiee me. <verse eid="JER 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15"/>Mesomaa mʼasomfo adiyifo nyinaa baa mo nkyɛn mpɛn bebree. Wɔkae se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ mo mu biara sakra fi nʼamumɔyɛ akwan so, na moma mo akwan teɛ; munnni anyame foforo akyi na monnsom wɔn. Ɛno na mobɛtena asase a mede ama mo ne mo agyanom yi so.” Nanso mummmuaa me na munntiee me ɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16"/>Rekab babarima Yehonadab asefo adi ahyɛde a wɔn agyanom de maa wɔn no so, nanso saa nnipa yi ntie mʼasɛm.’<verse eid="JER 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17"/>“Ɛno nti, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn, Israel Nyankopɔn no se: ‘Muntie! Mede amanehunu biara a mahyɛ ama Yuda ne obiara a ɔte Yerusalem no bɛba wɔn so. Mekasa kyerɛɛ wɔn, nanso wɔantie, mefrɛɛ wɔn nanso wɔannye so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18"/>Afei Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Rekab abusua no se, “Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se: ‘Moayɛ osetie ama mo nena Yehonadab ahyɛde no, na moadi ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so, na moayɛ biribiara a ɔhyɛɛ mo no.’ <verse eid="JER 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19"/>Ɛno nti, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn no se ni: ‘Rekab babarima Yehonadab benya ɔbarima a ɔbɛsom me bere biara.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiakim Hyew Yeremia Nhoma Mmobɔwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1"/>Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim afe a ɛto so anan mu, saa asɛm yi fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ: <verse eid="JER 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2"/>“Fa nhoma mmobɔwee, na kyerɛw nsɛm a maka akyerɛ wo fa Israel, Yuda ne aman a aka no ho nyinaa, efi bere a mifii ase kasa kyerɛɛ wo wɔ Yosia adedi bere so de besi nnɛ no gu so. <verse eid="JER 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3"/>Ebia, sɛ Yudafo te amanehunu biara a mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede bɛba wɔn so no a, wɔn mu biara bɛdan afi nʼamumɔyɛ ho na afei mede wɔn amumɔyɛ ne wɔn bɔne bɛkyɛ wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4"/>Enti Yeremia frɛɛ Neria babarima Baruk, na bere a ɔreka nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ no nyinaa no, Baruk kyerɛw guu nhoma mmobɔwee no mu. <verse eid="JER 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5"/>Afei Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Baruk se, “Meda dua mu; merentumi nkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu. <verse eid="JER 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6"/>Enti kɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi mmuadadi da bi na kenkan nsɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn a meka ma wokyerɛw guu nhoma mmobɔwee no so no kyerɛ nnipa no. Kenkan kyerɛ Yudafo a wofi wɔn nkurow so aba no. <verse eid="JER 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7"/>Ebia wɔde wɔn nkotosrɛ bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim na wɔn mu biara adan afi nʼamumɔyɛ akwan no so, efisɛ abufuw ne abufuwhyew nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka atia saa nnipa yi so.” <verse eid="JER 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8"/>Neria babarima Baruk yɛɛ biribiara a odiyifo Yeremia kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no, ɔkenkan <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛm a ɛwɔ nhoma mmobɔwee no mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu. <verse eid="JER 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9"/>Ɔsram a ɛto so akron wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedi afe a ɛto so anum so no, wɔpaee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim mmuadadi maa nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa ne wɔn a wofi Yuda nkurow so aba no. <verse eid="JER 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10"/>Baruk kenkan Yeremia nsɛm a ɛwɔ nhoma mmobɔwee no mu kyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu nyinaa; fii Safan babarima Gemaria a ɔyɛ ɔkyerɛwfo no pia a ɛwɔ asɔredan no atifi adiwo na ɛbɛn Ɔpon Foforo no mu.<verse eid="JER 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11"/>Bere a Safan babarima Gemaria babarima Mikaia tee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛm a ɛwɔ nhoma mmobɔwee no mu no, <verse eid="JER 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12"/>ɔkɔɔ ɔkyerɛwfo no dan a ɛwɔ ahemfi hɔ no mu, faako a na adwumayɛfo no nyinaa: ɔkyerɛwfo Elisama, Semaia babarima Delaia, Akbor babarima Elnatan, Safan babarima Gemaria, Hanania babarima Sedekia ne adwumayɛfo a wɔaka no nyinaa tete. <verse eid="JER 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13"/>Mikaia kaa nsɛm a Baruk kenkan fii nhoma mmobɔwee no mu nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn no akyi no, <verse eid="JER 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14"/>adwumayɛfo no nyinaa somaa Kusi babarima Selemia babarima Netania babarima Yehudi sɛ ɔnkɔka nkyerɛ Baruk se, “Fa nhoma mmobɔwee a wokenkan fii mu kyerɛɛ nnipa no bra, na bra.” Enti Neria babarima Baruk kɔɔ wɔn hɔ a na okura nhoma mmobɔwee no. <verse eid="JER 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Yɛsrɛ wo tena ase, na kenkan kyerɛ yɛn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Enti Baruk kenkan kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="JER 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16"/>Wɔtee saa nsɛm yi nyinaa no, wɔde ehu hwehwɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho anim na wɔka kyerɛɛ Baruk se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka saa nsɛm yi nyinaa kyerɛ ɔhene.” <verse eid="JER 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17"/>Afei wobisaa Baruk se, “Ka kyerɛ yɛn, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wokyerɛw eyinom nyinaa? Yeremia na ɔka ma wokyerɛw ana?”<verse eid="JER 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18"/>Baruk buae se, “Yiw, ɔno na ɔkaa saa nsɛm yi nyinaa ma mede adubiri kyerɛw guu nhoma mmobɔwee no mu.”<verse eid="JER 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19"/>Na adwumayɛfo no ka kyerɛɛ Baruk se, “Wo ne Yeremia, munkohintaw. Monnkyerɛ obiara mo akyi kwan.”<verse eid="JER 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20"/>Wɔde nhoma mmobɔwee no kosiee ɔkyerɛwfo Elisama dan mu akyiri no, wɔkɔɔ ɔhene no nkyɛn wɔ nʼabangua no mu kɔkaa biribiara kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="JER 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21"/>Ɔhene no somaa Yehudi se, ɔnkɔfa nhoma mmobɔwee no mmra. Yehudi kɔfa fii ɔkyerɛwfo Elisama dan mu, bɛkenkan kyerɛɛ ɔhene ne adwumayɛfo a wogyinagyina ne ho no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22"/>Na ɛyɛ ɔsram a ɛto so akron a na ɔhene no te awɔwbere dan mu reto ogya a esi nʼanim. <verse eid="JER 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23"/>Bere biara a Yehudi bɛkenkan nhoma mmobɔwee no afaafa bɛyɛ abiɛsa anaa anan no, ɔhene no de ɔkyerɛwfo afoa, twitwa de gu ogya no mu, kosii sɛ nhoma mmobɔwee no nyinaa hyewee. <verse eid="JER 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24"/>Ɔhene no ne nʼasomfo a wɔtee saa nsɛm yi nyinaa no ammɔ hu, na wɔansunsuane wɔn ntade mu nso. <verse eid="JER 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ Elnatan, Delaia ne Gemaria srɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ ɔnhyew nhoma mmobɔwee no, nanso wantie wɔn. <verse eid="JER 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26"/>Mmom ɔhene no hyɛɛ ne babarima Yerahmeel, Asriel babarima Seraia ne Abdeel babarima Selemia se, wɔnkɔkyere ɔkyerɛwfo Baruk ne odiyifo Yeremia mmra. Nanso na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de wɔn asie.<verse eid="JER 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27"/>Ɔhene no hyew nhoma mmobɔwee a na nsɛm a Baruk akyerɛw afi Yeremia anum wɔ mu no akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28"/>“Fa nhoma mmobɔwee foforo, na kyerɛw nsɛm a ɛwɔ kan mmobɔwee a Yudahene Yehoiakim hyew no gu mu. <verse eid="JER 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29"/>Afei ka kyerɛ Yudahene Yehoiakim se, ‘Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Wohyew nhoma mmobɔwee no kae se: “Adɛn nti na wokyerɛw wɔ mu se ɔkwan biara so, Babiloniahene bɛba abɛsɛe asase yi na watɔre so nnipa ne mmoa nyinaa ase?” <verse eid="JER 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30"/>Ɛno nti, sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene Yehoiakim ho: Ɔrennya obi ntena Dawid ahengua so. Wɔbɛtow ne funu akyene a, wɔrensie no, na wada owia hyew ne anadwo awɔw mu. <verse eid="JER 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31"/>Mɛtwe ɔno ne ne mma ne nʼasomfo aso wɔ wɔn amumɔyɛ nti; mede amanehunu biara a mahyɛ atia wɔn bɛba wɔn ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem ne Yudafo so, efisɛ wɔantie.’ ”<verse eid="JER 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32"/>Na Yeremia faa nhoma mmobɔwee foforo, na ɔka maa ne kyerɛwfo Baruk kyerɛwee. Ɔkaa biribiara a na ɛwɔ nhoma mmobɔwee no a ɔhene Yehoiakim hyew no no so. Na ɔde nsɛm pii kaa ho.<verse eid="JER 36:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Da Afiase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1"/>Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar de Yosia babarima Sedekia dii Yudahene; osii Yehoiakim babarima Yehoiakin anan mu. <verse eid="JER 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2"/>Ɔno, nʼasomfo ne nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so antie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔnam odiyifo Yeremia so kae no.<verse eid="JER 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3"/>Ɔhene Sedekia somaa Selemia babarima Yehukal ne Maaseia babarima ɔsɔfo Sefania se, wɔnkɔka nkyerɛ Yeremia se, “Yɛsrɛ wo, bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, mpae ma yɛn.”<verse eid="JER 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4"/>Na Yeremia de ne ho a otumi di nnipa no mu akɔneaba, efisɛ na wɔmfaa no ntoo afiase ɛ. <verse eid="JER 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5"/>Na Farao asraafo afi Misraim reba, na Babiloniafo a wɔatua Yerusalem no tee wɔn nka no, wofii Yerusalem.<verse eid="JER 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifo Yeremia nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: Monka nkyerɛ Yudahene a, ɔsomaa mo se mummebisa me hɔ biribi no se, ‘Farao asraafo a wofii adi sɛ wɔrebɛboa mo no bɛsan akɔ wɔn ankasa asase, Misraim so. <verse eid="JER 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8"/>Na Babiloniafo no bɛsan abɛtow ahyɛ saa kuropɔn yi so; wobegye na wɔahyew kurow no dwerɛbee.’<verse eid="JER 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9"/>“Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Monnnaadaa mo ho nsusuw sɛ, ‘Ampa ara Babiloniafo no befi yɛn so akɔ.’ Wɔrenkɔ! <verse eid="JER 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10"/>Sɛ mudi Babiloniafo asraafo a wɔatow ahyɛ mo so no so ma ɛka apirafo wɔ wɔn ntamadan mu mpo a, wobefi adi abɛhyew kuropɔn yi dwerɛbee.”<verse eid="JER 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11"/>Babilonia asraafo no fii Yerusalem, esiane Farao asraafo no nti akyiri no, <verse eid="JER 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12"/>Yeremia yɛɛ ahoboa sɛ ɔrefi kuropɔn no mu, akɔ Benyamin mantam mu akogye nʼagyapade mu kyɛfa wɔ nkurɔfo a wɔwɔ hɔ no nkyɛn. <verse eid="JER 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13"/>Nanso okoduu Benyamin Pon ano no, awɛmfo no so panyin a wɔfrɛ no Yiria a ɔyɛ Selemia babarima ne Hanania nena kyeree no kae se, “Woreguan agya yɛn akɔ Babiloniafo afa!”<verse eid="JER 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14"/>Yeremia buae se, “Ɛnyɛ nokware. Merenguan nkɔ Babiloniafo afa.” Nanso Yiria antie, na mmom ɔkyeree Yeremia de no kɔmaa ne mpanyimfo. <verse eid="JER 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15"/>Wɔn bo fuw Yeremia, na wɔma wɔboroo no de no too afiase wɔ ɔkyerɛwfo Yonatan fi a na wɔde ayɛ afiase no.<verse eid="JER 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16"/>Wɔde Yeremia too asase ase afiase, ma odii nna bebree wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JER 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17"/>Akyiri no, ɔhene Sedekia soma ma wɔkɔfaa no baa ahemfi, ɛhɔ na obisaa no wɔ kokoa mu se, “Woanya asɛm bi afi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Yeremia buae se, “Yiw, wɔde wo bɛma Babiloniahene.”<verse eid="JER 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18"/>Afei Yeremia bisaa ɔhene no se, “Dɛn bɔne na mayɛ atia wo, anaa wʼadwumayɛfo anaa nnipa yi a enti wɔde me ato afiase yi? <verse eid="JER 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19"/>Ɛhe na wʼadiyifo a wɔhyɛɛ nkɔm kyerɛɛ wo se, ‘Babiloniahene rentow nhyɛ wo so anaa asase yi so’ no wɔ? <verse eid="JER 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20"/>Na afei, ɔdɛɛfo, mesrɛ wo tie. Ma memfa me nkotosrɛ nto wʼanim: Mfa me nkɔto ɔkyerɛwfo Yonatan fi hɔ bio, anyɛ saa a mewu wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21"/>Ɔhene Sedekia hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Yeremia nkɔto awɛmfo adiwo hɔ, na wɔmma no brodo a efi brodotofo borɔn so da biara nkosi sɛ kuropɔn no mu brodo nyinaa bɛsa. Enti Yeremia kaa awɛmfo adiwo hɔ.<verse eid="JER 37:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yeremia Hyɛ Abura Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1"/>Matan babarima Sefatia, Pashur babarima Gedalia, Selemia babarima Yukal ne Malkia babarima Pashur tee nsɛm a na Yeremia reka akyerɛ nnipa no nyinaa se, <verse eid="JER 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Obiara a ɔbɛtena kuropɔn yi mu no bewu wɔ afoa, ɔkɔm anaa ɔyaredɔm ano, nanso obiara a ɔbɛkɔ Babiloniafo afa no benya nkwa. Obenya ne ti adidi mu, ɔbɛtena nkwa mu. <verse eid="JER 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3"/>Na sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, ‘Ampa ara, wɔde saa kuropɔn yi bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene asraafo nsa, na wɔn na wobedi so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4"/>Ɛno nti adwumayɛfo no ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wokum saa ɔbarima yi. Ɔde nsɛm a ɔreka no bu asraafo a wɔaka wɔ kuropɔn yi mu ne nnipa no nyinaa aba mu. Saa ɔbarima yi nhwehwɛ saa nnipa yi yiyedi na mmom wɔn sɛe.”<verse eid="JER 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5"/>Ɔhene Sedekia buae se, “Ɔwɔ mo nsam, ɔhene rentumi nyɛ biribiara ntia mo.”<verse eid="JER 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6"/>Enti wɔfaa Yeremia de no kɔhyɛɛ ɔhene babarima Malkia abura a ɛwɔ awɛmfo adiwo no mu. Wɔde ntampehama gyaagyaa no too abura no mu; na nsu nni mu, mmom dontori na na ɛwɔ mu, enti Yeremia kɔhyɛɛ dontori no mu.<verse eid="JER 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7"/>Na Ebed-Melek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebed-Melek—Ɛkyerɛ “ahenkwaa”.</char></note> Kusni odwumayɛni a ɔwɔ ahemfi hɔ tee sɛ wɔde Yeremia akɔto abura no mu. Bere a ɔhene no te Benyamin Pon hɔ no, <verse eid="JER 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8"/>Ebed-Melek fii ahemfi hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <verse eid="JER 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9"/>“Ɔdɛɛfo, nea saa nnipa yi ayɛ nyinaa yɛ amumɔyɛsɛm a etia odiyifo Yeremia. Wɔatow no akyene abura mu, baabi a ɔkɔm bekum no wɔ bere a brodo asa wɔ kuropɔn yi mu.”<verse eid="JER 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10"/>Na ɔhene hyɛɛ Kusni, Ebed-Melek se, “Fa mmarima aduasa fi ha ka wo ho, na munkoyi odiyifo Yeremia mfi abura no mu, ansa na wawu.”<verse eid="JER 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11"/>Ɛno nti Ebed-Melek faa mmarima no kaa ne ho, na wɔkɔɔ ɔdan bi a ɛwɔ adekorabea ase, wɔ ahemfi hɔ. Ɔkɔsesaw ntamagow ne ntade dedaw de kyekyeree ntampehama ho, gyaa mu maa Yeremia wɔ abura no mu. <verse eid="JER 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12"/>Na Kusni, Ebed-Melek ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Fa ntamagow ne ntade dedaw no hyehyɛ wo mmotuam, na ntampehama no ammia wo.” Na Yeremia yɛɛ saa, <verse eid="JER 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13"/>Wɔde ntampehama no twetwee no yii no fii abura no mu. Na Yeremia tenaa awɛmfo adiwo hɔ.<verse eid="JER 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekia Bisa Yeremia Nsɛm Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14"/>Na Ɔhene Sedekia soma ma wɔkɔfaa odiyifo Yeremia baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan ano kwan a ɛto so abiɛsa hɔ. Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Merebebisa wo asɛm bi, mfa biribiara nsie me.”<verse eid="JER 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15"/>Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Sedekia se, “Sɛ mema wo mmuae a, worenkum me ana? Mpo sɛ mitu wo fo a, worentie me.”<verse eid="JER 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16"/>Nanso ɔhene Sedekia kaa saa ntam yi kokoa mu kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔma yɛn nkwa no te ase yi, merenkum wo na meremfa wo nhyɛ wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wokum wo no nsa.”<verse eid="JER 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17"/>Afei Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Sedekia se, “Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn, Israel Nyankopɔn, no se: ‘Sɛ wode wo ho ma Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo a, wɔrenkum wo na wɔrenhyew kuropɔn yi, wo ne wʼabusuafo bɛtena nkwa mu. <verse eid="JER 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18"/>Na sɛ woremfa wo ho mma Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo a, wɔde saa kuropɔn yi bɛma Babiloniafo, na wɔbɛhyew no dwerɛbee; na wo ankasa rentumi nguan mfi wɔn nsam.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19"/>Ɔhene Sedekia ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Misuro Yudafo a wɔkɔ Babiloniafo afa no, efisɛ ebia Babiloniafo no de me bɛma wɔn na wɔayɛ me ayayade.”<verse eid="JER 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20"/>Yeremia buae se, “Wɔremfa wo mma wɔn. Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm na yɛ nea meka kyerɛ wo. Ɛno na ɛbɛma asi wo yiye na woanya nkwa. <verse eid="JER 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21"/>Nanso sɛ woamfa wo ho amma Babiloniafo no de a, nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi akyerɛ me ni: <verse eid="JER 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22"/>Mmea a wɔaka wɔ Yudahene ahemfi hɔ nyinaa no, wɔde wɔn befi adi abrɛ Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo no. Saa mmea no bɛka akyerɛ wo se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“ ‘Wɔdaadaa wo na wodii wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">wo nnamfonom a wugye wɔn di no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Wʼanan amem wɔ dontori mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">wo nnamfonom agyaw wo hɔ kɔ.’<verse eid="JER 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23"/>“Wɔde wo yerenom nyinaa ne wo mma bɛbrɛ Babiloniafo no. Wo de, worentumi nguan mfi wɔn nsam, na mmom Babiloniahene bɛkyere wo, na wɔbɛhyew saa kuropɔn yi.”<verse eid="JER 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24"/>Na Sedekia ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Mma obiara nte saa nkɔmmɔdi yi, anyɛ saa a, wubewu. <verse eid="JER 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25"/>Sɛ adwumayɛfo no te sɛ me ne wo kasae, na wobebisa wo se, ‘Ma yɛnte nea woka kyerɛɛ ɔhene ne nea ɔhene nso ka kyerɛɛ wo; mfa nsie yɛn anyɛ saa a yebekum wo a,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26"/>ɛno de ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Na meresrɛ ɔhene sɛ ɔmmfa me nsan nkɔ Yonatan fi mma me nkowu wɔ hɔ.’ ” <verse eid="JER 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27"/>Adwumayɛfo no nyinaa baa Yeremia hɔ bebisaa no, na ɔkaa nea ɔhene hyɛɛ no se ɔnka no nyinaa. Enti wɔanka hwee ankyerɛ no bio, efisɛ obiara ante ɔne ɔhene nkɔmmɔtwetwe no.<verse eid="JER 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28"/>Na Yeremia tenaa ɔwɛmfo adiwo hɔ kosii da a wɔfaa Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JER 38:28">Wɔfa Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 38:28">Sɛnea wɔfaa Yerusalem ni:<verse eid="JER 38:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1"/>Yudahene Sedekia dii ade no, ne mfe akron mu, ɔsram a ɛto so du so no, Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼasraafo nyinaa tuu Yerusalem so sa, wotuaa kuropɔn no na wɔyɛɛ mpie twaa ho hyiae. <verse eid="JER 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2"/>Sedekia adedi afe a ɛto so dubaako, ɔsram a ɛto so anan no da a ɛto so akron no, wobubuu kuropɔn no afasu. <verse eid="JER 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3"/>Na Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo no nyinaa bɛtenaa Mfimfini Pon hɔ: Nergal-Sareser a ofi Samgar ne Nebo-Sarsekim a ɔyɛ ɔsraani panyin ne Nergal-Sareser a ɔyɛ otitiriw, ne Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo a wɔaka no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4"/>Bere a Yudahene Sedekia ne nʼasraafo nyinaa huu wɔn no, woguanee, wɔfaa ɔhene turo mu fii kuropɔn no mu anadwo, kɔfaa ɔpon a ɛwɔ afasu abien no ntam, de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Araba.<verse eid="JER 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5"/>Nanso Babilonia asraafo no taa wɔn kɔtoo Sedekia wɔ Yeriko tataw so. Wɔfaa no dommum de no kɔmaa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat asase so, na hɔ na obuu no atɛn. <verse eid="JER 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6"/>Ribla hɔ na Babiloniahene kunkum Sedekia mmabarima wɔ nʼanim na okum Yudafo mmapɔmma nyinaa nso. <verse eid="JER 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7"/>Afei otutuu Sedekia ani, de kɔbere mfrafrae mpokyerɛ guu no sɛ ɔde no rekɔ Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8"/>Babiloniafo no de ogya too ahemfi no ne nnipa no afi mu, na wodwiriw Yerusalem afasu no. <verse eid="JER 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a otua ɔhene awɛmfo ano no de kuropɔn no mu nkae, wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho kɔmaa no ne nnipa a wɔaka no kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10"/>Nanso ɔsahene Nebusaradan a otua awɛmfo no ano no gyaa ahiafo a wonni hwee no mu bi wɔ Yuda asase so, na saa bere no ɔmaa wɔn bobe nturo ne nsase.<verse eid="JER 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11"/>Na Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar afa ɔsahene Nebusaradan a otua ɔhene awɛmfo ano no so ama saa ɔhyɛ nsɛm yi a ɛfa Yeremia ho se, <verse eid="JER 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12"/>“Fa no na hwɛ no so; nhaw no na nea obisa biara no, yɛ ma no.” <verse eid="JER 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13"/>Enti ɔsahene Nebusaradan a otua awɛmfo no ano, Nebusaradan, adwumayɛfo panyin, Nergal-Sareser a ɔyɛ otitiriw ne Babiloniahene adwumayɛfo a wɔaka no nyinaa <verse eid="JER 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14"/>soma ma wɔkɔfaa Yeremia fii awɛmfo adiwo hɔ bae. Wɔde no hyɛɛ Safan babarima Gedalia babarima Ahikam nsa sɛ ɔmfa no nkɔ ne fi. Enti Yeremia tenaa nʼankasa nkurɔfo mu.<verse eid="JER 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15"/>Bere a Yeremia da so da afiase wɔ awɛmfo adiwo hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn se, <verse eid="JER 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16"/>“Kɔka kyerɛ Kusni Ebed-Melek se, ‘Sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se ni: Me nsɛm a etia kuropɔn yi, mede refa amanehunu so na ɛnyɛ yiyedi so ama aba mu. Saa bere no ɛbɛba mu wɔ wʼanim. <verse eid="JER 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17"/>Nanso megye wo saa da no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose; wɔremfa wo nhyɛ wɔn a wusuro wɔn no nsa. <verse eid="JER 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18"/>Megye wo nkwa, na worentɔ wɔ afoa ano na mmom wubenya wo ti adidi mu, efisɛ wugye me di, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.’ ”<verse eid="JER 39:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Wogyaa Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a otua ɔhene awɛmfo ano no gyaa Yeremia wɔ Rama akyi no, asɛm no fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ. Ohuu sɛ wɔagu Yeremia nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn wɔ nnommum a wofi Yerusalem ne Yuda a na wɔde wɔn rekɔ Babilonia no mu. <verse eid="JER 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2"/>Bere a ɔsahene a otua awɛmfo no ano no huu Yeremia no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn, na ɔhyɛɛ saa amanehunu yi maa beae yi. <verse eid="JER 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3"/>Na afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama aba mu, wayɛ sɛnea ɔkaa se ɔbɛyɛ no. Eyinom nyinaa baa mu, efisɛ mo saa nnipa yi yɛɛ bɔne tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na moanyɛ osetie amma no. <verse eid="JER 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4"/>Nanso nnɛ mereyi wo afi nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a egu wo nsa no mu. Sɛ wopɛ a, ma yɛnkɔ Babilonia na mɛhwɛ wo so, nanso sɛ wompɛ de a, mma. Hwɛ ɔman no nyinaa na ɛda wʼanim no, kɔ baabiara a wopɛ.” <verse eid="JER 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5"/>Na ansa na Yeremia bɛdan ne ho akɔ no, Nebusaradan ka kaa ho se, “San kɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia a, ɔyɛ Safan nena, a Babiloniahene apa no sɛ ɔnhwɛ Yuda nkurow so no nkyɛn na wo ne no nkɔtena wɔ nnipa no mu, anaasɛ kɔ baabi foforo biara a wopɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Na ɔsahene no maa Yeremia aduan ne akyɛde, na ɔmaa no kɔe. <verse eid="JER 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6"/>Enti Yeremia kɔɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa, na ɔne no tenaa nnipa a wɔkaa wɔ asase no so no mu.<verse eid="JER 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wokum Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7"/>Bere a asraafo mpanyimfo no nyinaa ne wɔn mmarima a wɔda so wɔ wuram no tee sɛ, Babiloniahene ayɛ Ahikam babarima Gedalia amrado wɔ asase no so, na ɔde mmarima, mmea ne mmofra a wɔyɛ ahiafo wɔ asase no so, na wɔamfa wɔn ankɔ nnommum mu wɔ Babilonia ahyɛ ne nsa no, <verse eid="JER 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8"/>wɔbaa Gedalia hɔ wɔ Mispa: Netania babarima Ismael, Karea mmabarima Yohanan ne Yonatan, Tanhumet babarima Seraia, Efai a ofi Netofa mmabarima, Yesania a ɔyɛ Maakatni babarima ne wɔn mmarima. <verse eid="JER 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9"/>Na Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nena no kaa ntam de hyɛɛ wɔn ne wɔn mmarima den se, “Munnsuro sɛ mobɛsom Babiloniafo. Montena asase no so na monsom Babiloniahene, na ebesi mo yiye. <verse eid="JER 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10"/>Me de, mɛtena Mispa, na masi mo anan mu wɔ Babiloniafo a, wɔba yɛn nkyɛn no mu, na mo de, monkɔboaboa nsa, ahohuru bere mu nnuaba ne ngo ano ngu adekora nkuruwa mu wɔ twabere mu, na montenatena nkurow a moafa no so.” <verse eid="JER 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11"/>Bere a Yudafo a wɔwɔ Moab, Amon, Edom ne aman ahorow a aka no, tee sɛ Babiloniahene agyaw nkae bi wɔ Yuda na wayi Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nena sɛ amrado wɔ wɔn so no, <verse eid="JER 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12"/>wɔn nyinaa san baa Yuda asase so fi aman a wɔbɔɔ wɔn petee no so, kɔɔ Gedalia hɔ wɔ Mispa. Na wɔboaboaa nsa ne ahohuru bere mu nnuaba bebree ano wɔ twabere mu.<verse eid="JER 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13"/>Na Karea babarima Yohanan ne ntuano asraafo a wɔda so wɔ wuram no baa Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa <verse eid="JER 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14"/>na wɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Wunnim sɛ, Amonhene Baalis asoma Netania babarima Ismael se, ommekum wo ana?” Nanso Ahikam babarima Gedalia annye wɔn anni.<verse eid="JER 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15"/>Na Karea babarima Yohanan ka kyerɛɛ Gedalia wɔ kokoa mu wɔ Mispa se, “Ma minkokum Netania babarima Ismael, na obiara rente. Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ okum wo na ɔma Yudafo a wɔatwa wo ho ahyia no bɔ ahwete, na Yudafo nkae no yera?”<verse eid="JER 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16"/>Nanso Ahikam babarima Gedalia ka kyerɛɛ Karea babarima Yohanan se, “Nyɛ saa ade yi! Nea woka fa Ismael ho no nyɛ nokware.”<verse eid="JER 40:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1"/>Ɔsram a ɛto so ason mu no, Elisama babarima Netania babarima Ismael a ɔyɛ ɔdehye a na anka ɔyɛ ɔhene adwumayɛfo no mu baako no ne mmarima du baa Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa. Bere a wɔn nyinaa gu so redidi no, <verse eid="JER 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2"/>Netania babarima Ismael ne ne mmarima du no a wɔka ne ho no sɔree na wɔde afoa wɔɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia, a ɔyɛ Safan nena ne nea Babiloniahene ayi no sɛ amrado wɔ asase no so no kum no. <verse eid="JER 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3"/>Ismael kum Yudafo a na wɔka Gedalia ho wɔ Mispa ne Babilonia asraafo a na wɔwɔ hɔ no nso.<verse eid="JER 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4"/>Ade kyee no, ansa na obiara bɛte Gedalia wu no, <verse eid="JER 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5"/>mmarima aduɔwɔtwe a wɔayiyi wɔn abogyesɛ, asunsuane wɔn ntade mu na wɔasesa wɔn honam ani fi Sekem, Silo ne Samaria bae a wɔde aduan afɔrebɔde ne nnuhuam reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi. <verse eid="JER 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6"/>Netania babarima Ismael de agyaadwo fi Mispa kohyiaa wɔn. Bere a ohyiaa wɔn no ɔkae se, “Mommra Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn.” <verse eid="JER 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7"/>Woduu kuropɔn no mu no, Netania babarima Ismael ne mmarima a wɔka ne ho no kum wɔn na wɔtow wɔn afunu guu abura bi mu. <verse eid="JER 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8"/>Nanso nnipa no mu du ka kyerɛɛ Ismael se, “Nkum yɛn! Yɛwɔ awi ne atoko, ngo ne ɛwo a yɛde asie wɔ afuw bi mu.” Enti ogyaa wɔn na wankum wɔn nso. <verse eid="JER 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9"/>Abura a Ismael tow nnipa a okunkum wɔn no afunu ne Gedalia guu mu no, na ɛyɛ nea ɔhene Asa tuu sɛ ne ho bammɔ fa bi de tiaa Israelhene Baasa. Netania babarima Ismael de afunu hyɛɛ no ma.<verse eid="JER 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10"/>Ismael faa nnipa a na wɔaka wɔ Mispa no nyinaa nnommum; ɔhene mmabea ne wɔn a wɔkaa hɔ no nyinaa, wɔn a Nebusaradan a otua ɔhene awɛmfo ano no ayi Ahikam babarima Gedalia sɛ ɔnhwɛ wɔn so no. Netania babarima Ismael faa wɔn nnommum na osii mu kɔɔ Amonfo nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11"/>Bere a Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo a wɔka ne ho no nyinaa tee awudisɛm a Netania babarima Ismael adi no, <verse eid="JER 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12"/>wɔfaa wɔn asraafo nyinaa sɛ wɔne Netania babarima Ismael rekɔko. Wɔkɔtoo no wɔ ɔtare kɛse bi a ɛwɔ Gibeon ho. <verse eid="JER 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13"/>Bere a nnipa a wɔka Ismael ho no nyinaa huu Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo a wɔka ne ho no, wɔn ani gyei. <verse eid="JER 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14"/>Nnipa a na Ismael afa wɔn nnommum wɔ Mispa no nyinaa dan kɔɔ Karea babarima Yohanan afa. <verse eid="JER 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15"/>Nanso Netania babarima Ismael ne ne mmarima baawɔtwe, guan fii Yohanan anim kɔɔ Amonfo nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woguan Kɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16"/>Afei Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo a wɔka ne ho no dii Mispa nkae a ogyee wɔn fii Netania babarima Ismael nsam bere a okum Ahikam babarima Gedalia no akyi no anim: Ɔde asraafo, mmea, mmofra ne asennii adwumayɛfo, fii Gibeon bae. <verse eid="JER 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17"/>Wosii mu sɛ wɔrekɔ Misraim no, wɔsoɛɛ wɔ Gerut Kimham a ɛbɛn Betlehem; <verse eid="JER 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18"/>na wɔreguan Babiloniafo no. Na wosuro wɔn, efisɛ na Netania babarima Ismael akum Ahikam babarima Gedalia a Babiloniahene yii no sɛ amrado a ɔhwɛ asase no so no.<verse eid="JER 41:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1"/>Afei asraafo mpanyimfo no nyinaa a Karea babarima Yohanan ne Hosaia babarima Yesania ka ho, ne nnipa no nyinaa, efi akumaa so kosi ɔkɛse so kɔɔ <verse eid="JER 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2"/>odiyifo Yeremia nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Yɛsrɛ wo, tie yɛn adesrɛ yi na bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn mpae ma wɔn a wɔaka yi nyinaa. Sɛnea wuhu no, kan no na yɛdɔɔso nanso afei yɛaka kakraa bi. <verse eid="JER 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3"/>Bɔ mpae sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn bɛkyerɛ yɛn faako a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ ne nea ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ.”<verse eid="JER 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4"/>Yeremia buaa wɔn se, “Mate mo asɛm no, na ɔkwan biara so mɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn mpae sɛnea moasrɛ no; mɛka nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛka biara akyerɛ mo na meremfa hwee nsie mo.”<verse eid="JER 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5"/>Na afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Sɛ yɛanyɛ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn soma wo se ka kyerɛ yɛn no a, ma ɔnyɛ ɔdanseni nokwafo ntia yɛn. <verse eid="JER 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6"/>Sɛ yɛpɛ o, sɛ yɛmpɛ o, yɛbɛyɛ osetie ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn a yɛresoma wo wɔ ne nkyɛn no, sɛnea ebesi yɛn yiye, na yebedi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn asɛm so.”<verse eid="JER 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7"/>Nna du akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia hɔ. <verse eid="JER 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8"/>Enti ɔfrɛɛ Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo a wɔka ne ho ne nnipa no nyinaa; efi akumaa so kosi ɔkɛse so. <verse eid="JER 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn a mosomaa me sɛ memfa mo adesrɛ nkɔto nʼanim no se: <verse eid="JER 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10"/>‘Sɛ motena asase yi so a, mesiesie mo na merensɛe mo, medua mo na merentu mo ase, efisɛ me werɛ ahow wɔ amanehunu a mama aba mo so no ho. <verse eid="JER 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11"/>Munnsuro Babiloniahene a mprempren musuro no no. Munnsuro no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, efisɛ mene mo wɔ hɔ, megye mo, na mayi mo afi ne tumi ase. <verse eid="JER 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12"/>Mehu mo mmɔbɔ na ɔno nso ahu mo mmɔbɔ na ɔde mo asan aba mo asase so.’<verse eid="JER 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13"/>“Nanso sɛ moka se, ‘Yɛrentena saa asase yi so,’ na ne saa nti moanyɛ osetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn, <verse eid="JER 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14"/>na sɛ moka se, ‘Dabi, yɛbɛkɔ akɔtena Misraim, faako a yɛrenhu ɔko, na yɛrente akobɛn nnyigyei na aduankɔm renne yɛn a,’ <verse eid="JER 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15"/>ɛno de tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yuda nkae. Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se, ‘Sɛ moawe ahinam sɛ mobɛkɔ akɔtena Misraim, na sɛ munya kɔtena hɔ a, <verse eid="JER 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16"/>ɛno de afoa a musuro no bɛto mo wɔ hɔ na ɔkɔm a, mo koma tu wɔ ho no bedi mo akyi akɔ Misraim na hɔ na mubewuwu. <verse eid="JER 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17"/>Nokware wɔn a wɔasi wɔn adwene pi sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Misraim akɔtena hɔ no bewuwu wɔ afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano, na wɔn mu baako po renka anaa ɔrenguan mfi amanehunu a mede bɛba wɔn so no mu.’ <verse eid="JER 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se, ‘Sɛnea mʼabufuw ne mʼabufuwhyew hwie guu nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem so no, saa ara na sɛ, mokɔ Misraim a, mʼabufuwhyew behwie agu mo so. Mobɛyɛ nnome, ahodwiriwde, afɔbu ne ahohora; morenhu saa beae yi bio.’<verse eid="JER 42:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19"/>“Yuda nkae, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ mo se, ‘Monnkɔ Misraim.’ Mommma mo werɛ mmfi, nnɛ merebɔ mo kɔkɔ <verse eid="JER 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20"/>sɛ moyɛɛ mfomso a ɛyɛ hu yiye, bere a mosomaa me kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn hɔ, na mokae se, ‘Bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn mpae ma yɛn, na ka nea ɔka biara kyerɛ yɛn na yɛbɛyɛ,’ no. <verse eid="JER 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21"/>Nnɛ, maka akyerɛ mo, nanso monyɛɛ osetie mmaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn ara wɔ biribiara a ɔhyɛɛ me sɛ menka nkyerɛ mo no ho. <verse eid="JER 42:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22"/>Enti afei mommma mo werɛ mfi sɛ, mubewuwu wɔ afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano wɔ faako a mopɛ sɛ mokɔtena hɔ no.”<verse eid="JER 42:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1"/>Bere a Yeremia wiee nsɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Nyankopɔn nkyɛn no ka no, biribiara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma no sɛ ɔmmɛka nkyerɛ wɔn no, <verse eid="JER 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2"/>Hosaia babarima Asaria, Karea babarima Yohanan ne mmarima ahomasofo no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, “Woredi atoro! <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, nsomaa wo se bɛka se, ‘Ɛnsɛ sɛ mokɔ Misraim kɔtena hɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3"/>Na mmom Neria babarima Baruk na ɔregyigye wo so tia yɛn ama wɔde yɛn ahyɛ Babiloniafo nsa, sɛnea wobekum yɛn anaa wɔbɛsoa yɛn de yɛn akɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia.”<verse eid="JER 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4"/>Enti Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo no nyinaa ne nnipa no anni <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛ a ɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔntena Yuda asase so no so. <verse eid="JER 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5"/>Mmom Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafo mpanyimfo no nyinaa de Yuda nkae a wofi amanaman a wɔbɔɔ wɔn ahwete kɔɔ so no so na wɔaba sɛ wɔrebɛtena Yuda asase so no nyinaa kɔe. <verse eid="JER 43:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6"/>Wɔde mmarima, mmea, mmofra ne ɔhene mmabea a ɔsahene Nebusaradan, a ɔyɛ ɔhene awɛmfo panyin no, de wɔn gyaw Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nena, odiyifo Yeremia ne Neria babarima Baruk nso kɔe. <verse eid="JER 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7"/>Enti wɔhyɛn Misraim a wɔanni <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm so, na wokoduu Tapanhes.<verse eid="JER 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn wɔ Tapanhes se, <verse eid="JER 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9"/>“Bere a Yudafo no rehwɛ no, fa abo akɛse, afei tutu fam wɔ birikisi nsɛwee a ɛwɔ Farao ahemfi a ɛwɔ Tapanhes abobow ano hɔ, na fa gu mu kata so. <verse eid="JER 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10"/>Afei ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se: Mɛsoma me somfo Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, na mede nʼahengua besi saa abo a masi wɔ ha no so; na ɔbɛtrɛw nʼadehye kyinii mu wɔ so. <verse eid="JER 43:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11"/>Ɔbɛba abɛtow ahyɛ Misraim so, na obekum wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wonkum wɔn no, ɔbɛfa wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔnkɔ nnommum mu no nnommum, na wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔmfa wɔn mma afoa no, wɔde wɔn bɛma afoa. <verse eid="JER 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12"/>Ɔbɛto Misraim anyame asɔredan mu gya, ahyew na wɔafa wɔn anyame no nnommum. Sɛnea oguanhwɛfo de nʼatade kyekyere ne ho no, saa ara na ɔde Misraim bɛkyekyere ne ho na wafi hɔ akɔ a ne ho baabiara renti. <verse eid="JER 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13"/>Owia asɔredan a ɛwɔ Misraim no, obebubu nʼafadum kronkron no, na wahyew Misraim anyame asɔredan no dwerɛbee.’ ”<verse eid="JER 43:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Abosonsom Mu Amanehunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1"/>Saa asɛm yi baa Yeremia nkyɛn; ɛfa Yudafo a wɔtete Misraim anafo fam wɔ Migdol, Tapanhes, Memfis ne Misraim atifi fam no ho. <verse eid="JER 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: Muhuu amanehunu kɛse a mede baa Yerusalem ne Yuda nkurow nyinaa so no. Nnɛ wɔayeyɛ amamfo na wɔasɛesɛe <verse eid="JER 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3"/>esiane bɔne a wɔayɛ no nti. Wɔhyew nnuhuam, som anyame foforo a, wɔn anaa mo anaa mo agyanom nnim wɔn de hyɛɛ me abufuw. <verse eid="JER 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4"/>Mesomaa mʼasomfo adiyifo mpɛn pii a wɔkae se, ‘Monnyɛ saa atantanne a mikyi no!’ <verse eid="JER 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5"/>Nanso wɔantie, wɔamfa anyɛ asɛm, na wɔannan amfi wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm no ho na wɔannyae hyew a wɔhyew nnuhuam ma anyame foforo no. <verse eid="JER 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6"/>Enti mihwiee mʼabufuw gui, na ɛdɛw kɔɔ Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so ma ɛsɛesɛe na ɛdedaa mpan sɛnea ɛtete nnɛ yi.<verse eid="JER 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7"/>“Na mprempren, nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn, Israel Nyankopɔn se ni: Adɛn nti na mode amanehunu kɛse aba mo ho so, sɛ muyii mmarima ne mmea, mmofra ne mmotafowa fii Yuda a moannyaw nkae biara amma mo ho. <verse eid="JER 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8"/>Adɛn nti na mode nea mo nsa ayɛ hyɛ me abufuw, na mohyew nnuhuam ma anyame foforo wɔ Misraim, baabi a moabɛtena hɔ no? Mobɛsɛe mo ho, na moayɛ nnome ne nsopa wɔ asase so amanaman nyinaa mu. <verse eid="JER 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9"/>Mo werɛ afi amumɔyɛsɛm a mo agyanom, Yuda ahemfo ne ahemmea yɛe, na mo ne mo yerenom nso yɛɛ wɔ Yuda asase ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so no ana? <verse eid="JER 44:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10"/>Ebesi nnɛ yi, wɔmmrɛɛ wɔn ho ase, wɔnnaa nidi adi na wonnii me mmara ne ahyɛde a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom no so.<verse eid="JER 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11"/>“Enti nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se ni: Masi mʼadwene pi sɛ mede amanehunu bɛba mo so na masɛe Yuda nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12"/>Mɛfa Yuda nkae a wosii wɔn adwene pi sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Misraim akɔtena hɔ no. Wɔn nyinaa bewuwu wɔ Misraim; wɔbɛtotɔ wɔ afoa ano anaa ɔkɔm bekum wɔn. Efi akumaa so kosi ɔkɛse so, afoa ne ɔkɔm bekunkum wɔn. Wɔbɛyɛ nnome, ahodwiriwde, afɔbude ne ahohora. <verse eid="JER 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13"/>Mede afoa, ɔkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛtwe wɔn a wɔtete Misraim no aso, sɛnea metwee Yerusalem aso no. <verse eid="JER 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14"/>Yuda nkae a wɔakɔtena Misraim no mu biara renguan, na wɔremfa wɔn ho nni na wɔasan aba Yuda, asase a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔsan bɛtena so no so; wɔn mu biara remma, gye aguanfo kakraa bi.”<verse eid="JER 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15"/>Afei mmarima a na wonim sɛ wɔn yerenom hyew nnuhuam ma anyame foforo, wɔne mmea a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa, nnipadɔm no, ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Misraim Atifi fam ne Anafo fam ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia se, <verse eid="JER 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16"/>“Yɛrentie asɛm a waka akyerɛ yɛn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu no! <verse eid="JER 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17"/>Ampa ara yɛbɛyɛ biribiara a yɛkae se yɛbɛyɛ: Yɛbɛhyew nnuhuam ama Ɔsoro Hemmea na yɛahwie ahwiesa ama no, sɛnea yɛne yɛn agyanom, ahemfo ne adwumayɛfo yɛɛ wɔ Yuda nkurow ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so no pɛpɛɛpɛ. Saa bere no na yɛwɔ aduan, na yedi yiye a yenni ɔhaw biara nso. <verse eid="JER 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18"/>Nanso efi bere a yegyaee nnuhuam a yɛhyew ma Ɔsoro Hemmea, na yegyaee ahwiesa a yɛde ma no no, biribiara abɔ yɛn na yɛrewuwu wɔ afoa ne ɔkɔm ano.”<verse eid="JER 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19"/>Na mmea no ka kaa ho se, “Bere a yɛhyew nnuhuam maa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mmea—Esiane sɛ na Ɔsoro Hemmea no yɛ Babilonia bosom a ɔma awo no nti, na mmea di ne som no mu akoten.</char></note> Ɔsoro Hemmea, na yehwiee ahwiesa maa no no, na yɛn kununom nnim sɛ yɛto ɔfam a ɛyɛ ne sɛso, hwie ahwiesa ma no ana?”<verse eid="JER 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20"/>Na Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa; mmarima ne mmea a wɔrebua no no se, <verse eid="JER 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21"/>“Mususuw sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnim sɛ, na mo ne mo agyanom, mo ahemfo, adwumayɛfo ne ɔmanfo no hyew nnuhuam ma ahoni wɔ Yuda nkurow so ne Yerusalem mmɔnten so ana? <verse eid="JER 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22"/>Bere a mo amumɔyɛ ne akyiwade a moyɛɛ no fonoo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, mo asase dannan nnomede ne amamfo a obiara nte so, sɛnea ɛte nnɛ yi. <verse eid="JER 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23"/>Esiane sɛ moahyew nnuhuam, ayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na moanyɛ osetie amma no, na moanni ne mmara, nʼahyɛde ne nʼadansesɛm so nti, amanehunu aba mo so sɛnea muhu yi.”<verse eid="JER 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24"/>Afei Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa a mmea no ka ho se, “Mo Yudafo a mowɔ Misraim nyinaa muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm. <verse eid="JER 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se: Mo ne mo yerenom de mo nneyɛe akyerɛ mo bɔ a mohyɛe se, ‘Ampa ara yebedi bɔ a yɛhyɛe sɛ, yɛbɛhyew nnuhuam ahwie ahwiesa ama Ɔsoro Hemmea no,’ no so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">Monkɔ so, munni mo bɔhyɛ ne mo ntam so! <verse eid="JER 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26"/>Nanso muntie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yudafo a mowɔ Misraim nyinaa. Mede me din kɛse no ka ntam se, nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, obiara a ofi Yuda a ɔte Misraim asase so baabiara remmɔ me din nka ntam bio da se, “Sɛ Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi.” <verse eid="JER 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27"/>Na mɛhwɛ ama wɔahu amane na ɛnyɛ yiyedi; Yudafo a wɔwɔ Misraim bewuwu wɔ afoa ne ɔkɔm ano kosi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28"/>Wɔn a wobeguan afi afoa ano na wɔasan afi Misraim akɔ Yuda asase so no bɛyɛ kakraa bi. Afei Yuda nkae a wɔbɛtenaa Misraim no nyinaa behu nea nʼasɛm yɛ nokware; me de anaa wɔn de.<verse eid="JER 44:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29"/>“ ‘Eyi na ɛbɛyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne ama mo sɛ mɛtwe mo aso wɔ ha, na moahu sɛ ampa ara mʼahunahuna a ɛfa ɔhaw ho no bɛba mu,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose. <verse eid="JER 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30"/>‘Mede Misraimhene Farao Hofra rebɛhyɛ nʼatamfo a wɔpɛ sɛ wokum no no nsa, sɛnea mede Yudahene Sedekia hyɛɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, ne tamfo a na ɔrehwehwɛ no akum no no nsa. Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.’ ”<verse eid="JER 44:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Wɔde Ma Baruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1"/>Eyi ne nsɛm a odiyifo Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Neria babarima Baruk wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedi afe a ɛto so anan no mu, bere a na Baruk akyerɛw nsɛm a efi Yeremia anom no agu nhoma mmobɔwee bi mu. <verse eid="JER 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2"/>“Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛ wo, Baruk: <verse eid="JER 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3"/>Wokae se, ‘Nnome nka me! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de awerɛhow aka me yawdi ho; apinisi ne ɔbrɛ ama mʼahoɔden asa.’  <verse eid="JER 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae se, ‘Ka eyi kyerɛ no: Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Mɛsɛe nea makyekyere na matu nea madua no ase wɔ asase no so nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5"/>Enti ɛsɛ sɛ wopɛ nneɛma akɛse ma wo ho ana? Nyɛ saa. Efisɛ mede amanehunu bɛba nnipa nyinaa so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, nanso baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛbɔ wo ho ban.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Misraim Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1"/>Eyi ne asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa odiyifo Yeremia hɔ a ɛfa aman no ho.<verse eid="JER 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2"/>Nea ɛfa Misraim ho:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 46:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 46:2">Eyi ne nsɛm a etia Misraimhene Farao Neko asraafo a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar dii wɔn so nkonim wɔ Karkemis, Asubɔnten Eufrate ho wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedi afe a ɛto so anan no:<verse eid="JER 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3"/>“Siesie wo nkatabo akɛse ne nketewa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">na muntu santen nkɔ ɔsa!<verse eid="JER 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4"/>Munsiesie apɔnkɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">na momforo ntenatena wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Munnyinagyina mo afa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">a mohyehyɛ mo nnade kyɛw!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Monsew mo mpeaw ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">na monhyɛ mo nkatabo.<verse eid="JER 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5"/>Dɛn na mihu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Wɔabɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">wɔresan wɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">wɔn dɔmmarima adi nkogu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Woguan ntɛm so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">a wɔnhwɛ wɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">na ehu wɔ baabiara,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6"/>Ɔhoɔharefo ntumi nguan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">na ɔhoɔdenfo nso saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Atifi fam wɔ Asubɔnten Eufrate ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">wohintihintiw na wɔhwehwe ase.<verse eid="JER 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7"/>“Hena, na ɔma ne homene so sɛ Asubɔnten Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">sɛ nsubɔnten a mu nsu woro yi?<verse eid="JER 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8"/>Misraim ma ne homene so sɛ Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">sɛ nsubɔnten a mu nsu woro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Ɔka se, ‘Mɛsɔre akata asase no so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">mɛsɛe nkuropɔn ne mu nnipa.’<verse eid="JER 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9"/>Monkɔ mo anim, apɔnkɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Monka wɔn anibere so, mo nteaseɛnamkafo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Muntu nteɛ, dɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Kus ne Put mmarima a mukura nkatabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Lidia mmarima a motow agyan.<verse eid="JER 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10"/>Nanso da no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">aweretɔda, nʼatamfo so aweretɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Afoa bekunkum akosi sɛ ɔbɛmee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">akosi bere a ɔde mogya bedwudwo ne osukɔm ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Efisɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ afɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">wɔ atifi fam asase a ɛwɔ Asubɔnten Eufrate ho no so.<verse eid="JER 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11"/>“Foro kɔ Gilead kogye aduru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">Misraim Babea Ɔbabun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Nanso nnuru bebrebe a wofa no yɛ ɔkwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">ayaresa biara nni hɔ ma wo.<verse eid="JER 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12"/>Amanaman no bɛte wʼanimguase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">wʼagyaadwo bɛhyɛ asase so ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Ɔkofo baako behintiw afa ɔfoforo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">na wɔn baanu bɛbɔ mu ahwe ase.”<verse eid="JER 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13"/>Eyi ne asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ odiyifo Yeremia a ɛfa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ba a ɔbɛba abɛtow ahyɛ Misraim so:<verse eid="JER 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14"/>“Mommɔ eyi ho dawuru wɔ Misraim, na mompae mu nka wɔ Migdol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">monka wɔ Memfis ne Tapanhes nso se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Munnyinagyina na monyɛ krado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">efisɛ, afoa rekunkum wɔn a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia.’<verse eid="JER 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15"/>Adɛn nti na mo dɔmmarima bɛbotow sɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Wɔrentumi nnyina, efisɛ, Awurade bɛbɔ wɔn ahwe fam.<verse eid="JER 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16"/>Wobehintihintiw atoatoa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">wɔbɛhwehwe ase adeda wɔn ho wɔn ho so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Wɔbɛka se, ‘Monsɔre, momma yɛnkɔ yɛn nkyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">nkɔ yɛn nkurɔfo nkyɛn ne faako a wɔwoo yɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">na yemfi nhyɛsofo no afoa ano.’<verse eid="JER 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔbɛteɛ mu se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">‘Misraimhene Farao tu ne ho kwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">nʼakwannya a ɔwɔ no atwa mu.’<verse eid="JER 46:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18"/>“Ampa ara sɛ mete ase yi” Ɔhene a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Ɔbaako bɛba a ɔte sɛ Tabor wɔ mmepɔw no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">sɛ Karmel wɔ mpoano.<verse eid="JER 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19"/>Mommoaboa mo nneɛma ano ntwɛn nnommumfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">mo a motete Misraim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">efisɛ wɔbɛsɛe Memfis kurow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">na ɛbɛda mpan a obiara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 46:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20"/>“Misraim yɛ nantwi ba bere a ne ho yɛ fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">nanso ɔtɛn bi fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">atifi fam reba ne so.<verse eid="JER 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21"/>Asraafo apaafo a wɔwɔ wɔn mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">te sɛ nantwimma a wɔadodɔ srade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Wɔn nso bɛdan wɔn ho abɔ mu aguan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">wɔrentumi nnyina wɔn anan so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">efisɛ amanehunu da no reba wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">bere a wɔde bɛtwe wɔn aso no.<verse eid="JER 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22"/>Misraim bɛteɛ mu sɛ ɔwɔ a ɔreguan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">bere a ɔtamfo de ahoɔden reba ne so no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">wɔde mmonnua bɛba ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">te sɛ, mmarima a wobu nnua.<verse eid="JER 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23"/>Wɔbɛsɛe ne kwae,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">“sɛnea ayɛ kusuu yi mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Wɔdɔɔso bebree sen mmoadabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">na wɔrentumi nkan wɔn.<verse eid="JER 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24"/>Wobegu Misraim Babea anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">wɔde no bɛhyɛ atifi fam nnipa no nsa.”<verse eid="JER 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, ka se, “Mede asotwe reba Tebes nyame Amon, Farao, Misraim ne nʼanyame ne nʼahemfo ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho to Farao so no so. <verse eid="JER 46:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26"/>Mede wɔn bɛhyɛ wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wokum wɔn no, Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼadwumayɛfo no nsa. Nanso akyiri no, nnipa bɛtena Misraim asase so te sɛ kan no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 46:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27"/>“Nsuro, Yakob me somfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">nni yaw, Israel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Ampa ara megye wo afi beae a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ne wʼasefo afi wɔn nnommumfa asase so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yakob bɛsan anya asomdwoe ne bammɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">na obiara renhunahuna no.<verse eid="JER 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28"/>Nsuro, Yakob me somfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">na me ne wo wɔ hɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“Ɛwɔ mu, mesɛe aman no nyinaa koraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">aman a mehwetee mo kɔɔ so no de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">nanso merensɛe mo korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Mede trenee nko ara na ɛbɛteɛteɛ mo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">meremma mommfa mo ho nni a merentwe mo aso.”<verse eid="JER 46:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Filistifo Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1"/>Ansa na Farao bɛtow ahyɛ Gasa so no, eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛfa Filistifo ho a ɛbaa odiyifo Yeremia nkyɛn:<verse eid="JER 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Monhwɛ sɛnea nsu rebobɔ ba wɔ atifi fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">ɛbɛyɛ ɔhweam a abu afa so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Ebebu afa asase no ne biribiara ɛwɔ so no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">nkurow no ne nnipa a wɔtete mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Nnipa no bɛteɛteɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">wɔn a wɔte asase no so nyinaa betwa adwo<verse eid="JER 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3"/>bere a wɔate apɔnkɔ a wotu mmirika no anan ase nnyigyei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">na wɔate atamfo no nteaseɛnam gyegyeegye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ne wɔn ntwahonan nnyigyei no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Agyanom rentwa wɔn ani nhwɛ wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">wɔn nsa bɛsensɛn wɔn ho kwa.<verse eid="JER 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4"/>Na da no aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">sɛ wɔsɛe Filistifo no nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">na wotwa wɔn a wɔaka no nyinaa gu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">wɔn a anka wotumi boa Tiro ne Sidon no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> rebɛsɛe Filistifo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">nkae a wofi Kreta mpoano no.<verse eid="JER 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5"/>Gasa bɛbɔ tikwaw bere a ɔretwa adwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">wɔbɛma Askelon atɔ mum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Mo nkae a mowɔ tataw so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">mobɛbobɔ mo ho akam akosi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6"/>“ ‘Aa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afoa,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">‘da bɛn na wobɛhome?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">San kɔhyɛ wo boha mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">gyae na da komm.’<verse eid="JER 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ada komm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">bere a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">bere a wahyɛ no se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">ɔnkɔtow nhyɛ Askelon ne mpoano asase no so?”<verse eid="JER 47:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Moab Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1"/>Nea ɛfa Moab ho:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:1">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Nebo nnue, na wɔbɛsɛe no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Wobegu Kiriataim anim ase, na wɔafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">wobegu aban dennen no anim ase, na wɔadwiriw agu fam.<verse eid="JER 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2"/>Wɔrenkamfo Moab bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">Hesbon mmarima bɛbɔ nʼasehwe ho pɔw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">‘Mommra, momma yɛnkɔbɔ saa ɔman yi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Mo nso, Madmen mmarima mobɛka mo ano ato mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">afoa no bɛtaa mo.<verse eid="JER 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3"/>Muntie osu a efi Horonaim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">adesɛe ne ɔsɛe ho su.<verse eid="JER 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4"/>Wɔbɛbɔ Moab:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">na ne mma nketewa bɛteɛteɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5"/>Wɔforo kɔ Luhit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">wɔde agyaadwotwa a mu yɛ den na ɛrekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">ɔkwan a ɛkɔ Horonaim so no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">wɔte ahoyeraw nteɛteɛmu wɔ adesɛe no ho.<verse eid="JER 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6"/>Munguan! muntu mmirika mpere mo nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">Monyɛ sɛ wura wɔ nweatam so.<verse eid="JER 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7"/>Esiane sɛ mode mo ho to mo nneyɛe ne mo ahonya so nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">mo nso wɔbɛfa mo nnommum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">na Kemos bɛkɔ nnommum mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">ɔne nʼasɔfo ne adwumayɛfo.<verse eid="JER 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8"/>Ɔsɛefo no betu kurow biara so sa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">na mu biara rennya ne ho ntetew.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Wɔbɛsɛe obon no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">na wasɛe mmepɔw mpampam a ɛyɛ tamaa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akasa.<verse eid="JER 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9"/>Momfa nkyene nhyɛ Moab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">efisɛ wɔrebɛsɛe no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">ne nkurow bɛda mpan a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">obiara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10"/>“Nnome nka nea ɔtwentwɛn ne nan ase wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adwumayɛ ho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">Nnome nka nea ɔmmfa nʼafoa nhwie mogya ngu!<verse eid="JER 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11"/>“Moab atena ase asomdwoe mu fi ne mmerantebere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">te sɛ nsa ase puw a ataa dinn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">wonnhwie mfi ahina mu nkogu ahina foforo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">ɔnkɔɔ nnommum mu da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Enti ɔte sɛ nea ɔte ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">na ne ho hua nsakrae ɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12"/>Nanso nna bi reba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">“a mɛsoma mmarima a wohwie fi ahina mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">na wobehwie no agu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">wɔbɛma nʼahina mu ayɛ hwee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">na wɔabobɔ ne nkuruwa.<verse eid="JER 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13"/>Afei Kemos ho bɛyɛ Moab aniwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">sɛnea Israelfi anim guu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">bere a wɔde wɔn ho too Bet-El so no.<verse eid="JER 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14"/>“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wutumi ka se, ‘Yɛyɛ dɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">mmarima akokodurufo wɔ ɔsa mu’?<verse eid="JER 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15"/>Wɔbɛsɛe Moab na wɔatu ne nkurow so sa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">wobekunkum ne mmerante a wɔte apɔw no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">nea Ɔhene a wɔfrɛ no Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no se ni.<verse eid="JER 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16"/>“Moab asehwe abɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">nʼamanehunu bɛba ntɛm.<verse eid="JER 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17"/>Munsu no, mo a motete ne ho nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">ne mo a munim ne din nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">monka se, ‘Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wɔabubu ahempema a ɛyɛ den yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">ɛyɛɛ dɛn wɔabu anuonyam pema fɛfɛ yi mu!’<verse eid="JER 48:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18"/>“Fi wʼanuonyam mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">na bɛtena asase wosee no so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">wo a wote Dibon Babea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">efisɛ nea ɔsɛe Moab no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">betu aba wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">abɛsɛe wo nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ bammɔ no.<verse eid="JER 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19"/>Gyina kwankyɛn na hwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">wo a wote Aroer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Bisa ɔbarima a ɔreguan no ne ɔbea a ɔrefi mu afi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">bisa wɔn se, ‘Asɛm bɛn na asi?’<verse eid="JER 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20"/>Moab anim agu ase, efisɛ wɔabubu no pasaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">muntwa adwo na monteɛteɛ mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Mommɔ dawuru wɔ Arnon ho se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">wɔasɛe Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21"/>Atemmu aba bepɔw tamaa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:21">wɔ Holon, Yahas ne Mefaat,<verse eid="JER 48:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22"/>Dibon ne Nebo ne Bet-Diblataim<verse eid="JER 48:22"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23"/>ne Kiriataim ne Bet Gamul ne Bet Meon<verse eid="JER 48:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24"/>ne Keriot ne Bosra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:24">wɔ Moab nkurow nyinaa, nea ɛwɔ akyirikyiri ne nea ɛbɛn.<verse eid="JER 48:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25"/>Wɔatwa Moab mmɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">na ne basa abu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 48:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26"/>“Momma no mmow nsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">efisɛ wabu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtiaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Momma Moab nyantam wɔ ne fe mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">momma no nyɛ nea wodi ne ho fɛw.<verse eid="JER 48:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27"/>Ɛnyɛ Israel na na wudi ne ho fɛw?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">Wɔkyeree no akorɔmfo mu ana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">a enti mowosow mo ti animtiaabu so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">bere biara a mobɛka ne ho asɛm?<verse eid="JER 48:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28"/>Mumfifi mo nkurow so nkɔtena abotan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">mo a motete Moab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Monyɛ sɛ aborɔnoma a ɔyɛ ne berebuw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">wɔ ɔbodan ano.<verse eid="JER 48:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29"/>“Yɛate Moab ahantan no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">nʼahomaso ne gye a ogye ne ho di mmoroso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">nʼahantan ne nʼahomaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ne ne koma mu ahohoahoa.<verse eid="JER 48:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30"/>Minim nʼasoɔden nanso ɛyɛ ɔkwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">“na nʼahohoahoa mfa hwee mma.<verse eid="JER 48:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31"/>Enti mitwa adwo ma Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">misu teɛ mu ma Moabfo nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">midi awerɛhow ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Kir Hereset.<verse eid="JER 48:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32"/>Misu ma mo sɛnea Yaser su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">mo Sibma bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Mo mman dennan kɔɔ po ho pɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">koduu Yaser po ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Ɔsɛefo no abegu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">mo nnuaba a abere ne mo bobe no so.<verse eid="JER 48:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33"/>Ahosɛpɛw ne anigye atu afi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">Moab nnuaba nturo ne mfuw so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Matwa nsa a ɛteɛ fi nsakyiamoa no so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">obiara mmfa ahosɛpɛw ntiatia bobe no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Ɛwɔ mu nteɛteɛmu wɔ hɔ de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">nanso ɛnyɛ ahosɛpɛw nteɛteɛmu.<verse eid="JER 48:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34"/>“Wɔn su ano den gyigye fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">Hesbon kɔ Eleale ne Yahas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">fi Soar de kosi Horonaim ne Eglat Selisiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">mpo, nsu a ɛwɔ Nimrim no ayow.<verse eid="JER 48:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35"/>Moab mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">mede sorɔnsorɔmmea afɔrebɔ ne nnuhuam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:35">a wɔhyew ma wɔn anyame no, bɛba awiei,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ose.<verse eid="JER 48:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36"/>“Enti me koma su sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma Moab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">esu sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Kir Hereset.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">Ahonyade a wɔpɛe no kɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37"/>Wɔabɔ eti biara tikwaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">na wɔayi abogyesɛ biara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">nsa nyinaa ho ayɛ akamakam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">na atweaatam sisi obiara asen.<verse eid="JER 48:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38"/>Adan a ɛwɔ Moab nyinaa atifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ne ɔmanfo aguabɔbea nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">biribiara nni hɔ sɛ awerɛhow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">efisɛ mabubu Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ayɛ no sɛ ahina a obiara mpɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 48:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39"/>“Hwɛ sɛnea wabubu afa! Hwɛ sɛnea wɔretwa adwo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">Na hwɛ sɛnea Moab de aniwu dan nʼakyi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Moab ayɛ nea wodi ne ho fɛw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">ne ahodwiriwde ama wɔn a wɔatwa ne ho ahyia nyinaa.”<verse eid="JER 48:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">“Monhwɛ! ɔkɔre rebɔ hoo aba fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">Watrɛw ne ntaban mu wɔ Moab so.<verse eid="JER 48:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41"/>Wɔbɛfa Keriot nnommum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">na wɔafa nʼabandennen no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Saa da no Moab dɔmmarima koma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">betu sɛ ɔbea a ɔrekyem wɔ awo so.<verse eid="JER 48:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42"/>Wɔbɛsɛe Moab na ɛrenyɛ ɔman bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">efisɛ obuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtiaa.<verse eid="JER 48:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43"/>Ehu, nkonomoa ne afiri retwɛn mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">Moabfo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 48:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44"/>“Nea oguan nea ɛyɛ hu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">bɛtɔ nkonomoa mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">nea ɔbɛforo afi nkonomoa no mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">afide beyi no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">na mede Moab asotwe afe no bɛba ne so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 48:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45"/>“Hesbon nwini ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">na aguanfo no gyinagyina a wonni mmoa biara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">efisɛ ogya bi atu afi Hesbon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ogyaframa bi fi Sihon mfimfini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">ɛhyew Moab moma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ne ahohoahoafo a wɔn ano yɛ den no ti koraa.<verse eid="JER 48:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46"/>Nnome nka wo, wo Moab!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Wɔasɛe Kemos nkurɔfo no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">wɔde wo mmabarima kɔ nnommum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">na wo mmabea nso kɔ nkoasom mu.<verse eid="JER 48:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47"/>“Nanso mede Moab adenya bɛsan ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">wɔ nna a ɛbɛba no mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Moab atemmu no awiei ni.<verse eid="JER 48:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Amon Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1"/>Nea ɛfa Amonfo ho:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:1">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Israel nni mmabarima ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Onni wɔn a wobedi nʼade?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Ɛno de adɛn nti na Molek afa Gad ayɛ ne de yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Adɛn nti na ne nkurɔfo tete ne nkurow mu?<verse eid="JER 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2"/>Nanso nna no reba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">“Bere a mɛbobɔ mu de afrɛ ɔko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">atia Raba a ɛyɛ Amonfo de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">ɛbɛyɛ afabo siw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">wɔbɛto nkuraa a atwa ne ho ahyia no mu gya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Na Israel bɛpam wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">wɔpam no no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.<verse eid="JER 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3"/>“Twa adwo. Hesbon, efisɛ wɔasɛe Ai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Monteɛ mu, mo a mowɔ Raba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Mumfura ayitam na munni awerɛhow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">mommɔ nnyenyen wɔ afasu no mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">efisɛ Molek bɛkɔ nnommum mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">ɔne nʼasɔfo ne nʼadwumayɛfo.<verse eid="JER 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4"/>Adɛn nti na wode wʼabon ahorow no hoahoa wo ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">wʼabon a wunya mu aba bebree no nti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Amon Babea a Onni nokware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">wode wo ho to wʼahonya so na woka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Hena na ɔbɛtow ahyɛ me so?’<verse eid="JER 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5"/>Mede ehu bɛba wo so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">ebefi wɔn a wɔatwa wo ho ahyia no nyinaa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">“Wɔbɛpam mo nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">na obiara remmoaboa akobɔfo ano.<verse eid="JER 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6"/>“Nanso akyiri no, mɛsan de Amonfo adenya ama wɔn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:6">sɛe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.<verse eid="JER 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Edom Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7"/>Nea ɛfa Edom ho:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:7"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:7">Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Nyansa nni Teman bio ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Afotu ayera wɔ anyansafo mu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Wɔn nyansa no aporɔw ana?<verse eid="JER 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8"/>Monnan mo ho na munguan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">monkɔtetɛw abodan a mu dɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">mo a motete Dedan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">efisɛ mede amanehunu bɛba Esau so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">wɔ bere a mɛtwe nʼaso no.<verse eid="JER 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9"/>Sɛ bobetetewfo no baa mo nkyɛn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">anka wɔrennya bobe no kakra ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Sɛ akorɔmfo baa ɔdasu mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">anka wɔrenwia ade dodow a wɔpɛ ana?<verse eid="JER 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10"/>Na mɛma Esau ada adagyaw.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">Mɛda ne hintabea ahorow adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">sɛnea ɔrentumi mfa ne ho nhintaw.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Ne mma, nʼabusuafo ne ne mfɛfo bewuwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">na wɔrenhu no bio.<verse eid="JER 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11"/>Munnyaw mo ayisaa, mɛbɔ wɔn nkwa ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">Mo akunafo nso betumi de wɔn ho ato me so.”<verse eid="JER 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔmfata sɛ wɔnom kuruwa no nom a, ɛno de adɛn nti na ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔtwe mo aso? Wɔbɛtwe mo aso na mobɛnom nso. <verse eid="JER 49:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13"/>Meka me ho ntam sɛ wɔbɛsɛe Bosra na ayɛ ahodwiriwde, ahohorade ne nnome; na ne nkurow nyinaa bɛsɛe afebɔɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14"/>Mate asɛm a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">wɔsomaa ananmusini bi sɛ ɔnkɔka nkyerɛ amanaman no se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">“Mommoaboa mo ho ano nkɔtow nhyɛ no so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Monsɔre nkɔ ɔko!”<verse eid="JER 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15"/>“Na mɛyɛ wo ketewa wɔ aman no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">na wɔabu wo animtiaa.<verse eid="JER 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16"/>Ehu a wobɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ne koma mu ahomaso adaadaa wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">wo a wote abotan ntokuru mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">na wote koko no sorɔnsorɔmmea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Ɛwɔ mu, woyɛ wo berebuw wɔ sorosoro sɛ ɔkɔre de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">nanso hɔ na mefi de wo aba fam,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17"/>“Edom bɛyɛ ahodwiriwde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">wɔn a wotwa mu wɔ hɔ no nyinaa ho bedwiriw wɔn na wɔadi ne ho fɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">esiane nʼapirakuru nyinaa nti.<verse eid="JER 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18"/>Sɛnea wɔdan Sodom ne Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">ne wɔn nkurow gui no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">“saa ara na obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">onipa biara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19"/>“Sɛnea gyata a ofi Yordan nkyɛkyerɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">rekɔ adidibea frɔmfrɔm no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">saa ara na mɛtaa Edom afi nʼasase so wɔ bere tiaa bi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Hena ne nea mayi no sɛ ɔnyɛ eyi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Hena na ɔte sɛ me, na hena na obetumi ne me adi asi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Na oguanhwɛfo bɛn na obetumi asɔre atia me?”<verse eid="JER 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20"/>Enti tie nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyehyɛ atia Edom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">nea wabɔ ne tirim sɛ ɔbɛyɛ de atia wɔn a wɔte Teman ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Nguankuw no mu nkumaa no wɔbɛtwe wɔn akɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">wɔn nti ɔbɛsɛe adidibea no koraa.<verse eid="JER 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21"/>Wɔn asehwe nnyigyei bɛma asase awosow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:21">wɔn nteɛteɛmu gyegyeegye akodu Po Kɔkɔɔ ho.<verse eid="JER 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22"/>Monhwɛ! Ɔkɔre bi betu akɔ soro na wabɔ hoo aba fam a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">watrɛtrɛw ne ntaban mu wɔ Bosra so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">Saa da no Edom dɔmmarima koma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">betu sɛ ɔbea a ɔrekyem wɔ awo so.<verse eid="JER 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Damasko Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23"/>Nea ɛfa Damasko ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamat ne Arpad di yaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">efisɛ wɔate asɛmmɔne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Wɔn koma abotow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">te sɛ po a ayɛ hagyahagya.<verse eid="JER 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24"/>Damasko ayɛ mmerɛw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">wayɛ sɛ ɔrebeguan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">wabɔ huboa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">ahoyeraw ne ɔyaw akyekyere no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">ɔyaw a ɛte sɛ ɔbea a, ɔrekyem wɔ awo so.<verse eid="JER 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25"/>Adɛn nti na wonnyaw kuropɔn a agye din yi ntoo hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">kurow a mʼani gye mu?<verse eid="JER 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26"/>Ampa ara ne mmerante bɛtotɔ wɔ mmɔnten so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">wɔbɛma nʼasraafo nyinaa aka wɔn ano ato mu saa da no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se.<verse eid="JER 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27"/>“Mede ogya bɛto Damasko afasu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">na ɛbɛhyew Ben-Hadad aban.”<verse eid="JER 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Kedar Ne Hasor Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28"/>Nea ɛfa Kedar ne Hasor ahenni, a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar tow hyɛɛ so no.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Sɔre na kɔtow hyɛ Kedar so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">na sɛe nnipa a wɔwɔ apuei fam no.<verse eid="JER 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29"/>Wɔbɛfa wɔn ntamadan ne wɔn nguankuw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">wɔbɛfa wɔn nkataso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">ne wɔn ho nneɛma ne yoma akɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Nnipa bɛteɛteɛ mu se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">‘Ehu wɔ baabiara!’<verse eid="JER 49:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30"/>“Munguan nkɔ ntɛmntɛm!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">Monhyehyɛ abodan a mu dɔ mu, mo a motete Hasor,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">“Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar apam mo ti so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">wayɛ nhyehyɛe a etia mo.<verse eid="JER 49:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31"/>“Sɔre kɔtow hyɛ ɔman bi so a woremmrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">ɔman a wɔte ahotoso mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">“ɔman a wonni apon anaa akwanside;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">na emu nnipa nko ara na wɔte.<verse eid="JER 49:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32"/>Wɔn mfurum bɛyɛ asade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">na wɔn anantwikuw akɛse no bɛyɛ asade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Mɛbɔ saa nnipa a wɔtete akyirikyiri no ahwete ama mframa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">na mede amanehunu befi afa nyinaa aba wɔn so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33"/>“Hasor bɛyɛ ahade ama adompo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">ɛbɛda mpan afebɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">onipa biara rentena mu.”<verse eid="JER 49:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Elam Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34"/>Eyi ne asɛm a, efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa odiyifo Yeremia hɔ a ɛfa Elam ho, wɔ Yudahene Sedekia adedi mfiase: <verse eid="JER 49:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">“Hwɛ mebubu Elam agyan mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">nea wɔn ahoɔden gyina so no.<verse eid="JER 49:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36"/>Mede mframa anan no bɛba Elam so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">afi ɔsorosoro afanan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete mframa anan no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">na ɔman biara nni hɔ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">Elam atubrafo renkɔ so.<verse eid="JER 49:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37"/>Mɛbɔ Elam ahwete wɔ wɔn atamfo anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">wɔ wɔn a wɔrehwehwɛ wɔn akum wɔn no anim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">mpo mʼabufuwhyew no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">“Mede afoa bɛtaa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">kosi sɛ, mewie wɔn korakora.<verse eid="JER 49:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38"/>Mesi mʼahengua wɔ Elam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:38">na masɛe ne hene ne nʼadwumayɛfo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 49:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39"/>“Nanso mɛsan de Elam adenya ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">nna a ɛreba no mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 49:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Babilonia Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1"/>Asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam odiyifo Yeremia so ka faa Babilonia ne Babiloniafo asase ho ni:<verse eid="JER 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2"/>“Mommɔ no dawuru na mompae mu nka wɔ amanaman mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Momma frankaa so na mompae mu nka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na momma wɔnte sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">‘Wɔbɛfa Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">wobegu Bel anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na ehu bɛhyɛ Merodak ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Wobegu ne nsɛsode anim ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na ehu bɛhyɛ nʼahoni ma.’<verse eid="JER 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3"/>Ɔman bi fi atifi fam bɛtow ahyɛ ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">na wɔbɛyɛ nʼasase amamfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Obiara rentena so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">nnipa ne mmoa beguan afi so.<verse eid="JER 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4"/>“Nna no mu ne saa bere no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">“Israelfo ne Yudafo bɛka abɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">de nusu akɔhwehwɛ wɔn <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5"/>Wobebisa ɔkwan a ɛkɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">na wɔde wɔn ani akyerɛ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Wɔbɛba de wɔn ho abɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">wɔ daa apam a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">werɛ remfi mu.<verse eid="JER 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6"/>“Me nkurɔfo ayɛ nguan a wɔayera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">wɔn nguanhwɛfo ama wɔafom ɔkwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">ma wokyinkyin mmepɔw so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Wokyinkyin bepɔw ne koko so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">na wɔn werɛ fii wɔn ankasa homebea.<verse eid="JER 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7"/>Obiara a ohuu wɔn no tetew wɔn mu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">wɔn atamfo kae se, ‘Yenni fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">efisɛ wɔyɛɛ bɔne tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn nokware didibea no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn agyanom anidaso no.’<verse eid="JER 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8"/>“Munguan mfi Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">mumfi Babiloniafo asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">na monyɛ sɛ mpapo a wodi nguankuw anim.<verse eid="JER 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9"/>Mɛkanyan amanaman akɛse nkabom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">afi atifi fam asase so de wɔn abɛko atia Babilonia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Wobegyinagyina wɔn afa atia no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">wobefi atifi fam ako afa no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Wɔn agyan bɛyɛ sɛ dɔmmarima a wɔakwadaw akodi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">wɔn a wɔmmfa nsapan nsan wɔn akyi.<verse eid="JER 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10"/>Enti wɔbɛfow Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">wɔn a wɔfow no nyinaa benya asade bebree,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11"/>“Esiane sɛ mo ani gye na mudi ahurusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">mo a mofow mʼagyapade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">sɛ muhuruhuruw anigye so te sɛ nantwiforo a ɔwɔ sare frɔmfrɔm mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">na musu te sɛ apɔnkɔnini nti,<verse eid="JER 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12"/>wo na ani bewu pa ara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">nea ɔwoo wo anim begu ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Ɔbɛyɛ akumaa wɔ amanaman no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">sare, asase wosee ne nweatam.<verse eid="JER 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw nti, obiara rentena hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">na ɛbɛda mpan korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Wɔn a wotwa mu wɔ Babilonia nyinaa ho bedwiriw wɔn na wɔadi ne ho fɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">esiane nʼapirakuru nyinaa nti.<verse eid="JER 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14"/>“Munnyinagyina mo afa ntwa Babilonia ho nhyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">mo a motow agyan nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Montow no! Munnyaw bɛmma biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">efisɛ wayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15"/>Monteɛ mu ntia no wɔ afanan nyinaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">Ɔma ne nsa so, nʼabandennen bubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">wodwiriw nʼafasu gu fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Esiane sɛ eyi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aweretɔ no nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">montɔ ne so were;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">monyɛ no sɛnea wayɛ afoforo no.<verse eid="JER 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16"/>Munyi ogufo mfi Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">ɔne otwafo a okura ne kantankrankyi wɔ otwabere mu no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Esiane nhyɛsofo no afoa nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">obiara nsan nkɔ ne nkurɔfo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">obiara nguan nkɔ nʼankasa asase so.<verse eid="JER 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17"/>“Israel yɛ nguankuw a wɔahwete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">a gyata apam wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Nea odii kan tetew ne mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">yɛ Asiriahene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">na nea ɔdwerɛwee ne nnompe akyiri no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">yɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar.”<verse eid="JER 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18"/>Ɛno nti, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Mɛtwe Babiloniahene ne nʼasase aso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:18">sɛnea metwee Asiriahene aso no.<verse eid="JER 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19"/>Na mede Israel bɛsan aba nʼankasa didibea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">na obedidi wɔ Karmel ne Basan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">ɔbɛmee wɔ Efraim ne Gilead nkoko so.<verse eid="JER 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20"/>Saa nna no ne saa bere no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">“Wɔbɛhwehwɛ Israel afɔbu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">nanso wɔrennya bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">wɔbɛhwehwɛ Yuda nnebɔne mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">nanso wɔrenhu bi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">efisɛ, mede nkae a migyaa wɔn no bɔne bɛkyɛ wɔn.<verse eid="JER 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21"/>“Montow nhyɛ Merataim asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">ne nnipa a wɔte Pekod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Montaa wɔn, munkunkum wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">na monsɛe wɔn korakora,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">“Monyɛ biribiara a mahyɛ mo no.<verse eid="JER 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22"/>Ɔko mu gyegyeegye wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">ɔsɛe kɛse nnyigyei!<verse eid="JER 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23"/>Hwɛ sɛnea wɔabubu na wɔabobɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">asase nyinaa so asae!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Hwɛ sɛnea Babilonia ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">wɔ amanaman no mu!<verse eid="JER 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24"/>Misum wo afiri, Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">na eyii wo ansa na worehu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">wohuu wo kyeree wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">efisɛ woko tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25"/>Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abue nʼakode adekoradan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">na wayi nʼabufuwhyew akode de apue,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">efisɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ adwuma yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">wɔ Babiloniafo asase so.<verse eid="JER 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26"/>Mumfi akyirikyiri mmra ne so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Mummubu nʼasan no ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">monhɔre no siw sɛ awi akuwakuw.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Monsɛe no korakora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">na munnyaw nkae biara mma no.<verse eid="JER 50:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27"/>Munkunkum nʼanatwinini nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">momfa wɔn nkɔ mma wonkokum wɔn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Mmusu nka wɔn! Efisɛ wɔn da no adu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">bere a wɔde bɛtwe wɔn aso no.<verse eid="JER 50:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28"/>Muntie akobɔfo ne aguanfo a wofi Babilonia no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">sɛ wɔreka wɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn atɔ were,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">nʼasɔrefi ho aweretɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29"/>“Momfrɛ agyantowfo nkɔtoa Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">wɔn a wɔtow agyan nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Muntwa ne ho nhyia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">mommma obiara nguan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Muntua ne nneyɛe so ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">monyɛ no sɛnea wayɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Efisɛ wabu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">Israel kronkronni no.<verse eid="JER 50:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30"/>Enti ne mmerante bɛtotɔ wɔ mmɔnten so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">wɔbɛtɔre nʼasraafo nyinaa ase saa da no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 50:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31"/>“Hwɛ, mikyi wo; ɔhantanni.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“efisɛ wo da no adu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">bere a wɔde bɛtwe wʼaso no.<verse eid="JER 50:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32"/>Ɔhantanni no behintiw na wahwe ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">obiara remmoa no mma ɔnnsɔre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">mɛto ne nkurow mu gya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">na ahyew wɔn a atwa ne ho ahyia nyinaa.”<verse eid="JER 50:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“Wɔhyɛ Israelfo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">na Yudafo nso saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Wɔn nnommumfafo no kura wɔn dennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">a wɔmpɛ sɛ wogyaa wɔn ma wɔkɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34"/>Nanso wɔn Gyefo yɛ ɔhoɔdenfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Obedi wɔn asɛm ama wɔn anibere so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">sɛnea ɔde ahotɔ bɛba wɔn asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">na wɔn a wɔte Babilonia no nea wahyɛ wɔn ahometew.<verse eid="JER 50:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35"/>“Afoa a etia Babiloniafo!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">“etia wɔn a wɔte Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">na etia nʼadwumayɛfo ne nʼanyansafo!<verse eid="JER 50:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36"/>Afoa a etia nʼatoro adiyifo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Wɔbɛdan nkwaseafo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Afoa a etia nʼakofo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Ehu bɛhyɛ wɔn ma.<verse eid="JER 50:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37"/>Afoa a etia nʼapɔnkɔ ne ne nteaseɛnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">ne ananafo a wɔwɔ wɔn mu nyinaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Wɔbɛdan mmea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Afoa a etia nʼademude!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Wɔbɛfom.<verse eid="JER 50:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38"/>Ɔyow wɔ nʼasu ahorow so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Ɛbɛyoyow.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Efisɛ ɛyɛ ahoni asase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">ahoni a ehu bɛma wɔabobɔ adam.<verse eid="JER 50:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39"/>“Enti sare so mmoa ne mpataku bɛtena hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">na ɛhɔ na patu bɛtena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Obiara rentena so bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">efi awo ntoatoaso kosi awo ntoatoaso.<verse eid="JER 50:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40"/>Sɛnea Onyankopɔn tuu Sodom ne Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">ne wɔn nkurow gui no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">“saa ara na obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">onipa biara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 50:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41"/>“Monhwɛ! Asraafo bi fi atifi fam reba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">ɔman kɛse ne ahemfo bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">wɔrehwanyan wɔn afi nsase ano.<verse eid="JER 50:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42"/>Wokurakura bɛmma ne mpeaw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">wɔn tirim yɛ den, na wonni ahummɔbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Wɔn nnyigyei te sɛ po a ɛworo so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">Sɛ wɔtete wɔn apɔnkɔ so a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">wɔba sɛ mmarima a wɔrekɔ sa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">abɛtow ahyɛ wo so, Ɔbabea Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 50:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43"/>Babiloniahene ate wɔn ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ne nsa sesa ne ho kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Ahohiahia akyekyere no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ɔyaw a ɛte sɛ ɔbea a ɔrekyem wɔ awo so.<verse eid="JER 50:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44"/>Sɛnea gyata a ofi Yordan nkyɛkyerɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">rekɔ adidibea frɔmfrɔm no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">saa ara na mɛtaa Babilonia fi nʼasase so wɔ bere tiaa bi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Hena ne nea mayi no sɛ ɔnyɛ eyi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Hena na ɔte sɛ me, na hena na obetumi ne me adi asi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Na oguanhwɛfo bɛn na obetumi asɔre atia me?”<verse eid="JER 50:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45"/>Enti tie nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyehyɛ atia Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">nea wabɔ ne tirim sɛ ɔbɛyɛ de atia Babiloniafo asase ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Nguankuw no mu nkumaa no wɔbɛtwe wɔn akɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">wɔn nti ɔbɛsɛe adidibea no koraa.<verse eid="JER 50:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46"/>Babilonia nnommumfa nnyigyei bɛma asase awosow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:46">ne nteɛteɛmu gyegyeegye wɔ amanaman no mu.<verse eid="JER 50:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Monhwɛ, mɛkanyan ɔsɛefo bi honhom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">atia Babilonia ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Leb Kamai.<verse eid="JER 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2"/>Mɛsoma ananafo akɔ Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">sɛ wonkohuhuw ne so na wɔnsɛe nʼasase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">wobetia no wɔ afanan nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">wɔ nʼamanehunu da no.<verse eid="JER 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3"/>Mma agyantowni pema nʼagyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">mma ɔnhyɛ ne nkatabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Mma ne mmerante mfa wɔn ho nni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">sɛe nʼasraafo no pasaa.<verse eid="JER 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4"/>Wɔbɛhwehwe ase a wɔatotɔ wɔ Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">a wɔapirapira yiye wɔ ne mmɔnten so.<verse eid="JER 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5"/>Na Israel Nyankopɔn, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">nnyaw Israel ne Yuda hɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">ɛwɔ mu, afɔdi ahyɛ wɔn asase no so ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">wɔ Israel Ɔkronkronni no anim.<verse eid="JER 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6"/>“Munguan mfi Babilonia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Muntu mmirika mpere mo nkwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Mommma wɔnnsɛe mo esiane ne bɔne nti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aweretɔbere aso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">ɔde nea ɛfata no betua no ka.<verse eid="JER 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7"/>Na Babilonia yɛ sikakɔkɔɔ kuruwa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ɔmaa asase nyinaa bow nsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Aman no nom ne nsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ɛno nti, afei wɔabobɔ adam.<verse eid="JER 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8"/>Babilonia bɛhwe ase abubu mpofirim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">Muntwa ne ho agyaadwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Mompɛ ne yaw no ano aduru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">ebia ne ho bɛtɔ no.<verse eid="JER 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9"/>“ ‘Anka yɛbɛsa Babilonia yare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">nanso wontumi nsa no yare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">momma yennyaw no hɔ na obiara nkɔ nʼankasa asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">efisɛ nʼatemmu du sorosoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">ɛforo soro te sɛ omununkum.’<verse eid="JER 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10"/>“ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> abu yɛn bem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">Mommra, momma yɛnka wɔ Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn ayɛ.’<verse eid="JER 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11"/>“Monsew agyan no ano!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">Momfa nkatabo no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahwanyan Mede ahemfo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">efisɛ ne botae ne sɛ ɔbɛsɛe Babilonia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtɔ were,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">ɔbɛtɔ were ama nʼasɔrefi no.<verse eid="JER 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12"/>Mompagyaw frankaa bi ntia Babilonia afasu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Mummia bammɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">momma awɛmfo no nnyinagyina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Munsiesie ahintawee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nʼatirimpɔw aba mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">nea wahyɛ atia Babilonia no.<verse eid="JER 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13"/>Mo a motete nsuwansuwa bebree ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">na nnwetɛbona abu mo so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">mo awiei aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">bere a ɛsɛ sɛ wotwa mo kyene no.<verse eid="JER 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, aka ne ho ntam sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">mede nnipa bɛhyɛ wo ma sɛ tɛwtɛw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">na wɔabɔ ose wɔ wo so.<verse eid="JER 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15"/>“Ɔde ne tumi bɔɔ asase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">ɔtoo wiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">na ɔde ne nhumu trɛw ɔsorosoro mu.<verse eid="JER 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16"/>Sɛ ɔbobɔ mu a, ɔsoro nsu woro so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so fi nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Ɔsoma anyinam ka osu ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">na ɔma mframa bɔ fi ne koradan mu.<verse eid="JER 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17"/>“Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na onni nimdeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">sikadwumfo biara anim gu ase, esiane nʼahoni nti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Ne nsɛsode yɛ atoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">wonni ɔhome biara wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JER 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18"/>Wɔn so nni mfaso, wɔn ho yɛ serew;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">sɛ wɔn atemmu du so a, wɔbɛyera.<verse eid="JER 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19"/>Nea ɔyɛ Yakob Kyɛfa no nte sɛ eyinom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">efisɛ ɔno ne ade nyinaa Yɛfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">a Israel, abusua a ɛyɛ nʼagyapade nso ka ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20"/>“Woyɛ me ko abaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">mʼakode a mede kɔ sa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">mede wo dwerɛw amanaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">mede wo sɛe ahenni bebree,<verse eid="JER 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21"/>mede wo bobɔ ɔpɔnkɔ ne ne sotefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">teaseɛnam ne ne kafo,<verse eid="JER 51:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22"/>mede wo dwerɛw ɔbarima ne ɔbea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">mede wo dwerɛw akwakoraa ne ɔbabun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">mede wo dwerɛw aberante ne ababaa,<verse eid="JER 51:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23"/>mede wo dwerɛw oguanhwɛfo ne nguankuw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">mede wo dwerɛw okuafo ne anantwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">mede wo dwerɛw amradofo ne adwumayɛfo.<verse eid="JER 51:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24"/>“Metua Babilonia ne wɔn a wɔtete Babilonia ka wɔ mfomso a, wɔayɛ wɔ Sion nyinaa, wɔ wʼanim,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 51:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25"/>“Bepɔw sɛefo, me ne wo anya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">wo a wosɛe asase nyinaa no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">“Mɛteɛ me nsa wɔ wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">mepia wo afi abotan no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">na mayɛ wo sɛ bepɔw a ɛnka hwee.<verse eid="JER 51:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26"/>Wɔremfa ɔbo biara mfi wo so nyɛ tweatibo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">anaasɛ fapem mpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">efisɛ wobɛda mpan afebɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 51:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27"/>“Momma frankaa so wɔ asase no so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Monhyɛn torobɛnto no wɔ amanaman no mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Munsiesie amanaman no mma wontu no so sa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Momfrɛfrɛ saa ahenni ahorow yi mma wɔnko ntia no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Ararat, Mini ne Askenas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Munnyi ɔsahene ntia no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">momfa apɔnkɔ manyamanya te sɛ tɛwtɛw mmra.<verse eid="JER 51:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28"/>Munsiesie amanaman no mma wontu no so sa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">mo Mede ahemfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">wɔn amradofo ne wɔn adwumayɛfo nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">ne aman a wodi so nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 51:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29"/>Asase no wosow, na onukunuku ne mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atirimpɔw a etia Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">sɛ ɔbɛsɛe Babilonia asase a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">obiara rentumi ntena so no nsakraa ɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30"/>Babilonia dɔmmarima agyae ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">wɔhyehyɛ wɔn aban mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Wɔn ahoɔden asa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">wɔayɛ sɛ mmea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Wɔatoto nʼatenae ahorow no mu gya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">na wɔabubu nʼapon akyi adaban.<verse eid="JER 51:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31"/>Abɔfo didi so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">na asomafo didi so a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">wɔrekɔbɔ Babiloniahene amanneɛ se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">wɔafa ne kuropɔn no,<verse eid="JER 51:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32"/>wɔagye asutwabea ahorow a ɛdeda asubɔnten no ano no afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">na wɔde ogya ato ɔwora no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">na asraafo no abɔ huboa.”<verse eid="JER 51:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">“Babilonia Babea ayɛ sɛ, awiporowbea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">wɔ bere a wɔretiatia hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">Aka kakraa bi, na bere a ɛsɛ sɛ wotwa no sɛ nnɔbae no adu.”<verse eid="JER 51:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34"/>“Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar adwerɛw yɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">ɔde yɛn ato ɔhaw mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">wayɛ yɛn sɛ ahina a hwee nni mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Wamene yɛn sɛ ɔwɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">na ɔde yɛn nneɛma a ɛyɛ dɛ ahyɛ ne yafunu ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">na wapuw yɛn afi nʼanom agu.<verse eid="JER 51:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35"/>Ma ayakayakade a wɔde dii yɛn honam no mmra Babilonia so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">nnipa a wɔtete Sion na wɔka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Ma yɛn mogya ngu wɔn a wɔtete Babilonia so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">Yerusalem na ɔka.<verse eid="JER 51:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36"/>Enti sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Hwɛ, medi mo asɛm ama mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">na matɔ were ama mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Mɛma po a ɛyɛ ne de no ayow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">na mama ne nsubɔnten ayoyow.<verse eid="JER 51:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37"/>Babilonia bɛyɛ mmubui siw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">sakraman atu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">ahodwiriwde ne fɛwdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">baabi a obiara nte.<verse eid="JER 51:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38"/>Ne nkurɔfo nyinaa bobɔ mu sɛ gyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">wɔbobɔ mu te sɛ gyatamma.<verse eid="JER 51:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39"/>Nanso bere a wɔahwanyan wɔn ho no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">mɛto pon ama wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">na mama wɔabobow nsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">sɛnea wɔde nteɛteɛmu bedi ahurusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">na wɔadeda a wɔrennyan bio,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 51:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40"/>“Mede wɔn bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">te sɛ nguantenmma a wɔrekokum wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">te sɛ adwennini ne mpapo.<verse eid="JER 51:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41"/>“Sɛnea wɔbɛfa Sesak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">wɔbɛfa asase nyinaa so ahohoahoa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Babilonia bɛyɛ ahodwiriwde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">wɔ amanaman no mu!<verse eid="JER 51:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42"/>Po bebunkam afa Babilonia so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">na nʼasorɔkye bɛkata ne so.<verse eid="JER 51:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43"/>Ne nkurow bɛda mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">nweatam a so awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">asase a obiara nte so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">na obiara ntu kwan mfa so.<verse eid="JER 51:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44"/>Mɛtwe Bel aso wɔ Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">na mama wapuw nea wamene agu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Amanaman no rento santen nkɔ ne nkyɛn bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Na Babilonia fasu bebubu.<verse eid="JER 51:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45"/>“Me nkurɔfo, mumfi ne mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Muntu mmirika mpere mo nkwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Munguan mfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuwhyew ano.<verse eid="JER 51:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46"/>Mommma mo koma ntu na munnsuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">sɛ mote huhuhuhu wɔ asase no so a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">huhuhuhu ba afe yi na foforo ba afe a ɛbɛba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">basabasayɛ ho huhuhuhu wɔ asase no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">ɛfa ɔhene a ɔsɔre tia ɔfoforo ho.<verse eid="JER 51:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47"/>Na ampa ara bere no bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">a mɛtwe Babilonia ahoni aso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">nʼasase no nyinaa anim begu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">na nʼatɔfo nyinaa bɛtotɔ ase wɔ ne so.<verse eid="JER 51:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48"/>Ɔsoro ne asase ne nea ɛwɔ mu nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">de ahosɛpɛw bɛteɛ mu agu Babilonia so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">efisɛ ɔsɛefo befi atifi fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">abɛtow ahyɛ ne so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 51:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ Babilonia hwe ase, esiane Israel atɔfo nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">sɛnea atɔfo a wɔwɔ wiase nyinaa ahwehwe ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">esiane Babilonia nti no.<verse eid="JER 51:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50"/>Mo a mo aguan afi afoa ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">monkɔ, na monntwentwɛn mo nan ase!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Monkae <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ akyirikyiri asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">na munnwen Yerusalem ho.”<verse eid="JER 51:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51"/>“Wɔagu yɛn anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">efisɛ wayeyaw yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">na fɛre akata yɛn anim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">efisɛ ananafo ahyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi kronkronbea ahorow hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 51:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52"/>“Nanso nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">“a mɛtwe nʼahoni aso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">na nʼasase so nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">apirafo besi apini.<verse eid="JER 51:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53"/>Sɛ Babilonia kɔka soro mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">na omiamia nʼaban tenten bammɔ mu a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">mɛsoma ɔsɛefo ne no abedi asi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ose.<verse eid="JER 51:53"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54"/>“Osu nnyigyei bi fi Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">ɔsɛe kɛse bi nnyigyei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">fi Babiloniafo asase so.<verse eid="JER 51:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛsɛe Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">ɔbɛma nʼasotuatua nnyigyei no agyae.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Atamfo a wɔte sɛ ahum betu sɛ nsu akɛse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">wɔn mmubomu bɛyɛ gyegyeegye.<verse eid="JER 51:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56"/>Ɔsɛefo bi bɛsɔre atia Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">wɔbɛfa ne dɔmmarima nnommum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">na wobebubu wɔn tadua mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔhyɛ anan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">obetua so ka pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57"/>Mɛma nʼadwumayɛfo ne nʼanyansafo abow nsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">nʼamradonom, ne mpanyimfo ne dɔmmarima nso saa ara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">wɔbɛdeda afebɔɔ a wɔrennyan,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">sɛɛ na ɔhempɔn a ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, no se.<verse eid="JER 51:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Wobedwiriw Babilonia afasu a ɛtrɛw no agu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">na wɔbɛto nʼapon atenten no mu gya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">nnipa no haw wɔn ho kwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">ɔman no adwumayɛ ma ogya no dɛw mmom.”<verse eid="JER 51:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59"/>Eyi ne asɛm a Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Neria babarima Seraia a ɔyɛ adwumayɛfo panyin na ɔyɛ Maseia nena no, bere a ɔne Yudahene Sedekia kɔɔ Babilonia wɔ nʼadedi afe a ɛto so anan no mu. <verse eid="JER 51:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60"/>Na Yeremia akyerɛw amanehunu a ɛbɛba Babilonia so no nyinaa agu nhoma mmobɔwee so, nea wakyerɛw a ɛfa Babilonia ho nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 51:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ Seraia se, “Sɛ wudu Babilonia a, hwɛ sɛ wobɛkenkan saa nsɛm yi nyinaa sɛnea obiara bɛte. <verse eid="JER 51:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62"/>Afei ka se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woaka se wobɛsɛe beae yi sɛnea onipa anaa aboa biara rentumi ntena so; na ɛbɛda mpan afebɔɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63"/>Sɛ wokenkan nhoma mmobɔwee yi wie a, kyekyere fam ɔbo ho, na tow kyene Asubɔnten Eufrate mu. <verse eid="JER 51:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64"/>Afei ka se, ‘Sɛɛ na Babilonia ne ne nkurɔfo bɛmem a wɔrensɔre bio, esiane amanehunu a mede bɛba ne so no nti.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Yeremia nsɛm no awiei ni.<verse eid="JER 51:64"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Asehwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1"/>Sedekia dii ade no, na wadi mfirihyia aduonu baako. Odii ade wɔ Yerusalem mfirihyia dubaako. Na ne na din de Hamutal a ɔyɛ Yeremia a ofi Libna no babea. <verse eid="JER 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2"/>Ɔyɛɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so, sɛnea Yehoiakim yɛe no. <verse eid="JER 52:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw nti na eyinom nyinaa baa Yerusalem ne Yuda so, na akyiri no, oyii nʼani fii wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Afei, Sedekia sɔre tiaa Babiloniahene.<verse eid="JER 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4"/>Ɔsram Tebet (bɛyɛ Ɔpɛpɔn) da a ɛto so dunum wɔ Sedekia ahenni mfe akron so no, ɔhene Nebukadnessar dii nʼakofo nyinaa anim, bɛko tiaa Yerusalem. Wotwaa kuropɔn no ho hyiae. Wɔbobɔɔ mpampim wɔ kuropɔn no afasu ho. <verse eid="JER 52:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5"/>Wotuaa kuropɔn no kosii Ɔhene Sedekia adedi afe a ɛto so dubaako no mu.<verse eid="JER 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6"/>Eduu ɔsram a ɛto so anan no da a ɛto so akron no, na ɔkɔm a asi kuropɔn no mu no ano ayɛ den a mu nnipa no nnya aduan nni. <verse eid="JER 52:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7"/>Na wɔpaee kuropɔn no fasu mu, na asraafo no nyinaa guanee. Wɔfaa ɔhene turo mu fii kuropɔn no mu anadwo, kɔfaa ɔpon a ɛwɔ afasu abien no ntam, de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Araba. <verse eid="JER 52:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8"/>Nanso Babilonia asraafo no taa Ɔhene Sedekia kɔtoo no wɔ Yeriko tataw so. Na nʼasraafo no nyinaa afi ne ho abɔ ahwete, <verse eid="JER 52:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9"/>na wɔkyeree no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:9">Wɔfaa no dommum de no kɔmaa Babiloniahene wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat asase so, na hɔ na obuu no atɛn. <verse eid="JER 52:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10"/>Ribla hɔ na Babiloniahene kunkum Sedekia mmabarima wɔ nʼanim na okum Yudafo adwumayɛfo nyinaa nso. <verse eid="JER 52:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11"/>Afei otutuu Sedekia ani, de kɔbere mfrafrae mpokyerɛ guu no sɛ ɔde no rekɔ Babilonia, hɔ na ɔde no too afiase kosii ne wuda.<verse eid="JER 52:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12"/>Ab ɔsram (bɛyɛ Ɔsannaa) da ɛto so dunan wɔ afe a ɛyɛ Nebukadnessar mfe dunkron adedi mu no, Nebusaradan a ɔyɛ awɛmfo so panyin a ɔyɛ Babiloniahene mpanyimfo no mu baako no kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 52:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13"/>Ɔde ogya too <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, ahemfi ne afi a ɛwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa mu. Ɔhyew ofi biara a edi mu. <verse eid="JER 52:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14"/>Awɛmfo so panyin no hwɛ maa Babilonia asraafo no bubuu Yerusalem afasu no. <verse eid="JER 52:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a na otua awɛmfo no ano no faa wɔn a wodi hia no mu bi, wɔn a wɔkaa kuropɔn no mu, adwumfo a wɔaka ne wɔn a wɔkɔdɔm Babiloniahene no kɔɔ nnommum mu. <verse eid="JER 52:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16"/>Nanso Nebusaradan gyaa wɔn a wodi hia wɔ asase no so no nkae sɛ wɔnhwɛ bobe nturo ne mfuw no.<verse eid="JER 52:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17"/>Babiloniafo no bubuu kɔbere mfrafrae afadum, nnyinasode a wotumi moma so ne kɔbere mfrafrae Po a na ɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu, na wɔde kɔbere mfrafrae no nyinaa kɔɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 52:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18"/>Afei wɔfaa nkuku, nsofi, kanea ntamabamma ntwitwaso, ɔpete nkuruwa, nsanka, mprɛte ne kɔbere mfrafrae nneɛma a wɔde yɛ ɔsom adwuma wɔ asɔredan mu no nso kɔe. <verse eid="JER 52:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19"/>Ɔhene awɛmfo sahene no faa nkankyee, nkankyee ntrantraa, ɔpete nkuruwa, nkuku, kaneannua, nsanka, mprɛte ne nkuruwa a wɔde di ɔnom afɔrebɔ ho dwuma no kɔe; wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ankasa anaa dwetɛ na ɛyɛɛ eyinom nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 52:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20"/>Kɔbere mfrafrae a wɔde yɛɛ afadum abien no, Po no ne anantwinini dumien a ɛwɔ nʼase ne nnyinaso a wɔmema so, na wontumi nkari saa nneɛma a Ɔhene Salomo yɛɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu yi mu duru. <verse eid="JER 52:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21"/>Na afadum no biara sorokɔ yɛ anammɔn aduonu ason na ne dantaban mu nso yɛ anammɔn dunwɔtwe. Emu da tokuru na ne hankare no mu piw yɛ nsateaa anan. <verse eid="JER 52:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22"/>Na kɔbere mfrafrae ntaaso a esi ɔfadum baako so no sorokɔ yɛ anammɔn ason ne fa a, wɔde kɔbere mfrafrae atoaa ahyehyɛ ho nyinaa ahyia. Afadum a aka no nso a wɔde kɔbere mfrafrae atoaa ahyehyɛ ho no te sɛ baako no. <verse eid="JER 52:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23"/>Na Kɔbere mfrafrae atoaa aba a ɛsensɛn ntaaso no ano no yɛ aduɔkron asia, na nea ɛkata ntaaso no ho yɛ ɔha.<verse eid="JER 52:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24"/>Awɛmfo no sahene no faa ɔsɔfopanyin Seraia, abediakyiri Sefania ne ɔponanoahwɛfo baasa no nnommum. <verse eid="JER 52:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25"/>Ɔfaa ɔpanyin a otua asraafo no ano, ne adehye afotufo baason fii nnipa a na wɔda so wɔ kuropɔn no mu no mu. Afei ɔfaa ɔkyerɛwfo a na ɔyɛ adwumayɛfo panyin ma wɔn a wɔfa nnipa ma wɔkɔyɛ asraafo wɔ asase no so, ne nʼadwumayɛfo no mu aduosia a ohuu wɔn wɔ kuropɔn no mu no. <verse eid="JER 52:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan de wɔn nyinaa kɔɔ Babiloniahene anim wɔ Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27"/>Ɔhene no ma wokunkum wɔn wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Enti wotwaa Yuda asu fii nʼasase so.<verse eid="JER 52:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28"/>Nnipa dodow a Nebukadnessar de wɔn kɔɔ nkoasom mu ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:28"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 52:28">nʼahenni afe a ɛto so ason mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:28">Yudafo 3,023;<verse eid="JER 52:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29"/>Nebukadnessar ahenni afe a ɛto so dunwɔtwe mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:29">nnipa a wofi Yerusalem, 832;<verse eid="JER 52:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30"/>nʼahenni afe a ɛto so aduonu abiɛsa mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">ɔsahene Nebusaradan, a otua ɔhene awɛmfo ano no de Yudafo 745 kɔɔ nnommum mu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:30"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="JER 52:30">Nnipa no nyinaa dodow yɛ 4,600.<verse eid="JER 52:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wogyaa Yehoiakyin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31"/>Yudahene Yehoiakyin nnommumfa afe a ɛto so aduasa ason mu a Ewil-Merodak bɛyɛɛ Babiloniahene no, oyii Yudahene Yehoiakyin fii afiase wɔ ɔsram a ɛto so dumien no da a ɛto so aduonu anum. <verse eid="JER 52:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32"/>Ɔkaa abodwosɛm kyerɛɛ no, na ɔmaa no dibea a ɛwɔ anuonyam sen ahemfo a wɔne no wɔ Babilonia no de. <verse eid="JER 52:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33"/>Enti Yehoiakin yii nʼafiase ntade guu nkyɛn, na efi saa da no odidii wɔ ɔhene didipon so bere biara, kosii ne wuda. <verse eid="JER 52:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34"/>Na Babiloniahene no san maa Yehoiakin sika bere ano bere ano, ma ɔde tuatua ne ho aka, kosii ne wuda.<verse eid="JER 52:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52"/>
</usx>
